window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4701,"title":"Chapter 4701: A Very Intriguing Story (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4701: A Very Intriguing Story (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Moreover, it was fine if Li Moying didn’t say it but now that he mentioned his ankle, he felt a sharp pain assaulting him, so painful that he couldn’t help but shiver.","“Hiss...My leg!”","How did he treat a person like Li Moying as a brother in the past?","This guy was clearly a bastard who had no humanity!","When Huang Yueli saw this scene, how could she not know what had happened?","She glared at her husband angrily.” Husband, you... It’s not easy for us to see","Senior Brother, you... Sigh!”","She wanted to talk about Li Moying properly but on second thought, her husband had always been so petty and after she said it out, if he were to secretly find trouble with Liu Buyan, she wouldn’t be able to guard against it.","Luckily Li Moying had some sense of propriety so she could only let it go.","Huang Yueli glared at him again and turned around to squat beside Liu Buyan. She asked with concern: ” Senior Brother, are you alright? Did you fall badly? Those Black Tortoise clansmen attacked very heavily just now. Are you injured anywhere?”","Hearing his Junior Sister’s sweet and gentle voice, Liu Buyan was almost moved to tears.","As expected, Junior Sister was the one who treated him really well!","Unlike Li Moying this beast...","Huang Yueli saw that he was staring at her without saying a word and was a little worried,” Senior Brother, how’s your leg? Did you sprain it again? Let me have a look?”","As she said that, she wanted to grab Liu Buyan’s leg.","Liu Buyan was originally still immersed in his emotions but when he saw Huang Yueli stretch out her hand towards him, he was so frightened that he hurriedly used both his hands and feet as he leaped up from the ground.","“No, no, no. No need, Junior Sister! There’s really no need. I don’t... It’s nothing serious! Besides, even if I’m injured, I’ll take a look myself. My medical skills are still better than yours.”","When Liu Buyan stood up earlier, he had once again affected the sprained part of his ankle and for a moment, his face was twisted in pain.","However, he quickly maintained his calm expression as he braced himself and pretended as though nothing had happened, rejecting Huang Yueli’s good intentions.","What a joke, the instant Huang Yueli stretched out her hand, he could clearly feel a cold and extremely powerful pressure coming from behind him...","If his Junior Sister touched his foot, he would be chopped into pieces by a certain someone, right?","Speaking of which, did Li Moying still remember that they were sworn brothers? Was there anyone as rebellious as him?","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes as she was momentarily speechless but since Liu Buyan had already said that he was fine, she didn’t feel conflicted. Looking at","Liu Buyan sitting back down on the chair, she also sat down at the other table.","“Senior Brother, I really didn’t expect that we would meet here. Of course, I didn’t expect that you would be chased everywhere...What’s going on with you? When you parted with us, didn’t you say that you wanted to go to White Fen Continent to learn medicine? Why wasn’t he in the White Fen Continent but in the Empyrean Fox Continent? You even offended the Black Tortoise Clan?”","Huang Yueli frowned and the moment she opened her mouth, it was a series of questions.","It wasn’t that she liked to ask so many questions but it was just that Liu Buyan’s performance today had really surprised her.","Logically speaking, although Liu Buyan wasn’t considered a famous Divine Doctor in the God Realm, but he was at least an Earth Grade High Rank Spirit Medicine Master so ordinary people wouldn’t be willing to offend Spirit Medicine Masters.","To be pursued by an elite team of the Ancient God Clan, something big must have happened.","But no matter how Huang Yueli thought about it, she couldn’t understand what kind of trouble Liu Buyan could stir up?"]},{"number":4702,"title":"Chapter 4702: A Very Intriguing Story (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4702: A Very Intriguing Story (3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Liu Buyan heard this question, he couldn’t help but let out a long sigh.","“Sigh, Junior Sister, I... I also didn’t want to be so embarrassing in front of you and Moying, but...Sigh, in short, this matter is really...l don’t know how to explain it either. I still don’t understand how I got into this situation...”","When Huang Yueli heard this, she was even more confused,” What exactly is the situation?”","“Actually...”","Liu Buyan opened his mouth and was just about to explain when he suddenly thought of something and smacked his head,” Oh no! Not good! I almost forgot something important! Junior Sister, Moying, I’ll have to trouble the both of you to come with me first to save someone. We have to go immediately, I’m afraid that something might happen if we delay...’","Huang Yueli was startled and almost couldn’t react, ” What? You want to save someone? Save who?”","“Sigh, there’s no time to explain in detail now. Let’s hurry up and leave!”","When Liu Buyan finished speaking, he couldn’t care about anything else as he turned around and walked towards the door.","However, as soon as he got up, he felt a pain in his ankle and almost fell to the ground again.","Huang Yueli hurriedly stretched out her hand to support him,” Senior Brother, what are you anxious about? Let’s talk things out! Who do you want to save? I’ll bring the person back. You just have to wait here...’ “No, I have to go myself. Otherwise, you won’t be able to find the place.” Liu Buyan endured the pain as he stood up and walked out.","“But, although the injury on your foot is not serious, you still have to recuperate. Besides, how are you going to go like this?” Huang Yueli couldn’t help but frown.","Seeing Liu Buyan’s determined look, she could only give in,” Alright, I’ll bring","you..","Huang Yueli hadn’t finished speaking when suddenly, an arm stretched out from behind Liu Buyan and grabbed his collar.","Li Moying stood expressionlessly between the two of them, ” I’ll bring him over!”","Huang Yueli looked at her husband’s deliberate action of pulling Liu Buyan away and felt amused as she shook her head secretly. But she said,” Alright then, there’s no problem. Senior Brother, where is the person you are looking for? Let’s go now!”","The three of them did not delay and immediately left the inn.","Liu Buyan was led by Li Moying to lead the way while Huang Yueli followed closely behind them.","They went straight out of Snowflake City’s city gate and headed east, entering a dense forest.","In the dense forest of the outskirts, there were often spirit beasts appearing and there were even some unexpected dangers. Although this wasn’t considered much to cultivators like Huang Yueli and Li Moying, but looking at Liu Buyan’s direction which was getting deeper and deeper into the dense forest, Huang Yueli was still somewhat worried.","“Senior Brother, where are you taking us...Wait, stop! There seems to be a concealment array ahead. It might be dangerous!”","Huang Yueli had just finished speaking when Liu Buyan shook his head, ”","There’s no danger, that array is...My friend set it up. You guys just follow me. She’s in the array and is very seriously injured now.”","As Liu Buyan said that, he stretched out his hand and struck out a hand seal. The concealment array instantly lost its effectiveness, revealing a cave entrance hidden under the array.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying exchanged a glance as they followed suit and walked in.","The cave looked very small and dark. There was a cushion on the ground, and an unconscious woman was on the cushion.","The moment Liu Buyan entered the cave, he immediately took out a few bottles of pills and placed them in front of the woman as he stuffed them into her mouth.."]},{"number":4703,"title":"Chapter 4703: A Very Intriguing Story (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4703: A Very Intriguing Story (4)","Translator: Miqtv Cloud Translations Editor: Miqtv Cloud Translations","The young woman’s face was flushed red and she looked like she was in great pain. She kept moaning softly.","Even though Liu Buyan had already stuffed the pill into her mouth, she still kept on spitting it out.","Liu Buyan frowned,” You...” Can’t you endure it and take the medicine? Take it! Are you not thinking about it? Sigh, damn it!”","Just as Liu Buyan was feeding her the medicine, Huang Yueli kept staring at this young lady and after a while, her eyes widened in shock,” I say, Senior Brother, you...Are you serious?”","“No wonder the people of the Black Tortoise Clan chased after you with all their might. You... Did you abduct Xuan Qingling, the top three genius of the Black","Tortoise Clan?”","Huang Yueli’s jaw almost fell to the ground.","To be honest, although she and Li Moying were the most outstanding geniuses in the younger generation of the twelve continents in the God Realm, but she didn’t know many cultivators of the same generation. Other than Jing Shaoyuan who was not afraid of death and came to look for a beating every day, she only had some friendship with Xuan Qingling.","Although this Heaven Grade genius of the Black Tortoise Clan was from a branch family, her talent was even higher than that of the direct line. Not only was she extremely powerful, but she was also a Spiritual Armament Master.","Huang Yueli had met her a few times and her impression of her was pretty good.","When Liu Buyan heard this, his face turned red but immediately following that, he shook his head vigorously and denied,” Junior Sister, you...Can you not talk nonsense! Young Miss Xuan and I...lt’s not what you think! You...!” He scratched his head in frustration as he lamented.","“Sigh, it’s fine if those Black Tortoise Clan fellows misunderstand, but why do you say so?”","Huang Yueli nodded thoughtfully,” Oh? Those Black Tortoise clansmen have been chasing you because you eloped with Xuan Qingling? I didn’t expect you to be so capable, Senior Brother. Even a heaven-grade genius like Xuan Qingling was willing to give up her family and elope with you!”","She smiled as she winked at Liu Buyan and said with a mischievous smile: ” Tsk tsk, you’re a famous dissolute noble young master in Soaring Heavens","Continent. When you came to the God Realm, your skills didn’t decline at all!”","Liu Buyan was about to vomit blood,” I’m not, I didn’t, don’t spout nonsense! Xuan Qingling and I are really not what you think! I’ve really been unlucky for eight lifetimes before I met her. Every time I meet her, I’m in big trouble... How could I elope with her?”","Huang Yueli saw that Liu Buyan was really anxious so she turned a little more serious but her face still carried a faint smile.","“Alright, alright, I was just joking. Of course I know that even if you want to kidnap someone else, Xuan Qingling won’t go with you! So you don’t have to worry that I’ll misunderstand. However, the people of the Black Tortoise Clan shouldn’t have misunderstood. What did you do to make them have such thoughts?”","Actually, Huang Yueli didn’t need to ask much. Just from common sense, Xuan Qingling wouldn’t elope with Liu Buyan.","That was because the cultivation resources in the God Realm were basically in the hands of the various large families and sects. One could not even find a high-grade cultivation technique secret manual outside.","For a heaven-grade genius like Xuan Qingling, the clan’s cultivation resources were too important. Without the support of the clan, she would not be able to improve her strength on her own.","So let alone Liu Buyan trying his best to deny that the two of them had any relationship, even if the two of them really had feelings for each other, Xuan Qingling would not give up on her future and elope with Liu Buyan.","These cultivators in the God Realm were different from those in the Lower Realms. Regarding the matters of love, they did not take it that seriously.."]},{"number":4704,"title":"Chapter 4704: A Very Intriguing Story (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4704: A Very Intriguing Story (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","To the young cultivators of the God Realm, raising one’s own strength and status in the family clan was the top priority.","Many top-notch experts were arranged by their families to marry their partners who were closest to them in terms of strength, talent, and status.","This was not only beneficial to the family, but also to dual cultivate with someone with similar talent. The effect would be better.","As for whether she had feelings for the marriage partner and whether they were compatible...Anyway, she could find someone else to relieve her loneliness before and after marriage. Who would care so much?","Precisely because of this, Huang Yueli and Li Moying were already married at such a young age and their relationship was so good, which was why it became a strange thing in the God Realm.","When Liu Buyan heard Huang Yueli’s words, he was extremely touched,” Junior Sister, you’re the one who understands me...Sigh, during this period of time, no one believed me no matter who I explained it to. I couldn’t even explain it clearly. In addition to Xuan Qingling’s current situation... Sigh! If it wasn’t for you and Moying, I really don’t know what to do!”","“Xuan Qingling and I are actually...”","Liu Buyan had just opened his mouth and wanted to explain the situation between him and Xuan Qingling but before he could finish his sentence, his peripheral vision swept over to Xuan Qingling who was lying on the soft","cushion.","Her face was red and she looked like she was in pain, as if she was enduring some unbearable torture.","And at the corner of her lips, the pill that Liu Buyan fed her earlier was spat out by her once again.","Seeing this scene, Liu Buyan’s expression suddenly changed and he couldn’t be bothered to say anything more to Huang Yueli and the rest as he immediately turned around and returned to Xuan Qingling’s side.","He knelt down against the cushion and reached out to help Xuan Qingling’s upper body up so that she could lean against his chest.","Then, he grabbed her chin and stuffed the pills back into her mouth.","Xuan Qingling’s mind was in a state of confusion and she instinctively hated the bitter taste of those pills. Even though Liu Buyan was holding her tightly, she was still twisting her neck as she felt nauseous, wanting to spit out the pills again.","Following her actions, saliva continuously flowed down from the corner of her mouth and onto Liu Buyan’s fingers.","But Liu Buyan didn’t show any trace of disdain and his expression was as usual as he firmly held her chin while using his hand to pat her back, using both carrot and stick methods to make Xuan Qingling swallow the pill.","Huang Yueli looked on from the side as her eyes went blank.","She subconsciously turned her head and communicated with her husband beside her. They both saw the same spark of interest in each other’s eyes.","Liu Buyan said earlier that he and Xuan Qingling had no ambiguous relationship and she actually believed it, she was really too naive.","Looking at their current interaction, Xuan Qingling didn’t know that this was the attitude Liu Buyan should have towards an unrelated woman?","How could she not know that Liu Buyan had mysophobia?","In the past in Liu Buyan’s medicine shop, there would be servants cleaning up every day according to the three meals and not a single speck of dust could be found in the corners so when did he become so patient as to feed medicine to others?","Moreover, looking at this posture, it seemed like her Senior Brother was very familiar with these operations!","Tsk tsk, tsk tsk!","Huang Yueli and her husband stood together hand in hand as they stared at the two of them with wide eyes, afraid that they would miss out on any details.","Such a good show was rare. It was something that could only be encountered by chance!","The only regret now was that he did not hide any melons in his space. Otherwise, it would be great to take them out and eat them while watching the show.."]},{"number":4705,"title":"Chapter 4705: A Very Intriguing Story (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4705: A Very Intriguing Story (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","After about a quarter of an hour, Liu Buyan finally succeeded in making Xuan Qingling swallow all the pills without leaving a single one behind.","He didn’t know what kind of medicinal pill Liu Buyan concocted but it seemed to be very effective.","Not long after Xuan Qingling swallowed the pill, she gradually calmed down. Her red face gradually returned to normal, and she no longer twisted her body in pain. However, she still did not wake up. After she calmed down, she seemed to have fallen asleep and did not move.","Only at this moment did Liu Buyan let out a long breath as he raised his hand to wipe the sweat off his forehead.","“Damn it, why are they acting up more and more frequently? I wonder how many days the medicine this time can last...’","His expression was very stiff. He stared at Xuan Qingling for a long time with a deep gaze. No one knew what he was thinking.","Huang Yueli really couldn’t bear to watch any longer as she coughed forcefully,” Cough cough! Senior Brother, have you forgotten about us?”","Hearing Huang Yueli’s voice, Liu Buyan’s entire body stiffened as the expression on his face instantly froze.","However, he quickly revealed a smile again.” Hehe, Junior Sister, this... How was this possible? I can’t forget the two of you even if I forget everyone! It’s really because Xuan Qingling’s condition is quite urgent. I had no choice but to take care of her first in order to save her. Don’t think too much about it...","“It’s fine. I didn’t think too much about it...” Huang Yueli said smilingly.","Her senior brother didn’t seem to notice at all that the change in his expression just now had completely betrayed him!","Li Moying’s eyes were filled with endless disdain.","Hehe, who was the one who mocked him every day back then?","He felt that he should show Liu Buyan a mirror and let him take a good look at himself!","If he couldn’t find a mirror, he could at least take a piss.","Liu Buyan felt a little guilty and didn’t dare to look at Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s expressions. When he heard Huang Yueli say that she was fine, he hurriedly went down the stairs.","“Ahem, that’s good. Where were we just now?” He rubbed his nose and forcefully changed the topic.","Huang Yueli wasn’t in a rush to expose him because she was more interested in Liu Buyan’s experiences in the past few months.","Therefore, she cooperated and said, “Just now, I mentioned that you and Miss","Xuan were misunderstood...” What’s going on?”","“Oh, oh, right, that’s right! Sigh, Junior Sister, you don’t know how unlucky I am. As long as I meet Xuan Qingling, I’ll be unlucky!” Liu Buyan gave a deep sigh,” I’d better start from the beginning. Ever since I parted ways with you, I","went to the White Lake State...”","As the family that was the best at medicine among the various god clans, the White Marsh Race had many outstanding doctors.","Because of this, even human and mixed-blood physicians gathered in the","White Pool State. The center of the White Pool State, Pillheart City, became the headquarters of the Spiritual Apothecary Guild of the Twelve Continents of the Divine World.","Liu Buyan had the heart to have some accomplishments in his medical skills so Pillheart City was a place he had no choice but to go.","In the beginning, he was still very successful.","When he arrived at Pillheart City, he happened to be in time for the high-rank elixir master certification assessment. With his own strength, he passed the assessment and successfully obtained the certification of a high-rank earth -rank elixir master.","The number of Heaven Rank Spirit Apothecaries in the Divine Realm was extremely rare. Moreover, practically all of them were provided for by large family clans. Rogue cultivators were extremely rare.","So Liu Buyan this Earth Grade High Level, outside of the Ancient Celestials, could already be considered as a top notch doctor.."]},{"number":4706,"title":"Chapter 4706: A Very Intriguing Story (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4706: A Very Intriguing Story (7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Of course, with Liu Buyan’s wild ambitions, he naturally wouldn’t be satisfied with this.","Ever since he had become an Earth Grade Advanced Spirit Alchemist, many forces had come to recruit him, but he had never considered any of them.","Because Liu Buyan’s dream was to become a true Great Divine Doctor like Zhang Lihe who had top notch medical skills and morals, and not a vassal of a major power.","Otherwise, he only needed to rely on the Sacred Phoenix Clan or Cloudy Qilin Clan. Relying on Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s relationship, it wasn’t difficult for him to be nurtured so he didn’t need to leave the two of them and go out adventuring.","Liu Buyan didn’t want to join any major powers but he was worried that he would offend others if he rejected them repeatedly so not long after he obtained the certification, he left Pillheart City quietly.","His plan was to practice medicine while he was training.","This way, not only could he improve his medical skills, but he could also earn some money.","Liu Buyan relied on his Earth Grade High Level Physician certification and his business was very good. Every time he went to a place, there would be many ?wealthy families looking for him to give a consultation.","Until one day, a little girl from the Black Tortoise Clan came to him and asked him to treat her daughter.","Liu Buyan didn’t think too much about it at that time and only thought that the so-called Young Miss was just a young practitioner of the Gods Race who was training outside so he readily agreed and went to the address the other party gave him.","The clinic was in a remote courtyard.","When Liu Buyan rushed over, there was only that little servant girl alone in the courtyard. She led Liu Buyan to the door of a bedroom and pointed inside, telling him that their Young Miss was inside and invited him in.","Liu Buyan took a few steps inside and felt that something was amiss.","This was because this so-called young lady’s boudoir was actually empty. There was no one else.","This was obviously very abnormal.","Logically speaking, there was a difference between men and women. A large faction like the ancient god clan was even more particular about this aspect.","It was fine if they were training in the wilderness, but since they were at home, they definitely would not allow a male doctor to enter the young miss’s boudoir alone. Some of the more strict big families would even require a male doctor to only take the pulse!","But there was no one else in this room?","Liu Buyan’s heart instantly started to feel uneasy as he hurriedly turned his head, wanting to ask that little servant girl at the door.","However, at this moment, the door behind him suddenly slammed shut with a bang.","Liu Buyan knew that things weren’t looking good as he immediately turned around wanting to rush out of the room but it was already too late.","No matter how hard he pushed and smashed, this seemingly thin door seemed to be made of steel. He could not move it at all.","“Damn it, let me out, let me out! What the hell are you doing? Hurry up and let me out! I’m just an ordinary doctor and I’ve never killed anyone before. Who are you? Why did you lock me up here?","Hurry up and open the door!”","However, Liu Buyan almost shouted himself hoarse but it was still silent outside, without a single sound.","He did not know if it was really empty or if the sound was blocked by the array. Just as she was at her wit’s end and confused, a soft moan suddenly came from the bed.","Liu Buyan’s heart turned cold as he suddenly recalled the reason why that little servant girl had tricked him to come over. It was to let him treat Young Miss ‘illness.","Could it be that the young lady was in the room?","He immediately turned around and walked towards the bed.."]},{"number":4707,"title":"Chapter 4707: A Very Intriguing Story (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4707: A Very Intriguing Story (8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hearing this, Huang Yueli subconsciously blurted out,” Senior Brother, you...” Are you crazy? How can you turn around and enter the room at this time? This was obviously a trap that someone had dug for you! No matter what happens in the room, you shouldn’t turn back. Just try your best to rush out!” When Liu Buyan heard this, his face instantly revealed a bitter smile as he heaved a deep sigh.","“Sigh, junior sister, if only you were by my side to remind me at that time, I... Now that I think about it, I was indeed too stupid back then. However, I don’t know why, but I couldn’t react at all at that time...”","Speaking of which, Liu Buyan wasn’t the kind of young Celestials practitioner who didn’t grow up in the clan and didn’t go through any training. He who ascended from the Lower Realms had also seen many storms and waves in Soaring Heavens Continent.","However, at that moment, he couldn’t even explain why. It was as if he had been possessed by a ghost, and he subconsciously made the most unfavorable reaction for himself.","” In short, my intuition told me that I entered the room and saw the person lying on the bed. It was Xuan Qingling.” Liu Buyan continued.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying had long expected this so they didn’t say anything and just waited quietly at the side, allowing Liu Buyan to continue speaking.","Liu Buyan replied,” Xuan Qingling and I are considered old acquaintances so the moment I saw her, I was really shocked. Moreover, her condition at that time was really a little strange. Her face was flushed and her forehead was constantly sweating, similar to the symptoms just now. My first reaction at that time was that I felt that something had gone wrong when she was cultivating and that she was in danger of going berserk.”","Because they were old acquaintances and moreover, Qi Deviation was a very dangerous situation. If the chaotic Profound Energy was not channeled back into the correct meridians in time, it might very well lead to the consequences of exploding and dying.","Liu Buyan got anxious and didn’t think too much as he lifted the blanket, wanting to save Xuan Qingling quickly.","Who knew...","” Who would have known that just as I grabbed Xuan Qingling’s wrist, she suddenly pounced on me and...”","As Liu Buyan spoke, his face flushed red as he stammered a few times before lowering his voice,”... Cough cough, he pressed me under him...”","Xuan Qingling suppressed you?” Huang Yueli’s eyes widened as she looked at him,” Why is it like this? Why is she pressing down on you? She thought you were here to harm her, so she wanted to beat you up?","Huang Yueli’s pair of big eyes flickered, filled with curiosity as she stared intently at her Senior Brother, raising a question.","Liu Buyan was originally feeling awkward and being stared at like that by her, he felt even more guilty as his face turned increasingly red as though he was about to burn up.","“Dang...Of course not...Xuan Qingling had been hit...lt hit... You know...”","“I know? What do I know? Senior Brother, you didn’t say anything. How would I know?” Huang Yueli still had the expression of a pure and innocent baby as she propped her chin with both hands and looked at Liu Buyan.","Liu Buyan was extremely embarrassed but he instead sobered up and instantly flew into a rage out of humiliation as he couldn’t help but glare at Huang Yueli.","“Junior Sister, you... You did it on purpose, didn’t you? Do you want to see me embarrassed? I don’t believe that you don’t know what happened!","You...","Why are you still asking?"]},{"number":4708,"title":"Chapter 4708: A Very Intriguing Story (9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4708: A Very Intriguing Story (9)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli was questioned but she wasn’t angry. She held her cheeks and smiled: ” Oh? What should I know? Did he know that Xuan Qingling was poisoned by the Spring Fragrance Powder, which was why she was so hot? After knowing that Xuan Qingling pressed you down on the bed, she definitely won’t let you off so easily. You can’t beat her, so you can only be pressed down on the bed to eat tofu?”","“You... You... Junior Sister...” Liu Buyan felt as though smoke was about to come out from the top of his head as he simply couldn’t believe his ears!","Since his previous life, his junior sister had been so black-bellied and venomous. Whoever was caught by her would be ridiculed to the point of wanting to kill themselves.","But in the past, Huang Yueli was more reserved in matters between men and women. After all, for a long period of time, she was still a pure and innocent young lady so she really didn’t understand this aspect.","But now?","Ever since she married Li Moying...Junior Sister’s skin had also become much thicker and one didn’t know if it was because of Li Moying’s influence.","He really dared to say anything now!","“Junior Sister, you... You’re a girl, so it’s better for you to be more reserved when you speak...” Liu Buyan lightly coughed twice, trying his best to appear calmer.","But Huang Yueli didn’t have any intention of letting him off as she continued to ask: ” I’ve indeed guessed all these things but I just can’t understand. Senior Brother you are a physician ah. Just saying the name of Spring Fragrance Powder and you’re so hesitant as if you’re about to choke to death. Wasn’t this just an ordinary potion? Even if the effect was a little special, what was there to be embarrassed about as a doctor? She wasn’t an unmarried virgin! Unless... Liu Buyan’s heart jumped as he asked subconsciously,” Unless what?”","“Unless...You have a guilty conscience!”","Huang Yueli added with a smile.","Liu Buyan’s mind buzzed as he immediately retorted,” What.... What do you mean by guilty? How could I have a guilty conscience? Junior Sister, you really think too much! I just...","I’m just worried that what happened that night will damage Xuan Qingling’s reputation, so I’m too embarrassed to say it!”","He finished speaking loudly and turned his head to glare fiercely at Huang Yueli. From his stance, it seemed as though if she didn’t believe him, he would buy a rice noodle and hang himself.","Huang Yueli found it funny and wanted to tease him but Li Moying secretly tugged at her sleeves, hinting her not to go overboard.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but roll her eyes at her husband.","Now he remembered that Liu Buyan was his brother? Why didn’t he remember when he tripped her just now?","However, Huang Yueli also wanted to know what happened after that so she didn’t go against her husband. She immediately changed her words: ” Alright alright, I was thinking too much. Then that night... Did it really happen...’","“Nothing happened, nothing happened!”","Other than his clothes being stripped off, his chest being touched, and Xuan Qingling calling him ” too weak,” nothing happened.","But such a disgraceful scene, he definitely couldn’t let Junior Sister and Li Moying know about it. Otherwise, the two of them would probably faint from laughing and they wouldn’t be able to get past this for a few hundred years.","Liu Buyan composed himself and threw away the distracting thoughts in his heart as he continued, ” We didn’t have the time to do anything. Just as I was pulled onto the bed, there was a sudden commotion from the corridor outside the door.. The door was suddenly knocked open from the outside!”"]},{"number":4709,"title":"Chapter 4709: A Very Intriguing Story (10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4709: A Very Intriguing Story (10)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","At that instant, Liu Buyan suddenly woke up.","No matter how stupid he was, he understood what had happened.","Unfortunately, he was already trapped on the bed and caught red-handed. He could not escape even if he wanted to.","As expected, the people who barged into the room were all from the Black Tortoise Clan. There were both men and women. Most of them were young people of Xuan Qingling’s generation, but there were also a few who looked like elders.","As soon as they entered the door, a middle-aged woman pointed at the two of them and scolded them. She pointed out that the two of them were an adulterer and an adulterer. They used the excuse of seeing a doctor to meet in Xuan Qingling’s room and were even caught in bed!","Liu Buyan initially wanted to explain but the other party didn’t want to listen to his explanation and interrupted him several times.","A few people took turns to speak, and in a few words, they labeled him as an “adulterer”.","The leading middle-aged woman immediately said,” This is no small matter. If the clan leader finds out that the Heaven Grade genius of the clan has an affair with a human trash, I wonder how angry he will be!” Quickly detain this adulterer and report this matter to the clan leader!”","These people seemed to have prepared beforehand as they immediately swarmed forward to capture Liu Buyan.","Although Liu Buyan tried his best to resist, but the difference in cultivation was obvious and facing several Heart Profound Realm experts attacking together, he was totally unable to resist and was soon pressed onto the ground and controlled.","Hearing till here, Huang Yueli had roughly understood the cause of the matter but there were still a few doubts in her heart that had yet to be resolved.","“Alright, I understand. These people should be here for Xuan Qingling, right? She wondered who she had offended in the family for her to be schemed against like this. And you... You should be the Undeserved Calamity?","An Earth rank high level spirit herb master doesn’t seem to have the value to be targeted like this.”","Hearing Huang Yueli’s words, Liu Buyan’s face twitched slightly.","That was true, but Junior Sister did not have to be so straightforward. It was as if he, a Spirit Apothecary, was useless...","Although, compared to Huang Yueli and Li Moying who were peerless geniuses, he was indeed not just a little noob...","Huang Yueli muttered: ” But even if you were to meet someone in private, it doesn’t seem to be a big deal right? After all, Xuan Qingling was one of the top three geniuses of the Black Tortoise Clan! This kind of thing...ls it that serious?”","For a woman, losing her virginity before marriage was indeed a big deal. However, how big the impact was also depended on the woman’s strength.","If it was just an ordinary member of the family who needed to rely on the family to be born, then regardless of gender, the value of the marriage alliance would drop by half after losing the virginity. The consequences would definitely be serious.","However, for powerful geniuses, it was not a problem. Sometimes, in order to let geniuses cultivate in peace, some factions would even specially find them a cultivation furnace for dual cultivation!","For example, Huang Yueli herself, the matter between her and Li Moying had spread to the entire Divine Realm.","But even if she and Li Moying were to be separated by the clan, it would not affect their worth at all.","The two of them were still the first choice of marriage partners for countless families in the Divine Realm.","It was just that he was strong enough!","Although Xuan Qingling didn’t have such heaven-defying talent and status as the two of them, with her status in the Black Tortoise Race, she shouldn’t be beaten up and killed just because she slept with a man, right?"]},{"number":4710,"title":"Chapter 4710: Engagement","paragraphs":["Chapter 4710: Engagement","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Liu Buyan heard this question, his brows immediately furrowed.","“Junior Sister, you might not know, but the Black Tortoise Race is so furious because Xuan Qingling just got engaged a while ago. Her fiancé is the young master of the White Marsh Race, An Zhenyu. Xuan Qingling lost her virginity before marriage. If the people of the White Marsh Clan knew about it, it would definitely cause a huge uproar. That’s why they were in a hurry to deal with me, the adulterer.”","Huang Yueli finally understood but after thinking about it carefully, she still felt that it was a little strange.","“I see. This can be explained...The Black Tortoise Clan and the White Marsh Clan are both ancient gods. The Black Tortoise Clan has a Divine General like","Xuan Jiuling in the alliance army. There are very few famous experts in the","White Marsh Clan. Logically speaking, the overall strength of the Black Tortoise Race is still above the White Marsh Race. Is there a need for them to be so afraid of the White Marsh Race getting angry?”","Liu Buyan gave a bitter smile,” I had the same question as you at the start but after Xuan Qingling woke up, she told me that the Black Tortoise Clan’s Clan Leader had gone berserk during his cultivation a few years ago and had been paralyzed in bed for many years. Initially, I thought that there was no cure but after an elder from the White Marsh Clan came to take a look, he said that it could be cured but there was a condition for him to cure the illness and that was to marry Xuan Qingling to An Zhenyu!”","“This marriage is very important to the Black Tortoise clan. If An Zhenyu is dissatisfied with Xuan Qingling’s loss of chastity before marriage and wants to break off the engagement, who will treat the Black Tortoise Clan’s patriarch?”","Huang Yueli finally came to a realization as she nodded her head,” So that’s the case. No wonder the Bai Zhe Clan’s strength is so weak but their position in the twelve ancient god clans isn’t low. Doctors are indeed a profession that we can’t afford to offend!”","As she spoke, she glanced at her husband.","Coincidentally, Li Moying also looked over at her and the two of them quickly exchanged glances.","The two of them had met the young master of the White Marsh Tribe, An Zhenyu, during the Divine Realm Martial Arts Competition. However, this person was not the number one genius of the White Marsh Tribe. In fact, there was still a huge gap between him and a top-notch heaven-grade genius like Jing Shaoyuan.","However, An Zhenyu’s bloodline was noble. He was the only son of the White Marsh Race’s patriarch and the True Dragon Race’s eldest daughter. That was why he could occupy the throne of the young master.","However, not only was his talent average, but he also looked very thin and pale. His eyes were greenish-black, and it was obvious that he had aged prematurely due to excessive indulgence. Logically speaking, he was not worthy of Xuan Qingling.","It was extremely rare to see a female Heaven Grade genius in the Divine Realm. It was already very difficult to marry a wife with similar talent as oneself. It was even more impossible to climb up to a woman with higher talent than oneself.","However, who asked him to come from a good family background? He even had the Black Tortoise Race’s weakness!","Huang Yueli was deep in thought as she pondered for a moment,” This matter is probably very complicated. Xuan Qingling was going to marry into the Bai Zhe Clan, which was supposed to be a big matter for the clan. However, the people around her had drugged her. Wasn’t this an attempt to stop the marriage? However, wouldn’t this cause the death of their clan leader? This is probably related to the internal strife of the Black Tortoise clan...","Her brows furrowed as she looked at Liu Buyan,” Senior Brother, this matter isn’t something a Spirit Apothecary like you can handle so you really shouldn’t wade into this muddy water!”","Liu Buyan’s expression was extremely ugly,” Junior Sister, what are you saying? Why don’t you think about it? This.... Do I want to get involved in this mess? What can I do? I got involved for no reason!”"]},{"number":4711,"title":"Chapter 4711: The Stench Of Fate","paragraphs":["Chapter 4711: The Stench Of Fate","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“That might not be the case...” Huang Yueli muttered to herself.","But when she saw that Liu Buyan was already extremely anxious and didn’t want to agitate him any further, she swallowed back the words that were at the tip of her tongue and returned to the main topic.","“Alright, what happened after that? Since you were all tied up, how did you escape?” Huang Yueli asked curiously.","Liu Buyan composed himself and explained,” No, the only one who was tied up was me, not including Xuan Qingling! Junior Sister, have you forgotten? I just said that Xuan Qingling was lying on the bed. Although she was poisoned with Spring Fragrance Powder, she wasn’t tied up!”","“At that time, I was already pressed to the ground and couldn’t move even if I wanted to. I thought I was definitely done for this time. I didn’t expect that at this moment, Xuan Qingling suddenly jumped up from the bed and attacked. With one move, she knocked out the Black Tortoise Race warrior who grabbed me.”","“Those people at the scene were all shocked by this unexpected change. I didn’t react in time either. After Xuan Qingling hit me, she immediately grabbed my wrist and dragged me towards the door...Fortunately, there were no guards at the door. After we rushed out of the door, we successfully escaped.”","Huang Yueli said in astonishment: ” No way? Senior Brother, aren’t you a little too useless? He was actually saved by Xuan Qingling again! I thought you would be able to show your might this time and save Xuan Qingling!”","Liu Buyan had a sullen expression,” Junior Sister, what do you mean? What do you mean ‘saved’ by her again?”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes, her face pure and innocent,” Senior Brother, have you forgotten? You were also saved by Xuan Qingling in the mystic realm last time, right? Back then, in order to protect you, she even kicked you...Cough cough, that’s a story with a taste!”","“What smell...F * ck!” Liu Buyan was stunned for a moment and when he regained his senses, he immediately revealed a constipated expression and he couldn’t help but lean against the wall and retch,” Junior Sister, you.... Aren’t you too poisonous? You...","Why did you remind me? I finally forgot about that!”","Nearly a year ago, Huang Yueli and Li Moying brought him to the Floating Sea to participate in the Divine Realm’s Martial Competition.","When they passed by a trial mystic realm, they happened to bump into the warriors of the Black Tortoise Race who were also training there. The leader was Xuan Qingling.","In the mystic realm, Liu Buyan and Xuan Qingling met up during the process of being chased by the magical beasts. In order to prevent both of them from dying in the mystic realm, Xuan Qingling poured a bottle of strong wine down Liu Buyan’s throat and when he was drunk, she kicked him into a magical beast’s manure pit, hoping to let him escape this calamity.","Later on, Huang Yueli and Li Moying arrived in time and saved their lives.","It was just that after Liu Buyan woke up, he smelled the scent on his body and it left behind a severe psychological trauma. For a period of time, he couldn’t eat anything and was so skinny that he almost became a piece of paper...","“This is your first meeting with Xuan Qingling. It’s so memorable! How could I forget about it!” Huang Yueli said smilingly.","She realized that her senior brother and Xuan Qingling were really like apes. Every time they met, it was so dramatic.","He didn’t even dare to write this in his script!","“Don’t... Stop it, you... Don’t say anymore....” Liu Buyan looked like he was about to vomit blood as his entire body twitched and his nose seemed to have caught a whiff of that suffocating smell..."]},{"number":4712,"title":"Chapter 4712: Don ‘t You Have Any Psychological Trauma?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4712: Don ‘t You Have Any Psychological Trauma?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Not knowing how much time had passed, Liu Buyan finally recovered from his nauseous state and told Huang Yueli and the rest about the following situation.","After Xuan Qingling brought Liu Buyan out of that small courtyard and arrived at a safe place, Liu Buyan had originally decided to leave immediately.","He was not someone who liked to meddle in other people’s business. The Black Tortoise Clan was a colossus that he could not afford to offend. It was not easy for him to save his life. If he did not slip away, would he still wait to be captured and skinned alive?","However, just as he bade farewell to Xuan Qingling and was about to leave, Xuan Qingling suddenly trembled and fell to the ground with a crash.","This commotion gave Liu Buyan a fright and when he turned back to take a look, he realised that Xuan Qingling’s face was flushed red and her entire body was sweating profusely. Clearly...lt was the symptoms of the Spring Fragrance Powder acting up again!","Liu Buyan hesitated for quite a while but he still didn’t leave Xuan Qingling alone. Instead, he tried his best to use medicine to help her temporarily control the Spring Fragrance Powder in her body.","“So, Senior Brother, you’ve been staying with Xuan Qingling? It’s been two to three months since you met, right? Have we been hiding together?” Huang Yueli’s heart almost couldn’t move from laughing but she couldn’t show it on her face, so stifled that she was about to suffer internal injuries.","Liu Buyan frowned slightly. Although Junior Sister was asking in a serious manner, but for some reason, he felt that this little fox seemed to be plotting something..","“Isn’t that so?” he said seriously. Later on, I discovered that what Young Miss Xuan was poisoned with shouldn’t be an ordinary Spring Fragrance Powder.","Although the Spring Fragrance Powder is very potent, it usually only lasts for 24 hours. After this period of time, it will return to normal. However, Young Miss Xuan will act up once every three days!”","“Junior Sister, think about it. Young Miss Xuan is a single girl. Moreover, I don’t know who in the family has secretly harmed her. She doesn’t dare to return to the Black Tortoise clan and is wandering outside alone. The medicine will take effect every three days. Sigh, I originally wanted to separate from her, but seeing her like this, how could I leave? What if Xuan Qingling meets some evil people and is lustful?”","“Don’t you think so, Junior Sister? As a man, how can I abandon such a girl? If word gets out, can I still live? I just wanted to help her, but those people from the Black Tortoise Clan were deliberately looking for trouble. They insisted on treating me as Xuan Qingling’s man...”","“During this period of time, we’ve been hiding from the Black Tortoise Clan’s pursuers. We usually stay in the wilderness and rarely enter the city. This time, it’s because I’ve used up all the herbs I have, so I have no choice but to enter the city to purchase them. “I even specially went to the medicinal herb shop in the slums. I didn’t expect that I would still be targeted by the Black Tortoise Clan. Fortunately, I met you guys...”","Speaking till here, Huang Yueli had already figured out all of Liu Buyan’s experiences during this period of time.","She stared intently at Liu Buyan, her eyes filled with interest.","He really couldn’t tell that Divine Doctor Liu was known for his suave style in Soaring Heavens Continent. He had not expected that after arriving in the God Realm, he had become so pure and innocent. Didn’t he realize that his attitude towards Xuan Qingling was not ordinary?","As expected, no matter what kind of man he was, when he met a woman he truly liked, he would become stupid.","What ‘responsibility as a man’ ...He wasn’t related to Xuan Qingling, so how could he be resoonsible?","Wasn’t it because he couldn’t let go?","But Liu Buyan’s taste was really quite heavy?","He and Xuan Qingling were fated to be in a sh * t, yet they actually met? Did they not have any psychological trauma?"]},{"number":4713,"title":"Chapter 4713: Too Quiet","paragraphs":["Chapter 4713: Too Quiet","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Liu Buyan finished narrating his tragic experience and gave a deep sigh.","“Sigh, Junior Sister, don’t you think I’m too unlucky? Why am I so unlucky? He was just giving a diagnosis and he was already being hunted down. It was too tragic! If I hadn’t met you guys, I would have been finished today! The key is that it’s fine if I’m captured, but if Young Miss Xuan is found, I don’t know what she will experience!”","Liu Buyan’s face was filled with depression and as he spoke, he couldn’t help but glance at Xuan Qingling who was lying on the soft cushion in the corner.","After confirming that Xuan Qingling was fine and sleeping soundly, his tense expression relaxed a little.","However, after waiting for a while, he suddenly felt a little strange.","Because the cave was too quiet. There was not a single sound!","Huang Yueli and Li Moying, one was his Junior Sister and the other was his brother. After hearing about his tear-jerking tragic experience, the two of them actually didn’t have any reaction at all? How was this possible? Could it have been caught and eaten by the spirit beasts in the mountains?","Liu Buyan’s heart tightened as he hurriedly turned around to take a look.","How could these two people have been captured? They were clearly sitting at the side and whispering.","Huang Yueli didn’t know where she got two small stools from and placed them under her butt, looking much more presentable than a rough man like him who sat on the ground.","Liu Buyan was speechless.","Huang Yueli seemed to have only noticed him at this moment as she hurriedly coughed twice and revealed a smile,” Cough cough, Senior Brother ah, we understand your situation now! I didn’t expect you to be so loyal and affectionate! I’m about to cry from being touched by you! I wonder what your next step is?”","Not knowing why, Liu Buyan felt that his Junior Sister’s smile looked a little scary...","However, this... It must be an illusion!","Although his Junior Sister had always been black-bellied, she still treated him, this Senior Brother, very well.","Liu Buyan shook his head and threw away all distracting thoughts. He composed himself and said,” Junior Sister, you’ve seen it too. Young Miss Xuan’s current situation, the most important thing is to help her remove the poison from her body. The frequency of her attacks is getting higher and higher, and the duration of her attacks is getting longer and longer. If this continues, I don’t know what will happen in the future...”","” However, I’ve read a lot of classics and tried several formulas, but none of them had any obvious effects. At most, I could only relieve some of her pain when she acted up. It was impossible to eradicate the poison!","” I came to Snowflake City this time to replenish my herbs. On the other hand, I also wanted to see if there was a chance to invite Divine Doctor Zhang to treat Young Miss Xuan.”","see.”","After Huang Yueli nodded her head, she propped her chin up, looking as though she was deep in thought.","Liu Buyan saw that she didn’t say anything and frowned as he asked,” Junior","Sister, don’t you have any opinion? In this situation, how can I see Divine","Doctor Zhang? Do you have any ideas?”","Huang Yueli found it funny in her heart but her expression did not change as she explained indifferently: ” This...” I really don’t have any good ideas. In fact, Moying and I are also here to look for Divine Doctor Zhang for a consultation. You should have seen so many people on the west side of the city, right? They were all here to queue up for consultation! Moreover, the most important thing is that Divine Doctor Zhang has gone out to pick herbs. We don’t even know where he is!”","When he heard this, Liu Buyan went into a blank for a moment before he tensed up,” You guys are also here for consultation? But.... Are either of you injured? What happened?”"]},{"number":4714,"title":"Chapter 4714: Not Even Touching","paragraphs":["Chapter 4714: Not Even Touching","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli briefly explained her situation to Liu Buyan.","When Liu Buyan heard that, his brows immediately creased up,” There’s such a thing? It sounded like this matter could be serious, but to be on the safe side, he really needed to find someone to treat him. Junior Sister, do you want me to help you take a look first?”","Only then did Huang Yueli recall that her Senior Brother was also a rather capable physician!","She immediately nodded.” That’s for the best. Thank you, Senior Brother!”","Perhaps Liu Buyan’s medical skills weren’t as high as Zhang Lihe’s but he had one point which he had an advantage over and that was that Liu Buyan was the only person in the world who knew that she and Li Moying cultivated an evil cultivation method!","So she didn’t need to be on guard against Liu Buyan and could completely open herself up for him to examine the condition of her meridians.","Liu Buyan nodded his head as he stretched out his hand to feel Huang Yueli’s pulse.","He had not expected that when he was still two inches away from Huang Yueli, he felt a cold chill assaulting his back.","Liu Buyan’s actions subconsciously paused for a moment.","Huang Yueli placed her hand on a huge rock and rolled up her sleeves as she waited quietly. She had not expected that Liu Buyan actually froze on the spot without moving.","She looked over in confusion.” Senior Brother?”","“Cough cough, Junior Sister, this...”","Liu Buyan wanted to say something but Huang Yueli was very familiar with him so she immediately understood what he meant from his expression.","Huang Yueli suddenly turned her head and looked at Li Moying who was standing in the shadows in the corner,” Moying, what’s wrong with you again? How many times have I told you? Don’t scare my Senior Brother!”","“When did I scare him? He’s clearly framing us!”","Sensing the little fox’s gaze, Li Moying walked out from the shadows and sat down beside her.","But towards Huang Yueli’s accusation, he still had a serious look on his face as he denied it outright.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but glare at him, this man...!","He usually looked cold and steady, but in fact, when he was childish, it was simply infuriating! He thought that she couldn’t see through his tricks. Hehe, she was someone who shared the primordial spirit with him. How could she not know what he was thinking?","It was nothing more than hoping that Liu Buyan wouldn’t bump into her.","However, how could she treat a patient if she didn’t even allow him to touch her?","But Huang Yueli knew this man’s personality so it was useless to say anything. She could only give him a warning glare and turned towards Liu Buyan once again: ” Senior Brother, don’t bother about him. Just pretend that he doesn’t exist!”","“Alright, then I’ll give you a diagnosis.”","Liu Buyan composed himself and decided to listen to his Junior Sister.","The matter of Li Moying having tracheitis, he was clearer than anyone else but because Li Moying had suddenly broken through to Dao Profound Realm and was now two major realms higher than him, the huge gap in cultivation made Liu Buyan find it hard to adapt to the pressure that Li Moying emitted and that was why he was frightened earlier.","Now that he had calmed down and thought about it, what was he worried about?","With Junior Sister protecting him, no matter how much Li Moying liked to be jealous, would he be able to overturn the heavens?","Although Liu Buyan understood it in his heart, but when he was stared at by Li Moying’s dark eyes which were filled with a dim light, cold sweat still dripped down his forehead.","Finally, he withstood the huge pressure and grabbed Huang Yueli’s wrist.","Once he came into contact with the patient, he put down all the distracting thoughts in his mind and entered the state in the blink of an eye. He closed his eyes and quietly explored.."]},{"number":4715,"title":"Chapter 4715: I Have a Question","paragraphs":["Chapter 4715: I Have a Question","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","This exploration took less than fifteen minutes.","Liu Buyan’s eyes were slightly shut and he didn’t move at all.","Huang Yueli knew that she couldn’t disturb the doctor at this time so she wasn’t anxious at all as she waited quietly.","But as time passed, Li Moying’s aura turned colder and colder. If it wasn’t for Huang Yueli who was sitting beside him and using her other hand to pull him, he couldn’t help but want to chase her away.","Liu Buyan’s pig trotter, how long was he going to keep it on his wife’s wrist?","After another ten breaths’ time, Liu Buyan finally took a deep breath and opened his eyes. At the same time, he let go of Huang Yueli’s hand.","“Junior Sister, your situation...Forgive me for my lack of knowledge, but I really can’t see any problems.” Liu Buyan’s brows creased up slightly as a trace of doubt flashed past his eyes,” From my point of view, the energy accumulated in your body should be absorbed from the outside world and not completely refined. I wonder if you had absorbed a large amount of Heaven and Earth Profound Qi or evil Qi during your training?”","Huang Yueli shook her head and denied: ” No, I don’t have such an impression.”","Although she and Li Moying had indeed accidentally inhaled some Devil qi in Devil King Rui Fu’s cave dwelling, but she had carefully refined it all.","Moreover, the abnormal condition in her body had existed before she entered the cave abode. At least, her self-destruction failed before she took the risk to enter the deep pool.","Therefore, these two things should not be related.","And before entering the devil camp, she and Li Moying were at the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge, the Phoenix Clan’s territory.","The fire attributed Profound Qi there was very dense and it was very suitable for her to cultivate. However, nothing special happened when she cultivated...","Hearing Huang Yueli’s reply, Liu Buyan was even more puzzled.","“This... This was too incomprehensible! Looks like I can only find a top doctor like Divine Doctor Zhang to find the cause of the illness...”","Such an answer was already within Huang Yueli’s expectations so she wasn’t worried at all as she just nodded her head,” The cause of the illness or whatever isn’t really important. I just want to know if my body’s current condition would affect my ability to act?”","Liu Buyan thought about it,” It shouldn’t have too much of an impact. After all, your meridians are not damaged, and this ball of energy seems to be very stable. However, you mentioned that you almost self-destructed when you fought the Devils...This kind of thing must never happen again!”","Speaking up to this point, Liu Buyan’s expression turned solemn,” Junior","Sister, I know that you value Li Moying’s life more than your own but this method of self-destructing at the slightest provocation isn’t a good habit.","Listen to Senior Brother...”","” Alright, alright, I understand. Senior Brother, I’m not a child anymore. I know the severity of the matter!”","Hearing that Liu Buyan had the tendency to transform into an old scholar, Huang Yueli hurriedly coughed a few times and quickly interrupted him.","What a joke. After she almost self-destructed, she had already been lectured by her husband several times. If even her Senior Brother had to lecture her, wouldn’t she be annoyed to death?","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli hurriedly changed the topic,” As long as it doesn’t affect me fighting with others, then it should be fine. My condition is like this. Now, let’s talk about Young Miss Xuan’s condition!”","Liu Buyan was startled,” Young Miss Xuan’s illness...ls there a problem?”","“Of course, I have a question.” Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes, her face filled with curiosity.."]},{"number":4716,"title":"Chapter 4716: Things Are That Simple!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4716: Things Are That Simple!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Liu Buyan looked at Huang Yueli’s incomparably pure and innocent expression and his heart skipped a beat.","This was ...It seemed to be the standard expression of his Junior Sister who wanted to trick people!","No, no, no, it must be an illusion...","Liu Buyan composed himself and asked,” Junior Sister, is there anything you’re not clear about? Ask away!”","Huang Yueli asked with a smile: ” Senior Brother ah, as a physician, you should know that the best way to cure the poison of Spring Fragrance Powder is....” Cough cough, that!”","“Then, then...What about that?” Liu Buyan almost choked on his own saliva!","Although he knew that his Junior Sister was not a silly and sweet girl, but a scheming little fox, her face was too pure. Hearing such words coming out of her mouth, it really felt too strange!","Huang Yueli nodded her head and said in all seriousness: ” That’s right Senior Brother, isn’t this common sense?","“So, Senior Brother, haven’t you thought that Young Miss Xuan’s Spring Fragrance Powder has been acting up repeatedly? It’s actually not a difficult illness, it’s just... Well, he had never gotten the correct solution! It’s that simple!”","“You... You...!” Liu Buyan’s expression was as though he had seen a ghost as he stared fixedly at Huang Yueli.","Was his Junior Sister a Devil?","The moment he opened his mouth, he was about to be scared to death.","But when he wanted to refute Huang Yueli, he realised that he had no other way!","Huang Yueli was right!","In short, in theory, the medicine could cure the disease.","However, he...lf he could use such a method to detoxify the poison, would he still need to wait until today?","Liu Buyan held it in for quite a while before he finally found his voice. He took a deep breath and forced himself to calm down.","“Junior Sister, you... You’re right, but as you can see, Young Miss Xuan is still a young lady who has yet to be married. How can I find a random man outside to detoxify her? This... This is too ridiculous!”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes,” Why not? Is your life more important, or is your integrity more important?”","Liu Buyan choked again,” Cough cough, this...How was this the same thing?","Although Young Miss Xuan was affected, her life was not in danger for the time being! Moreover, Young Miss Xuan’s identity is here and she has an engagement with the White Fen Clan. If she loses her virginity and news gets out, how will she be able to live?”","When Huang Yueli heard that, she nodded her head, looking as though she was deep in thought.","“Yes, Senior Brother, what you said makes sense. You’re really thoughtful.”","When he heard this, Liu Buyan heaved a sigh of relief, feeling that his Junior Sister was still reasonable and instantly felt relieved,” That’s right, it’s good that you understand...","However, before he could finish his words, he heard Huang Yueli’s tone change,” But since you can’t spread it out, then find a tight-lipped and reliable man? As long as he didn’t tell anyone, who would know? Senior Brother, I think you’re quite suitable..”"]},{"number":4717,"title":"Chapter 4717: Control Your Wife!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4717: Control Your Wife!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Wha... Wha... What? You, you, you... Do you know what you are talking about?”","Liu Buyan’s face suddenly turned red as he jumped up from the ground in shock.","Huang Yueli looked at his embarrassed look as though his thoughts had been poked and the corners of her mouth couldn’t help but curl up slightly.","She coughed a few times before trying hard to hold back her laughter.","“Cough cough, that... Senior Brother, don’t think about it the wrong way. I’m just analyzing it rationally, right? We can’t just watch Young Miss Xuan suffer like this, right? If it acted up every two or three days, wouldn’t it affect her cultivation? Now that Divine Doctor Zhang is missing, do you want to follow Young Miss Xuan?","It’s good for everyone if we can get her to detoxify earlier. Shouldn’t we think about it carefully?”","Liu Buyan’s lips twitched as he felt that Huang Yueli’s words were a little weird but he couldn’t find any fault with it.","Huang Yueli didn’t wait for him to say anything as she continued,” From the looks of it, this is the best antidote. Quick, highly effective and painless. The only problem was that if the matter was exposed, it would affect Young Miss Xuan’s reputation. It’s not that there’s no solution. As long as the man you find is tight-lipped enough and doesn’t say anything, it’ll be fine.”","“However, it’s easy to say. It’s actually very difficult to find such a man. To be able to obtain the Primordial Yin of Xuan Qingling, one of the three geniuses of the Black Tortoise Clan, is enough for ordinary cultivators to brag about it for their entire lives. Among the men I know, you’re the only one who can be so reliable!”","Huang Yueli shook her head as she concluded: ” Senior Brother ah, Young Miss","Xuan has treated you well. In the past, she even saved you in the mystic region! Now that he was in trouble, could it be that you were going to leave him in the lurch? If you’re really so cold-blooded, I’ll be very disappointed!”","“You... You...”","When Liu Buyan heard Huang Yueli’s ” exquisite ” analysis, he was completely stunned.","What kind of twisted logic was this?","However, it sounded very reasonable.","Even he couldn’t help but feel that if he didn’t go down personally to detoxify Xuan Qingling, he would become an ungrateful and shameless person!","But... But... How could he...","Liu Buyan’s hands clenched into fists and no matter how hard he tried to control himself, his line of sight couldn’t help but turn towards Xuan Qingling who was lying in the corner.","The members of the Black Tortoise Clan were all delicate and pretty. Although their facial features were exquisite, they seemed a little dull.","Compared to Huang Yueli who was like a raging fire, a great beauty with a dazzling light, it was a completely different style.","Realizing that his train of thought had been completely led astray by Huang Yueli, Liu Buyan bit his tongue forcefully before he regained his senses.","“Mas...Junior Sister, what nonsense are you spouting! Don’t say such words again! Young Miss Xuan was indeed my savior in the past. I...How could I...","Do that kind of thing?”","“Alright, if you’re not willing, we can find another one for Young Miss Xuan! How about this? When Young Miss Xuan wakes up, I’ll communicate with her and ask for her opinion. However, a genius like Xuan Qingling definitely knows the importance of the matter and will most likely agree with my thoughts...”","“No, Junior Sister, you are not allowed to speak nonsense in front of Young","Miss Xuan! You... Sigh, Li Moying, why don’t you discipline your wife!” Under","Liu Buyan’s exasperation, he had forgotten that he was not on good terms with Li Moying.."]},{"number":4718,"title":"Chapter 4718: Conscience Found","paragraphs":["Chapter 4718: Conscience Found","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying’s gaze was cold as he glanced at Liu Buyan as he lifted his lips lightly,” What did my wife do wrong? Do you need me to care about him? Liu Buyan, I’m warning you, although we are all friends, but since you’ve slandered my Li ‘er, don’t hang up and I won’t be polite to you!”","“You...!”","Liu Buyan was choked and his breath was neither up nor down as he almost vomited blood.","He should have known long ago that Li Moying, this guy with no moral integrity, was normally very normal but as long as it was related to Huang Yueli, he would instantly turn into a wife protecting maniac so it would be a ghost if he would stand on his side!","What was wrong with him just now that he would ask him for help?","He was simply asking to be humiliated!","Liu Buyan was so depressed that he wanted to buy a piece of tofu and kill","himself.","Finally, when Huang Yueli saw him like this, she finally found her conscience.","She didn’t tease him anymore but coughed and said seriously: ” Senior Brother, I’m really not joking. This is definitely the most effective treatment plan. If you really don’t want to, then let’s talk about reality!”","“Realistic problems?” Liu Buyan frowned as he turned to look at Huang Yueli.","Seeing the smile on Huang Yueli’s face fade away, he still couldn’t let down his guard...He was really afraid of this little fox!","Huang Yueli kept her smile and nodded solemnly: ” That’s right! I believe you are aware of Young Miss Xuan’s current condition. It is impossible for you to cure her with your medical skills. And now, among the three great Miracle Doctors, who knows when Miracle Doctor Zhang will return. The remaining two are from the White Fen Clan. You can’t ask them to treat Young Miss Xuan, right? What do you plan to do next?”","Hearing this, Liu Buyan finally understood that Huang Yueli really didn’t intend to tease him anymore.","He also revealed a solemn expression and even frowned slightly.","The matter was just as Huang Yueli had said, it was impossible for him to look for the two Divine Doctors of the White Fen Clan.","This was not a matter of money, but because...Xuan Qingling was engaged to the young clan leader of the White Fen Clan. If the people of the White Fen Clan knew that Xuan Qingling was poisoned by the Spring Fragrance Powder, it would definitely affect her greatly.","Besides, they still didn’t know who the person who drugged Xuan Qingling was.","Perhaps the murderer was colluding with the people of the White Fen Clan to kill Xuan Qingling and prevent her from marrying into the White Fen Clan.","If they went to White Fen Continent to seek medical treatment, it was no different from walking into a trap.","Liu Buyan pondered for a long time before he finally said,” This...” Before I came to Snowflake City, I didn’t expect Divine Doctor Zhang to suddenly leave. However, given the current situation, I think the best solution is to continue staying in Snowflake City for a period of time and wait for Divine Doctor Zhang to return. It wasn’t easy for us to get here, so we have to let Divine Doctor","Zhang take a look first.”","Huang Yueli nodded her head and continued: ” This plan is indeed the most beneficial to Young Miss Xuan. But have you ever thought of a problem? Now that the Black Tortoise Clan already knows that you are in Snow Flower City, they also know that you are going to look for Divine Doctor Zhang for treatment. Therefore, the other party would definitely stay in Snowflake City and even wait for him at the medical center...Aren’t you afraid that they’ll catch you again?”","Liu Buyan was stunned when he heard that.","Obviously, he hadn’t considered so many things at the moment.","“Damn it! Junior Sister, you’re right. Those Black Tortoise Clan fellows are like plaster.. “"]},{"number":4719,"title":"Chapter 4719: Tracked","paragraphs":["Chapter 4719: Tracked","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“During this period of time, wherever Young Miss Xuan and I went, they followed. It’s really annoying! Now that they’ve chased us all the way to Snowflake City, it’ll be very difficult for us to stay...” Liu Buyan’s face turned ashen.","Huang Yueli frowned slightly as she asked: ” Then Senior Brother...” Do you know how they found you?”","When Liu Buyan heard that, he was startled again and immediately replied,” I suspect that they should have some secret technique which could allow them to track down their own clan members through their bloodline or aura. However, I don’t know how to guard against such a method...Junior Sister, do you have any ideas?”","Huang Yueli subconsciously turned her head back and took a glance at her husband.","Li Moying naturally understood his wife’s meaning but after thinking for a moment, he still shook his head.","“It’s not that I don’t want to help, but I’m afraid this secret technique is very difficult to crack. “The Black Tortoise Clan is the most proficient in concealment and tracking techniques among the twelve great god clans. Water is the softest thing and can penetrate through any hole. Through water-attribute secret techniques, we can see many things that we can’t.","Therefore, outsiders are almost unable to crack the secret techniques of the Black Tortoise Clan.”","When he heard this, Liu Buyan’s expression turned extremely ugly,” In that case, I don’t have any way to shake off the Black Tortoise Clan’s people? Damn it! This bunch of Black Tortoise Clan fellows clearly did not have good intentions. God knows who was behind this! I definitely can’t let her fall into the hands of these people! Junior Sister, you...","Help me think of a way!”","The more Liu Buyan thought about it, the more anxious and uneasy he became.","In a moment of agitation, he subconsciously stretched out his hand to grab Huang Yueli’s wrist.","However, before he could touch anyone, he felt a chill on his back.","He was so scared that he quickly retracted his hand and even put it behind his back.” Cough cough, I...” I didn’t mean to offend Junior Sister. I just... Ask...","Junior Sister, you definitely won’t leave me in the lurch, right?”","Huang Yueli looked at his nervous expression and the corners of her lips curled up slightly.","“Alright, Senior Brother, you don’t have to be too nervous. Isn’t there still me and Moying here? “For the next few days, you and Young Miss Xuan will follow us first. Those Black Tortoise Clan cultivators have just suffered a loss at our hands. They definitely won’t dare to come and provoke us for a while.","However...”","“But what?”","When Liu Buyan heard the first half of her words, he was slightly relieved.","But before he could exhale a long breath, he suddenly heard Huang Yueli’s ” but","This sudden turn of events made him break out in cold sweat again.","Huang Yueli replied: ” Originally, if you and Young Miss Xuan follow us, there shouldn’t be any big problems. However, my husband and I still have something urgent to do, so we can’t stay in Snowflake City for long. Moreover, the place we’re going to is a little dangerous, so we can’t bring the two of you along. When we leave, I’m afraid you’ll be in trouble...”","Originally, Huang Yueli didn’t want to throw Liu Buyan down.","Ever since her Senior Brother was rejected by her, it was not easy for him to move his heart. She should help him to the end and properly matchmake the two of them.","But just as Huang Yueli was about to take over everything, she suddenly recalled that she still had an agreement with the Saint Iniquitous Shadow that she had yet to fulfill!","Originally, she planned to go to Forest Shade Town after seeing Divine Doctor Zhang.."]},{"number":4720,"title":"Chapter 4720: Wasting time and feelings","paragraphs":["Chapter 4720: Wasting time and feelings","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Now that Divine Doctor Zhang’s whereabouts were unknown and she didn’t know when he would return, Huang Yueli naturally wasn’t willing to wait here and planned to go to Forest Shade Town to settle her matters first before coming back for a consultation.","But this way, she wouldn’t be able to bring Liu Buyan along.","Liu Buyan couldn’t even enter the Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s cave dwelling and moreover, he had Xuan Qingling by his side.","Although her impression of Xuan Qingling wasn’t bad, but she was still an outsider after all so Huang Yueli wouldn’t expose her secret in front of Xuan Qingling.","When Liu Buyan heard this, he immediately understood.","“Junior Sister, since you and Moying have something on, you don’t have to bother about us. I’m not a child. Do I have to follow you all the time? Young Miss Xuan and I have been hiding outside for so long and have never been caught. Today is also not a good day...ln the future, I will be more careful..","“Senior Brother, what are you saying? Do you think I’ll leave you all behind? What kind of people do you take me and Moying as?” Huang Yueli interrupted him in a bad mood.","Liu Buyan had been good friends with them for tens of years and was also the only friend who had ascended from the Lower Realms together. Even if she threw her own matters aside, she couldn’t possibly let Liu Buyan continue to be hunted down by others so she definitely had to make arrangements before leaving.","” How about this, you bring Young Miss Xuan back to the city with us and rest for a few days. On one hand, you can let Young Miss Xuan recuperate. On the other hand, we can discuss the next step of the plan.” Huang Yueli pondered for a moment and said.","Regarding this, Li Moying and Liu Buyan had no objections.","Liu Buyan walked to Xuan Qingling’s side and carried the unconscious her on his back as he turned around and walked towards the direction of Snowflake","City.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying held hands as they followed behind them.","After walking for a while, Huang Yueli stretched out her hand and tugged at the sleeve of her husband who had been expressionless the entire time. She lowered her voice and asked: ” Husband, do you think the two of them....” Is it true?”","When Li Moying heard that, he glanced indifferently at Liu Buyan’s back view as he gave a light snort,” It’s not important whether it’s true or not. Anyway, there’s basically no chance between them so there’s no need to waste time and feelings. You might as well think about how to look for Divine Doctor Zhang.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli’s small mouth pouted as she was a little unhappy as she turned around and glared at Li Moying.","“Husband, how can you be like this! Senior Brother is also your good brother.","Can’t you help him? Why was he only thinking about jealousy? It’s obvious that Senior Brother no longer has any feelings for me!”","Li Moying’s cold and handsome face flashed with an imperceptible blush as he subconsciously denied,” Li ‘er, you’ve seen wrongly. Who was jealous of him?","Which eye of yours saw it?”","Both eyes saw it!","Huang Yueli was furious.","Did her husband think she was blind or something?","Earlier when Li Moying was taking her pulse, the cold air that he emitted could freeze her alive! How dare you say you’re not jealous?","Huang Yueli was displeased and wanted to shake his hand away.","Who knew that when she tried to shake him off, not only did she fail to shake him off, but Li Moying even held her wrist firmly and pulled her into his embrace.","“Alright, Li ‘er, don’t be angry, I really didn’t lie to you.. Think about it, if I can promote Liu Buyan, the happiest person would be me! If I can help him, how can I not help him? But the problem was...That’s Xuan Qingling!”"]},{"number":4721,"title":"Chapter 4721: Have you forgotten that we are eloping?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4721: Have you forgotten that we are eloping?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying didn’t make his words too clear but Huang Yueli quickly understood what he meant.","Xuan Qingling was one of the top three geniuses of the Black Tortoise Clan. Not only did she have Heaven Grade talent, but she was also a Spiritual Blacksmith. Her appearance and temperament were also top-notch.","From the resources that Xuan Qingling had obtained, it could be seen that she was the focus of the Black Tortoise Clan’s nurturing. As long as she could grow up, she would at least become an elder of the Black Tortoise Clan in the future.","Such innate talent and identity, in the entire God Realm’s younger generation, belonged to the high and mighty, just a level lower than Huang Yueli and Li Moying.","A proud daughter of heaven like her was the perfect match for the young master of the White Fen Clan.","Comparatively speaking, Liu Buyan was already a mixed blood and his innate talent wasn’t bad when compared to ordinary Gods but when compared to the top Heaven Grade geniuses, there was still a gap.","The only thing worth mentioning was that Liu Buyan’s innate talent in medicine was outstanding.","However, medical skills were the same as martial arts cultivation. It was impossible to achieve too much by relying on talent alone. It required a large amount of resources and rich experience to accumulate.","Liu Buyan was a lone wolf without any clan backing him up so at least at this stage, he didn’t have any ability that the Black Tortoise Clan would take a fancy to.","If the Black Tortoise Clan was willing to marry Xuan Qingling to her, unless the sun rose from the west...No!","Huang Yueli suddenly thought of something as she said: ” Alright then. Senior Brother’s status is indeed different from Young Miss Xuan’s. But he has a close relationship with the two of us? With two god-grade geniuses and the future clan leader of the Ancient God Clan as matchmakers, this marriage might not be impossible, right?”","Li Moying swept her a glance,” So you’ve forgotten that the two of us aren’t some Clan Leader or Young Clan Leader but are eloping?”","“Uh...” Huang Yueli choked.","Li Moying continued,” Or perhaps, you plan to obediently return to the Sacred Phoenix Tribe to be your tribe leader for Liu Buyan’s sake and then dump me and find another genius cultivator to marry?”","“What nonsense are you talking about!” Huang Yueli couldn’t help but roll her eyes at him,” Of course I won’t cancel the engagement with you...No, we were married a long time ago. What do you mean by annulling the engagement? In short, these were two different things. As long as our strength increases to a certain extent, we will definitely have to return to the clan in the end. At that time, we will just mediate for Senior Brother. There’s no hurry.”","Li Moying nodded his head,” What you said makes sense.”","However, before Huang Yueli could reveal a smile, he changed the topic,” But","“But what?” Huang Yueli pursed her lips unhappily.","Li Moying asked,” But would Young Miss Xuan like Buyan?”","Huang Yueli was startled as she subconsciously replied,”Xuan Qingling, she...’ She doesn’t like my Senior Brother? However, the last time in the mystic realm, in order to save her Senior Brother, she had personally lured away the Devil Beasts that were chasing after them. This was obviously to exchange her life for her Senior Brother’s life! At that time, I felt that the two of them were a little... Don’t tell me she doesn’t have any feelings for Senior Brother?” Huang Yueli asked herself, she wasn’t so kind as to sacrifice herself to save a man who didn’t feel anything.","Even towards Li Moying, it was only after the two of them had experienced many things together that she placed the other party’s life above hers.","Li Moying shook his head slightly,” You are you, Xuan Qingling is Xuan Qingling. I feel that she might not like Buyan..”"]},{"number":4722,"title":"Chapter 4722: Xuan Qingling Awakens","paragraphs":["Chapter 4722: Xuan Qingling Awakens","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Seeing his wife’s puzzled expression, Li Moying explained a few more sentences.","“The Black Tortoise Clan is very famous in the alliance army. Even though the Black Tortoise Clan’s combat strength is far inferior to the Cloudy Qilin Clan and Sacred Phoenix Clan’s ancient martial art cultivators, but the number of ancient martial art cultivators that their clan has thrown themselves into the alliance army is the greatest. The Black Tortoise Clan was very chivalrous. Over hundreds of millions of years, there had been many great heroes who sacrificed themselves for others. As a member of the Black Tortoise Clan, it’s hard to judge if she saved Liu Buyan’s life out of loyalty.”","Initially, Huang Yueli was still skeptical but after thinking of Xuan Jiuling, she felt that this statement was reasonable.","Although the Immortal Realm indeed respected martial arts and strength, there were indeed many experts like the Divine General Xuan who took on the responsibility of protecting the people of the world.","Li Moying continued, ” Moreover Xuan Qingling is a genius who has been nurtured by her family since young. They are like flowers in a greenhouse and they have never suffered any setbacks. Compared to us who have been through a lot of experience and have ascended from the lower realm, their mentality is totally different. ”","Huang Yueli was convinced by him and her little face instantly crumbled,” In that case, Senior Brother and Young Miss Xuan have no chance? Sigh, it wasn’t easy for Senior Brother to meet someone who was moved...lsn’t this too disappointing?”","She pouted and thought for a while, but she was still unwilling.” No, we can’t just let it go like this. No matter what, it was a rare fate for the two of them to meet because of the Spring Fragrance Powder! When we return later, I’ll think of a way to sound out Young Miss Xuan first.”","Li Moying looked at his wife’s delicate little face and wanted to say that he shouldn’t waste his effort but when the words reached his mouth, he swallowed them back.","Whatever his wife wanted to do, he would always support her unconditionally.","Moreover, he actually really wanted to ‘marry’ Liu Buyan out!","It would be best if he could become a live-in son-in-law of the Black Tortoise Clan!","If his wifey really had a way, he would definitely raise both hands and feet in support and even give Liu Buyan a priceless ‘dowry’!","Along the way, Huang Yueli and Li Moying were discussing amongst themselves.","Liu Buyan was carrying the unconscious Xuan Qingling on his back and he could vaguely hear the two of them chatting behind him but he couldn’t hear clearly what they were talking about. He only felt a chill run down his spine and it felt even more flustered than when he was being chased down earlier... Not long after, the few of them sneaked into the city and returned to the inn.","Liu Buyan’s medical skills weren’t bad and although he couldn’t concoct the antidote for Spring Fragrance Powder, but when he caught a few medicines at the last minute and fed them to Xuan Qingling, she woke up very quickly.","Seeing Huang Yueli and Li Moying, Xuan Qingling was obviously shocked. Under Liu Buyan’s explanation, she finally understood and her face flushed red as she thanked the two of them in embarrassment.","“Patriarch Huang, Young Lord Li, really...Thank you very much. “If it weren’t for you guys, Young Master Liu and I would definitely be dead this time. If we were captured by those people, I would at least be able to keep my life. Young Master Liu would probably...” He’s so kind and protected me all the way here. If he gets implicated by me, I... I really don’t know what to do...’","Huang Yueli waved her hand as she looked at her smilingly,” It’s alright, it’s alright. Liu Buyan is my Senior Brother so it’s only right for us to save him so there’s no need to be so courteous.. However, I would like to take the liberty to ask, what happened in your family? Why would someone drug you like this?”"]},{"number":4723,"title":"Chapter 4723: Mastermind","paragraphs":["Chapter 4723: Mastermind","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“This...”","Hearing Huang Yueli’s question, Xuan Qingling immediately sank into silence. Her delicate brows furrowed slightly, and a dark and cold glint flashed across her eyes.","“I can’t be sure who did this to me yet, but according to my speculation, this matter should be related to my marriage.”","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows,” Marriage? What you mean... Is it about your marriage to the young master of the White Fen Clan?”","Xuan Qingling nodded.” Although the young master of the White Fen Clan is not as talented in martial arts, there are many miracle doctors in the White Fen Clan and he has a lot of resources. If he can marry into the White Fen Clan, he will definitely get a lot of resources. There are many people who covet this marriage. I don’t know who I’ve blocked. I can only wait for me to recover and return to the clan to slowly investigate.”","Although Xuan Qingling didn’t say it with certainty, her expression was calm and indifferent.","To say that she knew nothing about the mastermind, Huang Yueli didn’t believe it.","But when he said that, it was obvious that he didn’t wish for outsiders to participate in the Black Tortoise Clan’s internal strife so Huang Yueli tactfully didn’t continue to ask.","She turned to the next question. Young Miss Xuan, what do you plan to do next? As far as I know, the Spring Fragrance Powder in your body has not been removed until now. The frequency of the outbreak is getting higher and higher, and we don’t know where Divine Doctor Zhang is at this moment...”","Xuan Qingling frowned.” No matter what, I can’t go back now. At least I have to cure the poison in my body. I thought that the problem would be solved if I found Divine Doctor Zhang this time. I didn’t expect it to be so unfortunate.”","Xuan Qingling knew that the situation in the family must be very chaotic now. Even if she guessed who was dealing with her, she didn’t have any evidence.","Moreover, the Spring Fragrance Powder in her body had not been cured, and it was a fatal hidden danger. Once it acted up, she would immediately fall into an extremely dangerous situation and would not even have the chance to resist!","When Huang Yueli heard this, her eyes flashed as the corners of her lips curled up slightly.","“Young Miss Xuan, you don’t have to be disheartened. Divine Doctor Zhang is only out picking herbs. He will definitely return in two to three months at most. It’s just that there are a lot of people waiting in line outside the courtyard to see a doctor. When it’s your turn, it’ll probably take a few months...”","Huang Yueli said unhurriedly as she observed the expression on Xuan Qingling’s face.","Hearing her say ” a few months Xuan Qingling’s eyebrows twitched unnoticeably. She seemed a little anxious.","Such a reaction was completely within Huang Yueli’s expectations.","According to the calculation of the God Realm, Xuan Qingling was still underage. At this age, it was the age where the cultivation of the God Realm’s cultivators progressed the fastest.","Every year before the age of 50 was crucial to a top-notch genius.","Even if he delayed for a month, he would be surpassed by geniuses of the same talent. If he delayed for a few more months, he might be inferior to others for the rest of his life.","It had already been three to four months since Xuan Qingling had been given the Spring Fragrance Powder.","If she stayed here and waited for Divine Doctor Zhang, she would be unlucky and waste a few more months. Then, half a year would have passed. Not only did her cultivation not advance this year, but it had even regressed quite a bit!","The person who plotted against Xuan Qingling was most likely a talented young girl with similar talent as her. The difference in strength between the two of them was probably not big.","If Xuan Qingling’s cultivation fell because of this and the other party caught up to her, she would really fall into the other party’s trap!"]},{"number":4724,"title":"Chapter 4724: How Should Young Miss Xuan Act?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4724: How Should Young Miss Xuan Act?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","On this point, not only was Huang Yueli clear, Xuan Qingling knew it better than anyone else.","Hearing Huang Yueli’s vague suggestion, she couldn’t help but feel anxious but she was at her wit’s end.","“This... I understand that too, but with my current situation, I have no other choice but to wait for Divine Doctor Zhang to return..","Halfway through her sentence, Xuan Qingling suddenly noticed the smile that flashed across Huang Yueli’s lips. A thought flashed in her mind as she turned around and asked: ” Clan Leader Huang, you said so...Could it be that there’s a way for me to recover faster? If you have a way, please tell me. As long as I can recover as soon as possible, I’m willing to do anything!”","“I’m willing to do anything...ls that true?” Huang Yueli’s smile deepened. Xuan Qingling felt that something was wrong, but she didn’t know what it was.","After hesitating for a moment, he nodded decisively.” Really!”","Huang Yueli smiled and said,”Since that’s the case, then I have a...’ .","“Alright, Junior Sister, you’re not a spirit apothecary. Don’t give me random ideas!”","Suddenly, Liu Buyan stood up and loudly interrupted Huang Yueli’s words. At the same time, he walked in front of Xuan Qingling and discreetly separated her from Huang Yueli.","“Alright, Young Miss Xuan, your illness has been acting up for a longer time than usual today. It must have consumed a lot of your body. It’s better for you to quickly return to your room to rest. I’ve already helped you book a room next door. If there’s anything, it’s not too late to talk about it after you’ve rested.”","“Big Brother Liu, your words are wrong. Although Patriarch Huang is not a spirit apothecary, she is after all a god grade genius and is knowledgeable.","Besides, I’m already like this now, and my condition can’t be any more serious.","Even if it’s not a professional opinion, there’s no harm in listening to it, right?”","Xuan Qingling had a disapproving expression as she walked out from behind Liu Buyan.","‘ Patriarch Huang, just say it. I’m happy to listen to you.” She looked very humble and studious as she looked straight at Huang Yueli.","“Uh, but...” Huang Yueli took a glance at the flustered and exasperated Liu Buyan and coughed lightly to conceal the smile on her lips as she deliberately said,” Forget it, it’s better not to say it. My Senior Brother felt that I’m not","reliable so he didn’t let me say it. Now that I think about it, it’s just hearsay so I really shouldn’t have spread it to delay you...”","” It doesn’t matter if I hear it from the hearsay,” Xuan Qingling said hurriedly.”","It might be useful.”","Because of this Spring Fragrance Powder, she had been tormented for the past few months. She had almost encountered life-threatening situations several times. The desire for detoxification in her heart had reached an extreme. Not to mention that Huang Yueli was the Patriarch of a large family, even if she was just a wandering doctor, as long as she claimed that she had a way to cure the poison, she would listen to it.","Huang Yueli’s lips curled up slightly as she slowly said: ” Since that’s the case, then I’ll say it. That is...”","“Junior Sister, don’t say anymore! Can you stop talking nonsense? What do you want Young Miss Xuan to do with those words? Wouldn’t it be awkwvard for a girl like her?” Liu Buyan was really anxious this time and he couldn’t care about anything else, just short of making things clear.","However, Xuan Qingling was still at a loss. She even frowned.","“Brother Liu, why are you talking about Patriarch Huang like that? She has good intentions.. Besides, she’s your Junior Sister!”"]},{"number":4725,"title":"Chapter 4725: What Are You Thinking?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4725: What Are You Thinking?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xuan Qingling’s gaze towards Liu Buyan was filled with doubt and puzzlement.","If it wasn’t for the fact that Liu Buyan was the one who protected her all the way here, and during this period of time, she had a clear understanding of Liu Buyan’s character and trusted him very much, Xuan Qingling would probably suspect that Liu Buyan was a spy sent by her clan’s opponent.","He did not want her to recover on purpose!","When Liu Buyan heard Xuan Qingling’s doubts, his heart was filled with endless grievances but he didn’t know how to explain.","Could it be that he had to tell Xuan Qingling that he didn’t have any opinions towards Huang Yueli nor did he want to harm her, but was purely worried that he wouldn’t be able to control his own body and after breaking this layer of paper, he would do something that would let her down?!","Huang Yueli saw Liu Buyan’s depressed look and smiled till her eyes narrowed.","After a while, he waved his hand.” Senior Brother, you know what I want to say again? Why is it that my plan will definitely make Young Miss Xuan unable to control herself?”","“You...!” Liu Buyan was stumped by her question and only replied after a long while,” Isn’t that so? Don’t you want Young Miss Xuan to follow me...”","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes as she gave a pure and innocent expression,” Young Miss Xuan and you? Why should I follow you? What I want to say has nothing to do with you. I just want to say that I heard that Young Miss Xuan’s fiancé, An Zhenyu, seems to be an extremely outstanding spirit herbologist, right? It is said that she is already at the early stage of the Heaven class at such a young age. Why doesn’t Young Miss Xuan consider relying on her fiancé?”","“Eh? What did you say?”","When Liu Buyan heard this, he almost bit off his own tongue.","He was already certain that Huang Yueli was planning to instigate Xuan Qingling to dual cultivate with him to detoxify the poison but he didn’t expect Huang Yueli to not mention a single word about it!","The solution he proposed was completely different from what he had said in the cave in the afternoon.","Huang Yueli almost laughed out loud but considering that Xuan Qingling was still here, in order to protect her Senior Brother’s face in front of the younger sister, she forcefully held back her laughter.","“Young Miss Xuan, I heard from my Senior Brother this afternoon that the White Fen Clan specifically wants you to marry them, right?” she added with a smile. Young Master An should have a good impression of you. Since that’s the case, why don’t you ask him for help? Even if he can’t cure the Spring","Fragrance Powder, there are still many outstanding divine doctors in the White Fen Clan. There should be a way, right?”","Xuan Qingling was slightly stunned when she heard that.","Obviously, she had not thought of this.","Although she was already engaged to the young master of the White Fen Clan,","Xuan Qingling grew up in the Black Tortoise Clan. She only treated the Black Tortoise Clan as her own family and had no sense of belonging to the White","Fen Clan.","Therefore, she had never thought of using the resources of the White Marsh Tribe to help her out.","“What you have said is quite reasonable...” Xuan Qingling frowned slightly and fell into deep thought.","“No, this...How could this be? This plan is not reliable at all!”","Liu Buyan reacted at this moment and immediately voiced out his objection.","“What’s wrong with this plan?” Huang Yueli turned her head and raised her brows,” I think it’s very reliable? His fiancée had been poisoned by such a vicious poison.. As his fiancé, he had to do something to help her, right?","Otherwise, this engagement would be too insincere! Husband, don’t you think that’s reasonable?”"]},{"number":4726,"title":"Chapter 4726: They Will Get Married Sooner or Later","paragraphs":["Chapter 4726: They Will Get Married Sooner or Later","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli turned around to look at Li Moying who was behind her.","What else did Li Moying have to say, he would definitely spare no effort in supporting his wife.","“Actually, if Young Miss Xuan can find a way to contact Young Master An, there’s another benefit.” If you really can’t cure the poison, even the elders of the White Fen Clan can’t do anything about it. That’s great. You can just get married early. Anyway, whether you get married sooner or later, you still have to get married.”","Li Moying’s expression was indifferent as he used a deep and cold voice to speak slowly, as though there wasn’t a single fluctuation in his emotions, appearing extremely objective and fair.","In fact, apart from Xuan Qingling, who didn’t know what he was up to?","Huang Yueli secretly gave her husband a thumbs up in her heart.","As expected of her husband. He had a tacit understanding with her. This stab was...Liu Buyan couldn’t continue pretending.","As expected, Liu Buyan’s expression was as though he had eaten sh * t as his entire face was flushed red and he couldn’t utter a complete sentence for a long time.","He could only repeatedly emphasize, “This way...” This wasn’t good. Anyway... Anyway, I strongly object...’","This time, Xuan Qingling also felt that something was wrong. She said with some dissatisfaction, “Brother Liu, why are you opposing it?” I think what Young Master Li and Patriarch Huang said makes sense. It’s indeed worth my careful consideration.’","Liu Buyan stifled for a long time before he said,” But...” But this... Wasn’t this too rude? You’re not even married to An Zhenyu, so how could you go to the White Fen Clan’s territory? If word gets out, others will say that you’re a pushover! Besides, I don’t think An Zhenyu is such a gentleman. What if he could have cured you, but he had evil intentions and insisted on making you sleep with him ahead of time? You...","What about you?”","He held it in for a long time before he said everything he wanted to say.","Huang Yueli found it funny but she didn’t interrupt him.","She and Li Moying had already said what they needed to say so next, they could only watch this couple who didn’t know what was going on display themselves.","But Huang Yueli was obviously a little optimistic.","Xuan Qingling was a Black Tortoise Clan’s proud daughter who had devoted herself to cultivation since young and had never fallen in love with anyone nor did she intend to waste time on relationships. Her slowness was not inferior to Liu Buvan’s!","After hearing Liu Buyan’s doubts, other than doubt, she was still puzzled.","“Brother Liu, I don’t think you need to have such thoughts. Anyway, Anzhen and I are engaged. We’ll get married sooner or later. There’s no need for him to have such a crooked idea. Besides, if we get married early, the White Fen Clan will fulfill their promise and heal our clan leader. This way, the clan will definitely be grateful to me, and I’ll get more resources. There’s nothing wrong with me! ”","Xuan Qingling’s analysis was reasonable and no one could find any fault with it.","But Liu Buyan was already extremely depressed.","It could be seen that Xuan Qingling was basically undistracted and had never thought about relationships.","In her heart, it was the same no matter who she married. There was no need to consider feelings at all.","Or marry a strong cultivator, the kind that could benefit from dual cultivation with him. Xuan Qingling had previously publicly expressed that she was extremely envious of Huang Yueli and Li Moying who were evenly matched. Or, if he really couldn’t marry an expert, he could obtain cultivation resources.."]},{"number":4727,"title":"Chapter 4727: Leaving First","paragraphs":["Chapter 4727: Leaving First","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","This was very realistic.","However, this was the law of the Immortal World. No one could say that Xuan Qingling was wrong.","Thinking up to here, Liu Buyan’s mood suddenly turned heavy.","To be honest, even he himself didn’t expect that Xuan Qingling’s words would have such a huge impact on his mood.","Although he kept saying that Xuan Qingling and him were not like that, and even told Huang Yueli and the rest not to randomly match up, but when the matter came to an end, he suddenly realized...She was actually unhappy when Xuan Qingling mentioned her fiancé!","Liu Buyan’s heart was like a ball of fire and suddenly he couldn’t hold it in any longer as he stood up from his seat.","“Young Miss Xuan, you...","He opened his mouth, wanting to say something, but when Xuan Qingling looked at him in surprise, he was suddenly stuck.","Liu Buyan’s entire body quivered as he suddenly woke up.","He... Was he crazy? What did he want to say to Xuan Qingling just now? Tell her not to look for An Zhenyu? Don’t you want to marry him in advance?","However, this marriage was decided upon by the Black Tortoise Clan and the White Fen Clan’s clan leaders, and Xuan Qingling herself had agreed to it.","The two of them were engaged to begin with. It was normal for Xuan Qingling to seek An Zhenyu’s help when she was in such big trouble. What right did he have to stop her?","As for when she would get married, that was something that an outsider like him could not interfere with...","Thinking of this, Liu Buyan coughed heavily, concealing the disappointment on his face,” That...” Young Miss Xuan, Junior Sister, Moying, I’ve been staying up these few days without any rest and I can’t take it anymore so I’ll go back to my room first. If you guys have decided on the next step of the plan, just tell me tomorrow. I can cooperate.”","Without waiting for anyone else in the room to reply, he immediately strode out of the room.","“Wait, big brother Liu, don’t leave yet..","Xuan Qingling subconsciously called out, wanting to stop him.","However, no one knew if Liu Buyan heard her voice as his footsteps were extremely fast and in just a few breaths ‘time, he had already disappeared from everyone’s sight.","Xuan Qingling’s right hand, which was extended in his direction, suddenly stopped in mid-air, looking a little awkward.","She looked in the direction where Liu Buyan had left and her brows twitched unnoticeably as she revealed a gloomy expression.","Of course, she quickly concealed the expression on her face as she turned to Huang Yueli and said: ” Clan Leader Huang, since Brother Liu has left, I’m also a little tired. Why don’t we continue our discussion tomorrow? Anyway, I’ve been poisoned for several months. I’m already used to it. It’s not a big deal.” She thought that she had concealed it very well.","Little did they know that Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s spiritual awareness was so powerful that even the top heaven grade geniuses would find it hard to imagine.","The two of them had already seen the change in her expression in that instant.","Li Moying still maintained his cold face without any expression but Huang Yueli couldn’t help but reveal a smile.","It seemed that Xuan Qingling had feelings for her Senior Brother... He wasn’t as cold as he looked on the surface...","This meant that the two of them had some feelings for each other!","However, what Xuan Qingling had just said had also revealed important information.","Although Xuan Qingling was very reliant on Liu Buyan emotionally, but logically speaking, she still wanted to find a husband who was worthy of her in terms of status and strength.. According to Senior Brother’s current strength, the two of them probably had no chance at all..."]},{"number":4728,"title":"Chapter 4728: The vinegar jar is about to topple over again...","paragraphs":["Chapter 4728: The vinegar jar is about to topple over again...","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Uh, it’s getting late, since... Since the matter has been clarified, I shall not disturb the two of you from resting...”","Xuan Qingling looked in the direction Liu Buyan had left in and was in a daze for quite a while before she recalled that there were still Huang Yueli and Li Moying beside her as she hurriedly turned around and bid farewell to the two of them.","Huang Yueli didn’t say anything as she waved her hand and bid her farewell.","After Xuan Qingling left, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but sigh deeply,” Sigh, I really didn’t expect such a thing to happen. My Senior Brother is too pitiful? I","finally fell in love with someone, but in the end, we were fated to be apart...”","Before she could finish her sentence, she suddenly felt a tight grip on her waist as a man quietly approached her and pulled her into his arms.","Li ‘er, can you explain to me what’ again’?”","A deep voice reverberated in her ears but Huang Yueli only felt a chill on her back.","An idea came to her mind and she immediately started to act shamelessly. That... Husband, you heard wrong. Did I say ‘again’? When did he say that? You heard wrong!","Don’t think about this and that every day and slander your wife!”","Liu Buyan liked her, that was something that happened many years ago and now that time had passed, only the heavens knew why Li Moying was still thinking about it, because she had said a wrong word and the vinegar jar was about to be overturned again...","“Is that so?” Li Moying raised his brows as he looked at the obedient and innocent little fox in his embrace.","How could he not know that this little girl was fooling him? However, he couldn’t do anything to her.","“Of course, why would I lie to you? You’re so young, why are you so paranoid like an old man? This is not good!”","Huang Yueli stretched out her hand and patted his shoulder, conveniently pushing the blame onto her husband’s head and quickly changed the topic.","“Young Miss Xuan’s current situation is indeed very troublesome. If Divine","Doctor Zhang really doesn’t appear for a long time, what should we do next?","Young Miss Xuan is going to the White Fen Continent to find her fiancé, is","Shixiong going to follow? If he was not careful, he might be killed by that","Young Master! But if he didn’t follow, Senior Brother...Wu wu!”","Before Huang Yueli could finish her words, she suddenly felt a warmth on her lips.","Li Moying lowered his head and stopped her from finishing her sentence.","After a long while, he raised his head and frowned.","“Your husband is standing right in front of you. Can you stop calling him Senior Brother? Liu Buyan is already an adult so he will judge what he should do so there’s no need for you to be a busybody!”","“You...!” Huang Yueli’s face turned slightly red as she was suddenly kissed secretly but she couldn’t help but glare at Li Moying.","“How is this nosy? Did your Senior Brother also become sworn brothers with you? Besides...”","‘ Alright alright, compared to Liu Buyan, what’s more important is our next step of the plan. Weren’t you in a hurry to go to the Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s cave and said that you didn’t have enough time? Now that Divine Doctor Zhang isn’t here, what do you plan to do?”","Li Moying didn’t expect that even when he sold out his beauty, he wasn’t able to divert Huang Yueli’s attention away from that fellow surnamed Liu. He was so annoyed that he could only change his plan and change the topic from another angle.","This time, Huang Yueli was stunned as she fell into deep thought,” Uh, this...","This is really...”","Her delicate brows furrowed.","“Back then, we agreed on a three-month deadline with the Saint Iniquitous","Shadow.. Now, more than half a year has passed...”"]},{"number":4729,"title":"Chapter 4729: The Next Step of the Plan","paragraphs":["Chapter 4729: The Next Step of the Plan","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Saint Xieying’s cave had been around for hundreds of thousands of years.","Logically speaking, whether it was three months or half a year, for a spirit body that had existed for so long, it was only a blink of an eye. There was not much difference.","But not knowing why, whenever Huang Yueli thought of this missed promise, her heart would feel uneasy.","She felt that she had overlooked something important.","“We can’t delay Saint Evilshadow any longer. We don’t know when Divine Doctor Zhang will be back, so we should go to Linyin Town first. We’re already familiar with the situation around Linyin Town, and our strength is much stronger than the last time we went, so it shouldn’t take much time. Who knows, when we come back, Divine Doctor Zhang might still be picking herbs outside! However...","Huang Yueli thought about it in her heart as her brows furrowed even tighter, ”","But it’s just Senior Brother’s side that’s still a little troublesome. Senior Brother’s strength is limited, and Miss Xuan’s condition is so unstable. Without us around, I’m afraid the Black Tortoise Race will find her very soon. Even if Shixiong agrees to Miss Xuan’s plan, there’s no way to safely send her to the White Pool Continent...”","If it wasn’t for Liu Buyan’s matter, she wouldn’t waste her time here and she would be able to set off for Linyin Town tonight.","Li Moying replied,” There’s still another way. Otherwise, let’s let Liu Buyan and Miss Xuan follow us.","“You said...Bring them to Linyin Town?”","When Huang Yueli heard that, she subconsciously shook her head,” This isn’t too good right? We can’t let Xuan Qingling know that we’re evil cultivators, so even if they follow us, they can only stay in Linyin Town.”","“We can leave them in the nearby villages and towns. That area is very remote, and there are very few experts from the big families. Moreover, I think these Black Tortoise warriors are most likely acting in secret. Ordinary clansmen won’t know that the two of them are being investigated. Besides, we’ll take the flying ship over instead of walking on the ground. It won’t be easy to track them down.”","Hearing her husband’s analysis, Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up.","“That’s right, husband. You’re really thoughtful. Let them stay in the nearby villages for a period of time. If our trip goes smoothly, we’ll probably be able to leave in a few days. At that time, we’ll bring them back.”","The two of them discussed for a while and decided to hurry up and leave tomorrow to avoid any accidents.","Having thought of the next step of her plan, Huang Yueli completely relaxed and went out to have supper with Li Moying in the dark before resting.","However, what they did not expect was that plans would never catch up with changes.","No matter how thoughtful they were at the beginning, they could not stop the accident when it happened.","The next day, Huang Yueli and Li Moying woke up early and had wanted to knock on Liu Buyan’s room door but they didn’t expect that Liu Buyan and Xuan Qingling woke up earlier than them.","The four of them simply found a place on the first floor of the inn to sit down and eat breakfast.","Huang Yueli told the two of them the plan that she had thought of yesterday, ” Moying and I have some urgent matters to deal with and we have to leave in these two days. If you guys don’t have anything important, you can come with us. Of course, if you have other plans, we won’t force you.”","Liu Buyan immediately nodded,” No problem, we will follow you guys...”","“Wait!”","Before he could finish, Xuan Qingling interrupted him.."]},{"number":4730,"title":"Chapter 4730: Let’s part ways","paragraphs":["Chapter 4730: Let’s part ways","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“I think... This isn’t good.” Xuan Qingling furrowed her brows slightly, looking hesitant.","Liu Buyan immediately looked at her as his expression was filled with anxiety,” Miss Xuan, what’s wrong with you? Didn’t we discuss this last night? In your current situation, you need someone to protect you. Junior Sister and Li Moying have been my good friends for many years and they are my life and death buddies in the Lower Realm so I can totally trust them.”","Xuan Qingling bit her lower lip and shook her head gently.” I know that you have a good relationship with Young Master Li and his wife, but...” But I... I’m different from you. How can I let the two of them take such a big risk to protect me? There’s no need for them to offend the Black Tortoise Race for me, and there’s also Young Master Liu...Actually, there’s no need for you to take the risk of being hunted down to protect me...”","When Liu Buyan heard this, his expression immediately sank, ” What do you mean?”","Xuan Qingling looked at him and seemed to hesitate. In the end, she said,” Young Master Liu, it’s all thanks to you for protecting me during this period of time. I can’t thank you enough!” I will remember your kindness to me and repay it in the future. However, I can’t implicate you anymore.”","“I was with you earlier because you were already targeted by the Black Tortoise Race. I was afraid that after I separated from you, my people would secretly capture you and interrogate you about my whereabouts. It’s different now. You’re with Young Master Li and Patriarch Huang, so you’re definitely not in danger. So...”","When Xuan Qingling said this, she suddenly stopped. After a long while, she gritted her teeth and said,” I think...” Let’s separate here.”","” What did you say?!” Liu Buyan finally couldn’t take it anymore as he stood up from his seat and slammed the table hard.","“Say it again, you want to leave with me here? Are you kidding me?”","When he heard that Xuan Qingling was about to part ways with him, Liu Buyan’s mind buzzed and he could no longer maintain his calm facade.","He usually had a gentle and elegant appearance. Even when he was being chased by people, he would not lose his composure.","Xuan Qingling didn’t expect him to suddenly fly into a rage, and her entire body stiffened.","After a while, he said,” I didn’t make a mistake. I thought about it last night and felt that this was the best plan.” I’m relieved that you’re with Patriarch Huang and the others.”","“What about you? Where are you going if you split up with us?” Liu Buyan also realised that he had lost his composure as he forcefully suppressed his agitated emotions but his tone still carried an unconcealable anxiety,” Don’t tell me that you’re planning to go to the White Pool Continent alone to look for that...Look for your fiancé!”","Compared to Liu Buyan’s irritable temper, Xuan Qingling appeared extremely calm.","She nodded lightly.” That’s right. Yesterday, Patriarch Huang reminded me that An Zhenyu is my fiancé. He’s most likely the reason why I was schemed against. I’ll find him to resolve this matter. Otherwise, I can’t keep running away, right?”","“You...!”","When he heard that Xuan Qingling was really going to look for An Zhenyu, Liu Buyan’s face turned green from anger.","However, he also knew that he was in no position to stop Xuan Qingling, so his expression turned extremely ugly.","At this moment, Huang Yueli who had been listening from the side spoke up: Miss Xuan, I understand what you mean. But forgive me for being blunt. With your current situation, you are all alone.. How do you plan to go to the White Pool Continent?”"]},{"number":4731,"title":"Chapter 4731: I’ve misjudged you!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4731: I’ve misjudged you!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“This...’","Hearing this question, Xuan Qingling, who had been talking non-stop just now, suddenly choked.","Huang Yueli didn’t rush him and just waited quietly at the side.","Xuan Qingling was silent for a long time and Liu Buyan also came to his senses as he went forward to ask,” What’s wrong? Miss Xuan, have you thought about how to go to the White Lake State? If you’re alone, what are you going to do if the spring fragrance in your body spreads? Not to mention, those people from the Black Tortoise Race are still chasing after you. They want to capture you, right?”","Xuan Oingling gritted her teeth and had no intention of changing her mind.”","Anyway...” Anyway, I’ll think of a way myself...”","“What else do you want? What can you think of? Right now, following Junior","Sister and the others is the best way. What are you being pretentious about?” Liu Buyan saw that she was unmoved and refused to accept his help so in his anger, he started to speak without thinking.","As soon as the words left his mouth, he realized that he had said the wrong thing.","As expected, Xuan Qingling’s face turned red, and she glared at him with anger in her eyes.","“I’m not being pretentious! Liu Buyan, can’t you stop following me? Do you know how much trouble you’ve caused me by following me? Do you know what others say? Now, even my family thinks that you’re my lover. If word gets out to the Bai Zhe clan and something happens to my marriage, will you be responsible?”","Initially, Liu Buyan felt that he had gone overboard with his words and was planning to apologize but before he could open his mouth, he heard Xuan Qingling venting her anger like a cannon.","He was stunned. His eyes widened as he looked at Xuan Qingling in disbelief.","“You... What did you say? Do you think I... I’m trouble? A burden?","Do you know that I’m helping you?!”","“Then when you helped me, did you ask if I needed it? I already said that I’m going to leave separately from you guys. Why do you have to follow me? Do I need to explain to you how I’m going to find An Zhenyu? What does my private agreement with my fiancé have to do with you?”","Xuan Qingling gave a cold laugh as she swept a glance at Liu Buyan. The corners of her lips were pursed up slightly as the words that came out of her mouth were words that struck at her heart.","Liu Buyan almost didn’t dare to believe what he heard as he shook his head desperately,” No, it’s not like that...You... How did you become like this? You mean...Do you think I’m in your way?","Stop you from looking for... He went to find that Young Master An? You... That’s impossible. You only got engaged to An Zhenyu at the request of the elders in the family. How can you trust him so much?”","Xuan Qingling lowered her eyes. Her right hand trembled slightly. However, she forced herself to continue.” You’re not me. How do you know that I’m not satisfied with this marriage?” Although An Zhenyu’s cultivation talent is a little lacking, his medical talent is very high. He’s also the young master of the White Marsh Race. I wonder how many people will envy me if I marry him!” Liu Buyan really couldn’t take it anymore as his expression sank.","“Good, very good. Now I know what kind of stupid things I’ve done during this period of time! Even if I misjudged you! Since you insist on leaving alone, then leave! What does it have to do with me if something happens to you on the way?”","As he said that, Liu Buyan slammed the table and stood up directly, turning around to leave.","Xuan Qingling opened her mouth and wanted to say something, but in the end, she held it in and lowered her head silently.."]},{"number":4732,"title":"Chapter 4732: Where is he?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4732: Where is he?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli was enjoying the show so she didn’t interrupt them but when she saw that the situation wasn’t looking good, she hurriedly stood up, wanting to stop Liu Buyan.","“Hey, Senior Brother, you... Wait!”","However, Liu Buyan left in a hurry as he turned a deaf ear to Huang Yueli’s cries and left in large strides without turning back.","Looking at the direction he left, it seemed like he had returned to his room in the inn.","At least Liu Buyan hadn’t left everyone behind and ran off without a trace.","Huang Yueli heaved a sigh of relief as she turned towards Xuan Qingling,” Miss","Xuan, don’t mind it, my Senior Brother he...”","She wanted to say a few words to ease the tense atmosphere and mediate between Xuan Qingling and Liu Buyan.","Who knew that just as she opened her mouth, a loud bang came from not far away.","This voice was so abrupt that it startled the customers who were eating on the first floor.","Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and their expressions changed.","The door of the inn was suddenly kicked open from the outside, and a group of aggressive martial artists rushed in from the outside.","These martial artists did not restrain the aura in their bodies. The pressure they released made the guests and the inn owner shiver.","These... But they were all experts above the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm!","This level of strong practitioners was not commonly seen in the Gods Race and it was even rarer in the Human Race. Any one of this group of practitioners had abilities that far surpassed everyone else in the inn except Huang Yueli and the rest.","Such a group of powerful warriors suddenly appeared in an ordinary inn. They were all armed with weapons and looked murderous. It was obvious that they came with ill intentions.","The inn suddenly became silent.","“Where’s the shopkeeper?” The leader sneered. Who was the manager of this hotel? Come out now!”","The shopkeeper hurriedly walked out from behind the counter. Because he was in a hurry, he staggered and almost fell over.","He took three steps and walked to the captain. His voice trembled as he said, “This...” Sir, may I ask... The reason why you and the other lords have come to our shop is...Do you want to cut the line or...Or stay in the hotel...”","“Neither.” The captain looked at the shopkeeper in disgust and said sternly,” Cut the crap. I’ll ask you a question. Just answer it honestly.”","The shopkeeper was stunned for a moment before he hurriedly nodded.” Yes, yes, yes, sir. You...” Please ask. I will definitely tell you everything I know...”","The captain didn’t even look at him.” I heard that a group of four people checked into your inn yesterday. There were two men and two women. They were all young martial artists and had extraordinary looks. One of the women looked like this. Have you seen it?”","As the captain spoke, he took out a scroll from his sleeve, unfolded it, and shook it in front of the shopkeeper.","On it was an exquisite portrait of Xuan Qingling.","Huang Yueli’s group of four indeed had outstanding looks. When they entered the shop yesterday, they had left a deep impression on him so the shopkeeper immediately recognised them and nodded his head. “This... I’ve seen him before.’","“Where are they now? Bring me to them immediately!”","Cold sweat broke out on the shopkeeper’s forehead as he subconsciously glanced towards the direction of Huang Yueli and the rest’s seats.","The captain followed his gaze.","There were three young martial artists, two women and one man, sitting at a table in the corner of the first floor.","If it wasn’t Xuan Qingling and the two brats who ruined their plans yesterday, who else could it be?"]},{"number":4733,"title":"Chapter 4733: Come with us!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4733: Come with us!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","However, what made the captain feel a little strange was that the three of them were too calm.","It was impossible for Xuan Qingling and the others not to know who they were, right?","Then how could they still be sitting there without panicking at all? Did those two brats think that they were invincible just because they caught them off guard yesterday and beat up their people?","The more the captain thought about it, the angrier he became. With a gloomy face, he strode up to the three of them.","Miss Qing Ling, and these two, you should know why we’re here, right?”","Huang Yueli’s face was calm as she swept a glance at him and said with a smile that was not a smile: ” To be honest, I’m not very sure. It’s not easy for you to find out where we’re staying so quickly. However, I don’t understand. Who gave you the courage to come looking for me today? Was it not enough to get beaten up yesterday?”","Of course she had long recognised that these Heart Profound Realm practitioners in front of her were those Black Tortoise Race practitioners who had surrounded and chased Liu Buyan on the streets yesterday.","However, compared to yesterday, the number of people in the team today was clearly less than half.","She didn’t know if it was because she was injured by Li Moying and had yet to recover.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying naturally wouldn’t put these people in their eyes but when Xuan Qingling saw them earlier, her first reaction was to get up and hide but Huang Yueli forcefully pressed her shoulders down before she sat back down.","Even now, Xuan Qingling was still a little anxious.","It wasn’t strange for them to be able to find out about this inn but Huang Yueli didn’t understand why these people obviously knew that they weren’t her and ?Li Moying’s match but they still dared to come knocking on her door to ask for a beating?","Could it be that he had a new trump card?","“You...” Hearing Huang Yueli’s provocative words, the Black Tortoise Race’s captain almost fell down in anger.","“Damned brat, what did you say? Don’t think that we’re afraid of you just ?because you have some talent! Yesterday, you were just lucky. We were not prepared and fell into your trap! This time, don’t even think about escaping!”","“Now, the three of you get up immediately and come with us! And that Liu guy?","Hurry up and get him out!”","The Black Tortoise Clan’s captain composed himself as he glared angrily at Huang Yueli and said rudely.","Huang Yueli didn’t even move an inch as she looked at this captain as though she was looking at a joke,” How interesting. Since you guys aren’t afraid of us, why are you still saying so much? Why don’t you just rush over and tie us up before leaving?”","The Black Tortoise captain’s expression froze.","Huang Yueli’s words had just poked his sore spot.","If there were only Xuan Qingling and Liu Buyan sitting in the inn now, he would have long brought his men up to make a move.","However, this pair of young geniuses of the god clan was also here.","Although he had gone back yesterday to reflect on it, he felt that they had suffered so much because they had been deceived by their appearances. He did not expect that these two people were tough, which was why they had made such a mistake.","Otherwise, as a Late Heart Profound Realm expert, how could he not be able to do anything to these two underaged brats?","However, now that he was really in front of the two of them, he..He felt a little scared again.","However, even though he was terrified in his heart, he still spoke with a tough tone.” You brat, don’t talk so arrogantly. You don’t know how to be kind! This is called being polite before using force. On account of your young age, I don’t want to pursue what you did yesterday. Come with me obediently.. Otherwise, I won’t be polite to you!”"]},{"number":4734,"title":"Chapter 4734: Getting Back at Him","paragraphs":["Chapter 4734: Getting Back at Him","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The captain’s tone was stern and at the same time he spoke, the Profound Energy pressure in his body was released.","A Late Heart Profound Realm expert’s aura was so imposing that the guests sitting near Huang Yueli and the rest couldn’t bear the pressure and retreated.","Seeing Huang Yueli and the rest not moving at all, everyone revealed a surprised expression and couldn’t help but start discussing softly.","“What is the background of this team of martial artists? They were all Heart Profound Realm experts! When did so many experts come to a small border city like ours? Moreover, it doesn’t seem to be from the alliance army...”","“I don’t know. Anyway, just stay away. Looking at their aggressive appearance, it’s obvious that they’re here with ill intentions. I wonder what kind of powerful faction is behind them.”","“In that case, they are really here for those young people? These three people didn’t look like bad people. How did they offend such a powerful faction? This is too pitiful...’","“What does that have to do with you? Although these three people are young, judging from their looks and temperament, they are most likely from extraordinary backgrounds. We don’t know what grudges there are between them. We have to hide well. If we are accidentally implicated, it will be terrible!”","The guests did not dare to provoke the Black Tortoise Race’s martial artists and took the initiative to hide in a corner. Some even wanted to sneak out. However, this person had just taken a step towards the door when he was blocked back by the martial artist.","“Where do you want to go?”","The guest was shocked and whispered, “This...” Sir, I’m just an ordinary person who came to eat. Since the adults are here to do business, then... Then I won’t disturb you anymore...”","The Black Tortoise Race’s practitioner gave a cold snort: ” I’m sorry. In order to prevent anyone from leaking information to Liu Buyan, before we catch the person, no one is allowed to leave the scene!”","The guest was so frightened that his entire body trembled. He could not even say a word of argument. He shrunk his shoulders and hid.","When Huang Yueli saw this, she couldn’t help but raise her brows,” The guests want to leave so why are you stopping them? Could it be that you feel that there are too few spectators around and want more people to see you being beaten up and embarrassed?”","“Damned brat, you’re about to die, yet you still dare to provoke me. I think you won’t cry until you see the coffin! I’ll teach you a lesson first!”","The captain was so angry by her calm attitude that his entire body trembled. He could not hold it in anymore and swung his palm in front of her.","Because he had suffered a loss in front of Huang Yueli yesterday, so although the Captain was flustered and exasperated, he didn’t dare to be negligent and used more than ninety percent of his strength.","He vowed to take revenge for yesterday’s mistake!","A Late Heart Profound Realm expert attacked with all his might, and the surrounding Heaven and Earth Profound Qi was stirred up.","The air in the inn instantly turned stagnant as a powerful Profound Energy gathered in the Captain’s right hand, forming a piercing blue light sword which shot towards Huang Yueli at lightning speed!","This scene happened too quickly.","Even though the guests were staring at them, they couldn’t even make a sound.","All of them widened their eyes as they watched their captain make his move. Their hearts were in their throats.","Even though Huang Yueli had changed her appearance, but she still looked like a beautiful young lady, looking delicate and weak.","Everyone sympathized with the weak. Although the guests were afraid of the Black Tortoise Race’s practitioner’s strength and no one dared to step forward to save her, but this didn’t stop most of them from sympathizing with Huang Yueli.."]},{"number":4735,"title":"Chapter 4735: Unexpected","paragraphs":["Chapter 4735: Unexpected","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Seeing that such a beautiful girl was about to be slapped, and that this slap would probably cause serious injuries on the spot, many people felt that they could not bear it and looked away.","However, in the blink of an eye, a shrill scream suddenly sounded.","“Ah! Ah...! You... What do you want to do? Let...","Let me go... Damn it, let me go!”","This voice did not sound like the voice of the beautiful girl from before.","Everyone was stunned and quickly turned to look.","He saw Huang Yueli still sitting steadily in her original position, her expression not changing at all, still carrying a faint smile.","In fact, the teacup in her hand didn’t even shake.","On the contrary, that seemingly incomparably powerful Heart Profound Realm expert was being held by the neck by the handsome young man sitting beside Huang Yueli as he was lifted up.","His feet couldn’t touch the ground, and his face was red from being pinched. He was also gasping for breath.","The right hand that Li Moying stretched out was slender and powerful, with distinct joints, looking like the hand of a pampered Young Master. However, it was this hand that was as though it was made of steel and iron, easily controlling a Late Heart Profound Realm practitioner.","Even though the Black Tortoise race captain used all his strength and struggled desperately, he could not move him at all.","Everyone present was completely stunned by this scene.","For a long time, no one dared to make a sound.","No one would have thought that the expert who looked so arrogant and despotic just now, who just emitted a pressure that made people want to vomit blood, would actually be subdued by someone with a single move. Moreover, the other party looked so young and unusually handsome!","This... How was this possible?","If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, none of the guests present would have believed it!","“You... You... Giggle...”","The Black Tortoise Clan’s captain was already out of breath and Li Moying’s strength almost broke his neck.","The sound of bones breaking began to come from his throat, which sounded especially terrifying.","The team members who had been stunned by this scene earlier suddenly woke up and rushed over, surrounding Huang Yueli and the other two.","“All of you...Damn it! How dare you treat our captain like this? Put him down!”","“Do you know who we are? Do you know who our captain is? How dare you treat him like this? I think you don’t want to live anymore!”","“Miss Qing Ling, quickly ask him to put down the captain! If you harm the captain’s life, even you won’t be able to escape the family’s punishment!”","The team members opened their mouths to threaten them, wanting Li Moying to release them.","However, Li Moying didn’t even bat an eyelid, completely ignoring them.","Huang Yueli drank her tea and didn’t look at them.","Even Xuan Qingling, who was called out, only revealed a mocking sneer.” You want my and Young Master Liu’s lives, but now you’re using your family to threaten me and make me beg for mercy to let them go? Do you take me for a","1001!","Huang Yueli put down her teacup and sneered coldly: ” Men, stop talking nonsense with me. If you want us to let her go, then come and snatch her. If you win, we won’t be able to refuse to let her go. If you don’t dare to fight, get lost immediately!”","Being berated by an underage girl in such a harsh manner, and under the watchful eyes of everyone, the faces of the team members present alternated between green and white.."]},{"number":4736,"title":"Chapter 4736: A Big Shot That Can ‘t Be Trifled With","paragraphs":["Chapter 4736: A Big Shot That Can ‘t Be Trifled With","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Although these team members weren’t like Xuan Qingling, who was a top-notch Heaven Grade genius that was heavily nurtured by the family, they were still in the upper middle class of the family since they could reach the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm.","Usually, he could also show off in front of ordinary martial artists.","Who knew that he would be scolded by such a young and beautiful girl today?","Some people’s expressions changed on the spot, and they impulsively wanted to go up and get back at him.","“Shut up, you stinky girl. What did you say? Who wouldn’t dare...”","However, before he could make a move, he was pulled back by the person beside him and gestured in the direction of the captain.","All the impulsive people instantly quieted down.","That’s right, no matter how unwilling they were, what could they do to Huang Yueli and the rest?","They were really like what Huang Yueli had said, not daring to fight with them! The captain was already the strongest among them. Moreover, his strength far exceeded all of them. In the Black Tortoise Race, he was considered a second-rate expert second only to the elders and the others.","However, such an expert was actually defeated by that handsome youth in one move. It seemed that he did not even have the strength to retaliate!","This...","The only explanation was that the man and woman in front of him had actually disguised themselves. They were not as young as they looked. They might be famous experts from other god clans.","If that was really the case, they would have to rush forward rashly. Not to mention taking them down, if they let them go, they would probably end up worse than their captain!","The team members ‘faces turned green and white. They hesitated, not knowing if they should go forward.","Li Moying’s lips curled up into a mocking sneer as his fingers relaxed slightly. Just as the Black Tortoise Clan’s captain was about to suffocate, he finally released his grip out of mercy.","The captain instantly fell to the ground, his entire body sprawled on the ground. He covered his neck with both hands, constantly coughing and panting, desperately breathing in fresh air.","After quite a while, he barely managed to catch his breath and when he raised his head to look at Li Moying again, his eyes were filled with terror and shock.","Towards Li Moying’s formidable strength, no one could experience it more clearly than him.","Earlier when he attacked Li Moying, he basically did not hold back at all. In order to ensure that nothing would go wrong, he had already treated him as an equal opponent to deal with.","However, he had never expected that even though he had been so cautious, he would still be defeated in one move!","Furthermore, Li Moying’s advantage was overwhelming.","It had been many years since he had experienced the feeling of being crushed by a true expert’s incomparably powerful aura. It was as if he was facing the elders of the Black Tortoise Clan who were in high positions in the alliance army.","This was a powerful force that was enough to destroy a warrior’s confidence.","After Li Moying shook him off, he didn’t even look at him as he picked up the teapot again and poured tea for Huang Yueli who was beside him.","“Wifey, why aren’t you eating? Didn’t you say in the morning that the food in this inn is delicious and that you should eat more before going out?”","Huang Yueli pursed her lips,” Being stared at by so many people, where did my appetite come from?”","Li Moying then turned around and realised that although those Black Tortoise Clan practitioners were all filled with terror, they were all staring at them and didn’t leave.","He suddenly frowned.” What? Hurry up and get lost! Are you staying here because you think I don’t dare to kill you?”","“You... You...’","Li Moying’s cold aura seemed to have substance as it made the captain shudder in fear as he started to tremble subconsciously.","However, he still insisted on standing still.” Don’t...” Don’t be complacent too early! To tell you the truth, 1...1 have someone backing me! He’s a big shot that you absolutely can’t afford to offend!","Moreover, he’s about to arrive. At that time, you’ll be in trouble!”","“Oh? Is that so?”","Hearing this, Li Moying raised his brows slightly as he gave a cold sneer, obviously not taking this threat seriously.","Huang Yueli even propped up her chin, looking like a curious baby as she asked: ” Is that so? Who is behind you? Which big shot was it? Could it be that the Black Tortoise Clan’s Patriarch had personally come to Xuehua City? That shouldn’t be.. Didn’t Miss Qing Ling say that he hasn’t recovered from his injuries?”"]},{"number":4737,"title":"Chapter 4737: Are you scared now?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4737: Are you scared now?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","This was the question that the Black Tortoise Race warriors had been waiting for. A smug sneer immediately appeared on their faces.","“With the status of our clan leader, how could he come here for you two juniors? Stop putting on airs! ” Let me tell you, the elder of our Black Tortoise Clan, the Six-star Divine General Xuan Jiuling, who is currently stationed in Youan City, just arrived in Xuehua City yesterday! After hearing about your crime of kidnapping Miss Qing Ling, he was furious and made it clear that if you continue to resist today, he will personally take action! ”","Hearing Xuan Jiuling’s name, the inn immediately became chaotic.","The most famous Divine General in the entire Divine Realm was definitely Xuan Jiuling.","Not long ago, Xuan Jiuling had not only successfully defended You ‘an City against the siege of the demon army, but he had also repelled the demon army. There were even rumors that the demon army’s commander, Rui Jiang, who was already a late-stage Skyfiend expert, had been killed in the battle.","Although there was a rumor that the one who killed Rui Jiang was actually the peerless genius Huang Yueli and Li Moying who had been missing for more than half a year, this eloping couple, but many people still felt that this rumor was too unbelievable.","No matter how talented the two of them were, their age was still there. Killing the otherworldly demons was too ridiculous.","Thus, many people subconsciously felt that this was mostly due to Xuan Jiuling.","As the news of Youan City’s great victory spread like wildfire, Xuan Jiuling’s reputation became more and more famous.","“Lord Xuan Jiuling! Did I hear wrongly? The Mystic Divine General had actually arrived in Xuehua City? When did this happen? If I had known earlier, I would have gone to welcome him!”","“If it weren’t for the Profound Divine General, our Xuehua City would have been destroyed by now. We don’t even know if we’re still alive. That’s great. I’ve long wanted to see Divine General Xuan with my own eyes and thank him properly!”","“What kind of identity does Divine General Xuan have to personally come to the inn to capture someone...Who are those three young men and women over there?”","“Regardless of their background, in front of the Mystic Divine General, they can’t even lower their heads! These two youngsters are young and have strength. No wonder they are so arrogant. However, they are still far from being able to compete with a true top-notch expert like the Mystic Divine General..","“That’s right. If it were me, I would be so scared that I would pee my pants. I wish I could kneel down and beg for forgiveness from the Divine General. However, they seem to be quite calm.”","“That’s right. Why aren’t they reacting at all? Are you scared silly?”","Even the ordinary guests had noticed the situation, so the Black Tortoise Race martial artists naturally noticed it as well.","The captain threw out those harsh words just now, waiting for the two young men in front of him to kneel and beg for mercv.","Xuan Jiuling’s current reputation could be said to be awe-inspiring.","And when Huang Yueli heard the three words Xuan Jiuling, she indeed revealed an obviously stunned expression as her brows raised upwards.","“How is it?” the captain sneered. Now you’re afraid, right? If you kneel down immediately, perhaps the Mystic Divine General will show mercy on account of your young ignorance and ignorance!”","However, after Huang Yueli raised her brows, she quickly regained her composure as she picked up her chopsticks again and slowly started to eat her breakfast.","She didn’t even look at him.","It seemed that the name Xuan Jiuling did not represent the top experts of the Divine Realm, but merely an amiable old grandpa who lived next door.."]},{"number":4738,"title":"Chapter 4738: why Do You Need To Do This?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4738: why Do You Need To Do This?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Whereas Li Moying didn’t even lift his eyelids as his gaze remained on Huang Yueli’s face, occasionally picking up some food for her, peeling some prawns or whatever. That gentle and considerate action coupled with that handsome and cold face, the huge contrast made the surrounding girls ‘eyes turn red with envy.","How could the team leader have expected that he would still be completely ignored even after mentioning the title of the Mystic Divine General!","His face was red with anger and he raised his voice.” Are you two deaf? I said... The Mystic Divine General was coming! If you continue to resist like this, just wait to be captured and thrown into the prison of the alliance army!”","His words were like a stone sinking into the ocean, and he did not receive any response.","The team leader was extremely depressed. He could only turn his head to look at Xuan Qingling. Even if these two young genius martial artists were not clear-headed and did not know Xuan Jiuling’s identity, at least Xuan Qingling knew the seriousness of the matter. She must have been scared out of her wits.","However, this time, he was wrong again.","Xuan Qingling also lowered her head and focused on her breakfast. The expression on her face was obviously more relaxed than before.","Sensing the captain’s gaze, Xuan Qingling raised her head and smiled.” Really?” Was the Divine General here? That’s great. I’m looking for the Divine General to uphold justice for me. When will he arrive? Why don’t my friend and I go over to visit him? It’s a little rude to let the elders come over to visit us.’","Xuan Qingling said as she looked at Huang Yueli beside her.","Huang Yueli smiled and shook her head, ” Why do you need to do this? Didn’t this fellow say that the Mystic Divine Scripture is already here? Then we just have to wait.”","Xuan Qingling thought about it and agreed, so she didn’t say anything else.","As for the Black Tortoise Race captain, he was completely in a mess.","Were these young people crazy?","It was fine if others went crazy, but Xuan Qingling was known for her calmness and self-control in the family. How could she go crazy too?","Could it be that they really had some trump card? Or was there some kind of personal relationship between Divine General Xuan and Xuan Qingling?","The reason why these Black Tortoise Race practitioners dared to invite Xuan Jiuling over to help was because they knew that Xuan Jiuling had been staying in the alliance army for many years and was totally unaware of the situation in the clan. So as long as they lied to him that Xuan Qingling was unhappy with the engagement with the White Marsh Clan’s Young Lord and eloped with Liu Buyan, they would be able to invite Xuan Jiuling to help.","At that time, no matter how Xuan Qingling explained, Xuan Jiuling wouldn’t know which side was right. Out of fairness, he would definitely detain Xuan Qingling and send her back to the Black Turtle Continent.","In this way, they had achieved their goal.","But now, from Xuan Qingling’s tone, it seemed like she couldn’t wait to see Xuan Jiuling?","Could it be that she really had some unknown backing?","The more the captain thought about it, the more he felt that something was wrong. To be safe, he planned to retreat temporarily and go back to inquire about it before making arrangements.","However, before he could get up, there was a commotion at the entrance of the inn.","There was a clamor. It seemed that many people were heading towards the inn.","At this moment, a Black Tortoise warrior rushed in with a face full of joy. He shouted at the captain,” Captain, the Mystic Divine General has already entered the city. He heard about us and came straight to the inn. He’s outside the door now..” These few stinky brats dared to hide Liu Buyan and even injured our people, this time...They’re dead!”"]},{"number":4739,"title":"Chapter 4739: This is too much!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4739: This is too much!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hearing this, all the guests in the inn perked up and subconsciously sat up straight.","He did not expect that Divine General Xuan would really come!","For ordinary martial artists, being able to see a powerhouse of Xuan Jiuling’s level with their own eyes was definitely a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.","The captain was even more delighted as he sneered at Huang Yueli and the rest and turned around to welcome them at the door.","Not long after, Xuan Jiuling’s figure appeared at the entrance of the inn.","The current Xuan Jiuling was completely different from the travel-worn and","The current Xuan Jiuling was completely different from the travel -worn and worried-out appearance he had when he was stationed in Youan City. He had made a great contribution to the great victory in Youan City. Now that he was returning to the alliance army headquarters from Youan City to report, he was sought after by the people along the way, so he was naturally proud of his success.","Xuan Jiuling did not wear armor but wore casual clothes. Coupled with the aura of a peak Dao Profound Realm powerhouse, he looked imposing and unhurried. Even the wrinkles on his face looked like they were much lighter.","Even though his attitude was calm and he did not deliberately release his pressure, the commoners in the inn were still shocked by the aura he emitted.","From the moment Xuan Jiuling entered, the entire inn became quiet. Many people did not even dare to breathe loudly.","When the Black Tortoise Race’s captain saw Xuan Jiuling, it was as if he had seen his family. He quickly rushed in front of him and bowed. He forcefully suppressed his excitement and said, “Lord Divine General, you’re finally here...” ‘These two brats are too arrogant. They won’t let go of Miss Qing Ling. When they hear your name, they even look like they don’t think much of it...’ This was too much! Moreover, they even beat up the members of the Black Tortoise Race. They’re clearly going too far. You must uphold justice for us!”","Xuan Jiuling had an extremely high prestige in the Black Tortoise Clan. Not only because he was a Six-star Divine General, but also because he had always been protective of his own people. He hated seeing his clansmen being bullied. As long as there were outsiders who dared to attack the Black Tortoise Clan, he would stand up and uphold justice.","The captain had thought that Xuan Jiuling would be enraged after saying these words and would teach those two brats a lesson.","Who knew that Xuan Jiuling’s first reaction was to raise his eyebrows when he heard this, revealing a look of disdain.” You brought a team of Heart Profound Realm martial artists and you can’t even deal with two little brats? Now, the members of the Black Tortoise Clan had actually slacked off to this extent and their strength had dropped so quickly? When I go back this time, I really have to talk to the clan leader properly!”","The captain was so angry that he almost vomited blood.","He was considered one of the more outstanding experts among the younger generation of the Black Tortoise Clan. Now, he was actually being despised by Xuan Jiuling. However, he could not say anything to refute it.","After all, it was a fact that he was beaten up by the two little brats...","” Where is Xuan Qingling?” Xuan Jiuling asked. Bring me there.”","The captain hurriedly stretched out his hand and pointed in the direction of Huang Yueli’s table as he replied: ” It’s over there. Lord Divine General, I’ll bring you over...’","Before he could finish his sentence, he saw Xuan Jiuling looking in the direction of the table. His entire body trembled and his eyes instantly widened.","Immediately, Xuan Jiuling impatiently strode past the captain.","“God...Your Excellency Divine General, you are... Wait for me!”","The captain was shocked by his reaction. He was stunned for a moment and quickly chased after him.","Xuan Jiuling stopped beside Huang Yueli’s table and exclaimed in shock, “Huang...”"]},{"number":4740,"title":"Chapter 4740: Fate","paragraphs":["Chapter 4740: Fate","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xuan Jiuling recognized the young man and woman in front of him at a glance.","Although Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s disguises could be said to be the work of nature and even the aura on their bodies had been deliberately restrained, but Xuan Jiuling had seen the two of them in disguise before.","Some time ago, he had almost made a fool of himself under the city gate tower of Youan City, so he had a particularly deep impression of him.","He almost blurted out Huang Yueli’s name but Huang Yueli gave him a timely glance and Xuan Jiuling suddenly regained his senses as he swallowed back the words that were about to come out of his mouth.","He had almost forgotten that these two young men were in the process of hiding their identities and escaping from the marriage...","Xuan Jiuling really could not figure out what the Sacred Phoenix Clan and Cloudy Qilin Clan had to make a ruckus about. With the union of two divine grade geniuses with such outstanding innate talent, the status of the two great clans would definitely rise in the future. Their Black Tortoise Clan was extremely jealous but these two clans were actually unwilling, causing the two children to run away from home. They really did not know how fortunate they were.","Huang Yueli didn’t get up but sat at her original position as she cupped her hands towards him,” Mysterious Divine General, how have you been? It was fate that they met here. I wonder if you’ve had breakfast yet. Why don’t you sit down and have some?”","“Ahem, Li... Miss Li, long time no see. I didn’t expect you and Young Master Li to still be in Xuehua City. What a coincidence.”","Xuan Jiuling coughed lightly as he called out Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s usual alias.","At this moment, he had already recovered from his initial shock and recalled that Huang Yueli and the rest had just left You ‘an City a few days ago so it wasn’t strange for them to appear here.","He calmed down.","However, the Black Tortoise Race warriors and the guests in the inn had their jaws drop to the ground.","Earlier when they heard that Xuan Jiuling was coming, everyone felt that Huang Yueli and the rest were going to be in big trouble and would definitely be taught a lesson.","Even though Huang Yueli and the rest had been very calm, everyone still felt that these few youths didn’t know the immensity of heaven and earth. At this moment, they were still putting on an act. Who knew how they would die later!","However, who knew that after Xuan Jiuling arrived, not only did he not teach them a lesson harshly, but he even...He even started to chat with them in a familiar manner.","Moreover, from Xuan Jiuling’s tone, he was very polite to them. There was even a faint feeling of fear and reverence...","What was going on?","The Black Tortoise Race captain’s legs turned a little weak.","His eyes were fixed on Huang Yueli as his face was filled with terror.","Huang Yueli didn’t even look at him as she continued to speak to Xuan Jiuling.","“My husband and I were just passing by and were prepared to leave yesterday. However, on the way there, he happened to encounter two friends who were being pursued. He saved one of them and delayed some time. Otherwise, we wouldn’t have met today.”","“Friends?” Xuan Jiuling was stunned.","Huang Yueli’s gaze swept towards Xuan Qingling who was sitting on her right.","Xuan Qingling immediately stood up and bowed respectfully to Xuan Jiuling.” Junior Xuan Qingling greets Lord Divine General.”","When Xuan Jiuling saw her, his brows furrowed subconsciously.","It was only now that he connected what the captain had told him earlier with the young men in front of him.","“In that case, what they mentioned just now... The person who kidnapped Xuan Qingling was...Miss Li and Young Master Li? This... What was going on?","Did you know each other before?”"]},{"number":4741,"title":"Chapter 4741: Preposterous!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4741: Preposterous!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xuan Qingling pursed her lips. She knew that this was the best time for her to clear her name. Without hesitation, she said,” Lord Divine General, what they said is not true. I was not kidnapped. I was framed and forced...”","“No, no, no. It’s not like that. Lord Divine General, we came this time under the orders of the higher-ups. And the matter between Miss Qing Ling and that spirit pharmacist was also witnessed by the clansmen. They are definitely not wronged!”","Hearing Xuan Qingling’s words, the captain’s heart tightened. He knew that things were going to be bad. He didn’t care about his nervousness and fear anymore. He quickly stepped forward and defended himself.","However, Xuan Jiuling didn’t listen to his words at all. Instead, his face darkened and he flung his sleeves.","“Get lost! I’m talking to a friend, how can you interrupt?”","The strength of a Dao Profound Realm powerhouse was by no means trivial. Even if Xuan Jiuling was just out of anger, casually waving his hand, the pressure that dissipated still made the captain’s chest stagnate, taking a few steps back uncontrollably.","The captain stumbled and bumped into a table behind him before he barely managed to steady himself.","The guests sitting at the table all looked at him.","” What are you looking at?” The captain’s face turned red when he noticed the inquisitive gazes. He scolded in a low voice. Be careful, or I’ll poke your eyes out!”","When the guests heard this, they quickly averted their gazes and even secretly moved away.","Even so, the shame and anger in the Black Tortoise Race’s captain’s eyes could not fade for a long time. Looking at the three people who were chatting happily with Xuan Jiuling, he could not figure out the background of those two young martial artists. Xuan Jiuling actually treated him as a “friend”?","Could it be that he was some old monster who lived in seclusion in the mountains and forests? Was he only cultivating secret techniques or was he very good at disguising himself? That was why he looked so young even when his bones were young?","Xuan Qingling was originally a little nervous, but after being interrupted by the Black Tortoise Race captain, she calmed down instead.","She seized the opportunity and quickly recounted everything that had happened.","Of course, it wasn’t appropriate for her to mention the aphrodisiac in front of her elders, so Xuan Qingling only vaguely mentioned that she was poisoned by some kind of intermittent poison.","“.. That Young Master Liu is a spirit apothecary. I met him during the Divine Realm Martial Competition, so we can be considered to have some friendship. He saw that I was poisoned and was worried that something would happen to me, so he followed me and wanted to detoxify me. There’s no ambiguity between the two of us, let alone eloping..","Xuan Jiuling was very calm at first, but the more he listened, the more his brows furrowed.","” Xuan Qingling, do you mean that someone in the family framed you and poisoned you, forcing you to leave the family and go into hiding?” How preposterous! How could there be such a scum in the family? How could he harm the younger generation of the family? It’s simply a disgrace to the Black","Tortoise Race!”","Xuan Jiuling was furious.","He had always been the clansman with the greatest sense of honor. He had not married for so many years and had always been in the alliance army to help the Black Tortoise Clan expand its influence in the alliance army.","It was precisely because of this that he was so respected in the Black Tortoise clan.","He hated this kind of internal strife among his clansmen the most.."]},{"number":4742,"title":"Chapter 4742: Acting Under Orders","paragraphs":["Chapter 4742: Acting Under Orders","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xuan Jiuling slammed the table and turned to look at the Captain who was cowering in the corner.” Come over here! Tell me clearly, is what Xuan Qingling said the truth? How dare you harm the geniuses of the clan? You’re simply audacious!”","The Captain had been hiding in the corner, trying to reduce his presence as much as possible. He did not expect to be called out.","The aura emitted from the entire body of the Dao Profound Realm powerhouse under a raging rage made him shudder.","However, he didn’t even have the chance to dig a hole to hide in. He could only brace himself and walk forward.","He stole a glance at Xuan Qingling, then said in a trembling voice, “Lord Divine General, I...” This lowly one definitely doesn’t have the guts to murder the clan leader’s genius, please be clear! I was ordered by the higher-ups to lead a team here. My goal is to get Young Miss Qingling and her affair... Cough, cough. Bring Young Master Liu back with him. As for other things, I don’t know at all, and...","There’s no way to ask! ”","Xuan Jiuling’s gaze swept across the Captain’s face and he frowned slightly. He believed him a little.","A Heart Profound Realm cultivator’s status in the family was probably not comparable to a genius like Xuan Qingling, who was heavily nurtured. He would definitely not dare to touch Xuan Qingling.","There must be someone behind this.","Xuan Jiuling’s face darkened.” Since you’re following orders, I won’t make things difficult for you. Tell me the name of the mastermind! I want to see who is so arrogant and despotic to do such a thing!”","Hearing this, the Captain lowered his head and complained in his heart. Cold sweat broke out on his forehead.","The person who assigned this mission to him was also an important figure in the Black Tortoise Clan. In terms of status, he was not inferior to Xuan Jiuling.","Moreover, his entire family worked under that big shot. If he exposed the other party’s identity and offended him, the consequences would be unimaginable.","However, looking at Xuan Jiuling’s stance, if he didn’t say anything, he wouldn’t be able to escape today...","“What’s wrong?” Xuan Jiuling snorted coldly as he lost his patience. You don’t want to tell me?”","The Captain trembled and barely managed to say, “I...” It’s not that I don’t want to say it, but... Instead, I’m not sure...”","“Since you don’t know anything, I can only assume that you attacked Xuan Qingling on your own accord.” Xuan Jiuling sneered. The crime of persecuting a genius of the same race was not light. He would be sent to the Nine Serenities","Cold Pool Water Prison for at least 200 years! You have to think carefully!”","Hearing this, the Captain’s entire body trembled.","He was less than a hundred years old. Two hundred years of water imprisonment was too long.","Moreover, it was said that the water prison was filled with cold poison. The poison gas invaded the bones and brain, causing people to be in unbearable pain.","Two hundred years like this was simply unimaginable.","When he thought of the miserable state of the prisoners in the water prison that he had heard from his family, he was so scared that his legs went weak and he knelt on the ground.","“Lord Divine General, don’t! Lord Divine General, I beg you, please spare me this time! I really don’t know anything. I have orders from above and can only follow orders. I didn’t mean to make things difficult for Young Miss Qingling!","This lowly one has always abided by the clan’s rules and is law-abiding. Please be clear!”","Huang Yueli looked at the miserable state of this person who was crying bitterly and her eyes flashed with a trace of disdain.","If she hadn’t seen the arrogance of this Captain leading his men to chase and humiliate Liu Buyan, she would have almost believed his nonsense!"]},{"number":4743,"title":"Chapter 4743: Who Is Lying?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4743: Who Is Lying?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Xuan Jiuling was a big shot in the Allied Armies, so he was naturally not so easily fooled.","” I’ll give you one last chance,” he said coldly, not hiding the impatience in his eyes.” If you don’t want to tell me, you don’t have to tell me anymore!”","Xuan Jiuling’s voice wasn’t loud, but at the same time, he released a trace of pressure.","The Captain shivered. He realized that Xuan Jiuling was really angry. He knew that if he continued to delay, he would definitely not have a good ending.","He cowered on the ground and hesitated for a moment before gritting his teeth and saying,”Lor... Lord Divine General, this lowly one does not dare to hide. When the higher-ups gave the order, they only gave me a transfer order to bring people over to carry out the mission. They really didn’t show up. There are a total of six teams that have been mobilized this time. The one I’m leading is only one of them. It’s responsible for searching the nearby towns. However...”","He paused for a moment and swept his gaze across his teammates not far away. Then, he took a few steps forward and approached Xuan Jiuling. He lowered his voice and said,” However, I heard that the commander in charge above me is Elder Qingguang’s distant cousin. He has been showing off his identity in front of others many times. Before we set off this time, I heard him tell others that this is a major matter that his ancestor has instructed him to do. He will definitely do his best to do it well...”","Before the Captain could finish his sentence, Xuan Jiuling’s brows twitched. He raised his head and stared at the Captain with a pair of cold eyes.","“What did you say? You said, this is Qing...How was this possible? You didn’t lie to me? I’m warning you, if you dare to randomly climb up and bite others, and splash dirty water on others, this Divine General will definitely not let you off easily!","Taking care of a brat like you is as easy as lifting a finger!”","The Captain trembled and fell to his knees with a thud. Looking at the expression on his face, he was about to cry.","“Lord Divine General, this lowly one’s position is low and my words are light. How would I dare to deceive you? What I said just now was absolutely true. Please examine it carefully!”","Xuan Jiuling narrowed his eyes and stared at him for a while, his eyes full of confusion.","With this Captain’s identity, the possibility of him deceiving him was really not high.","However, the Elder Qingguang he mentioned earlier...","He was a prominent figure in the Black Tortoise Clan. He was one of the three managing elders in the clan whose status was second only to the clan leader.","In terms of status in the clan, he was on par with Xuan Jiuling.","More importantly, she and Xuan Jiuling had known each other for many years and knew each other very well. No matter what, it didn’t seem like she would do something like persecuting the geniuses of her own race.","Could it be that Xuan Qingling lied?","Xuan Jiuling’s gaze shifted between Xuan Qingling and the Captain.","Huang Yueli saw it and blinked her eyes as she asked in puzzlement: ” Divine General Xuan, is there something wrong? What did he say just now? The person who framed Young Miss Qingling... Is it convenient for you to tell me and my husband?”","Although when Xuan Jiuling was talking to the Captain earlier, the distance wasn’t too far and Huang Yueli could clearly hear it as long as she released her spiritual perception, but out of respect for the seniors in the Allied Armies, she didn’t eavesdrop.","Xuan Jiuling furrowed his brows and pondered for a while before saying,” According to this person, he came under the orders of an elder of the Black Tortoise Clan. However, I’ve known this person for nearly a hundred years. Whether it’s his strength or his character, he has always been impeccable. Moreover, she has an extremely high status in the clan. I don’t believe that she would use such a method to frame a junior!”"]},{"number":4744,"title":"Chapter 4744: Marriage of the White Fen Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 4744: Marriage of the White Fen Clan","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment as she turned her head to look at Li Moying, only to discover that her husband was also slightly astonished.","On the contrary, Xuan Qingling’s expression remained the same. It seemed that she had already guessed this outcome.","As expected, Xuan Jiuling quickly turned to look at her. With a stern face, he asked,” Xuan Qingling, I’ve always heard that you have a good character and are a pillar of the younger generation of the family. That’s why I believed you.” I didn’t expect that even you would lie to me! You’re really bold!”","These words were very serious.","If it were an ordinary person, they would have been so scared that they would have knelt down and begged for mercy.","However, Xuan Qingling was still very calm. She slowly stood up and cupped her hands in salute to Xuan Jiuling. Then, she said unhurriedly,” Lord Divine General, I would never dare to lie to you. Everything I said just now is true.” As for what the Captain said just now, I can more or less guess. I’m one of the top geniuses in the family, so someone who can frame me must have a high status. I just didn’t expect that this person was actually an elder!”","Xuan Jiuling didn’t expect Xuan Qingling to still be so calm and firm in her own opinion.","For a moment, he was stunned.","However, his face soon darkened again.” Xuan Qingling, are you implying that the elder is framing you? You’re just a cultivator of the younger generation. What makes you think that it’s necessary for the elders to harm you? Moreover, this person is an old friend of mine. I don’t believe she would do such a thing! You better tell me honestly, why did you fabricate a lie! Is it true that you eloped with that Spirit Medicine Master surnamed Liu?!”","Xuan Jiuling gradually lost his patience. His tone became more and more serious, and his voice and expression became more and more severe.","Under the pressure of a Dao Profound Realm powerhouse, the entire inn was completely silent. Not a single person dared to casually speak or move.","The air seemed to have frozen.","” I’m just telling the truth,” Xuan Qingling said in a neither servile nor overbearing manner.” I don’t know if it has anything to do with that elder.” However, if you want to talk about the motive of framing me, I guess it should be related to the marriage of the White Fen Clan.”","She didn’t seem to be frightened by Xuan Jiuling’s imposing manner at all.","Just based on this point alone, the Captains and soldiers who had been chasing after her could not help but admire her.","They had been scared witless by Xuan Jiuling’s pressure just now.","In comparison, Xuan Qingling was indeed one of the top genius cultivators in the family.","Xuan Jiuling didn’t expect Xuan Qingling to be so calm even after he had released 50% of his pressure. He couldn’t help but be surprised by her extraordinary talent.","Although they couldn’t be compared to Huang Yueli and Li Moying who were heaven defying existences, but a genius with such a good temperament and willpower was also very rare.","Xuan Jiuling’s tone softened a little because he was filled with pity.” You said...” Your marriage with the young master of the White Fen Clan? This was a match made in heaven, a joyous occasion. Why did the clan elders interfere? This doesn’t make sense at all!”","Although the young master of the White Fen Clan was not as talented as Xuan Qingling, from the perspective of the clan, the Black Tortoise Clan should benefit more from this marriage.","Spirit Medicine Master was considered one of the occupations with the highest status in the God Realm. Which cultivator could guarantee that they would not be injured and would not have to beg a Spirit Medicine Master?","Which family didn’t have the idea of obtaining medical resources from the White Fen Clan by marrying them? However, the White Fen Clan was also proud of their status and almost never married with other families.","This time, it was also said that the young master of the White Fen Clan fell in love with Xuan Qingling at first sight, which was why he had tried his best to take the initiative to marry her.","It was a good thing that everyone in the Black Tortoise Clan could not have wished for.","Xuan Qingling said,” No matter who framed me, they chose this time to do it. It’s obvious that they want to ruin my marriage with Young Master An. Maybe someone else wants to marry into the White Fen Clan in my place. Who knows?”","Hearing this, Xuan Jiuling frowned again.","Xuan Qingling’s words were reasonable.","He didn’t know which side he should believe."]},{"number":4745,"title":"Chapter 4745: You... Why are you back?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4745: You... Why are you back?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","At this moment, hurried footsteps came from the corridor on the second floor of the inn.","Immediately after, an anxious male voice sounded.” Lord Divine General, I can testify that Young Miss Xuan definitely has no intention of eloping with anyone. I saw her being framed with my own eyes!”","Hearing this voice, Huang Yueli and the rest were stunned as they subconsciously raised their heads to look upstairs.","Liu Buyan who was dressed in white heard the commotion downstairs as he rushed over with large strides.","When Xuan Qingling saw his figure, she was stunned on the spot.” Young Master Liu, you...” Why are you back?”","Earlier when Liu Buyan left in a fit of anger, although she looked like she was in a daze, in fact, her heart wasn’t that muddled.","After all, the two of them had been together for a few months and she could more or less feel Liu Buyan’s faint feelings towards her. But she admitted that she was already engaged and didn’t intend to delay Liu Buyan so she kept avoiding talking about it and even wanted to act dumb to make Liu Buyan leave so as not to drag him down.","When she heard that Xuan Jiuling was coming, she felt a little lucky.","Luckily Liu Buyan had already left or else if Xuan Jiuling didn’t believe her words, it would inevitably implicate Liu Buyan.","However, Xuan Qingling didn’t expect that not long after she was rejoicing, Liu Buyan actually returned by himself...","Liu Buyan walked hurriedly to the table and when he passed by Xuan Qingling, it was as though he didn’t hear her as he brushed past her and came to Xuan Jiuling.","He bowed slightly as he bowed towards Xuan Jiuling,” Divine General Xuan, Junior Liu Buyan has long heard of Lord Divine General’s name and when I heard that you had come here, I specially rushed over to pay my respects.”","Xuan Jiuling was confused at first, but he immediately understood when he heard him introduce himself.","You’re the Spirit Medicine Master who traveled with Xuan Qingling?”","Liu Buyan nodded his head,” That’s right, it’s Junior.”","Xuan Jiuling’s face immediately darkened. He snorted coldly, ” You’re quite bold, kid! I was just about to get someone to find you, but you came over yourself! Do you know what you’ve done? Do you know that my people have been hunting you? You actually dare to appear in front of this old man?”","Liu Buyan gave a slight smile and replied calmly,” Lord Divine General, Junior doesn’t have any evil intentions so why should I avoid meeting you? I didn’t do the things you mentioned just now, so I naturally have to come out and explain clearly. I can’t let anyone splash dirty water on Young Miss Xuan and me, right?”","Xuan Jiuling’s eyes narrowed slightly as he stared at Liu Buyan for a long while as he was secretly shocked in his heart.","Judging from the aura of the young man in front of him, he should not be a god. Even if there was a trace of god aura, he was at most a mixed-blood. Most of it was of human descent.","In front of the Ancient God Clans, it was usually very difficult for Human practitioners to control their instinctive fear and Liu Buyan’s cultivation wasn’t considered high as he was merely a peak Dream Profound Realm practitioner. Among the Humans, he was considered to have outstanding innate talent but when compared to the peerless geniuses of the Ancient God Clans, there was still a huge gap.","Just such a young man actually did not cower in the slightest when facing a late-stage Dao Profound Realm powerhouse like him. Forget about his legs going soft, even his tone when he spoke was so calm.","Furthermore, Liu Buyan had handsome features and elegant bearing, giving him an extraordinary bearing.","When did such a figure appear in the younger generation of the humans?"]},{"number":4746,"title":"Chapter 4746: Character as a Promise","paragraphs":["Chapter 4746: Character as a Promise","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","How could Xuan Jiuling have thought that Liu Buyan could be so calm in front of him, other than his outstanding willpower, the most important reason was that he had interacted with Huang Yueli and Li Moying too much.","In terms of strength alone, this couple was already not inferior to a top expert like Xuan Jiuling. It was just that their combat experience was slightly lacking.","Even though when the two of them faced Liu Buyan, they would restrain their own pressure but after spending so much time together, Liu Buyan didn’t feel anything special in front of top notch experts.","Xuan Jiuling slowly frowned.” You’re saying that my clansmen are slandering you? Then tell me, what is your relationship with Xuan Qingling? You’re not related to her, so why did you travel with her for so long? I heard that the two of you often live in the same room, alone. You don’t know how to avoid suspicion, and you dare to say that there’s no ambiguity?”","Liu Buyan was long prepared as he replied in a neither servile nor overbearing manner,” I’m travelling with Young Miss Xuan for a couple of reasons. For one, because she was poisoned and it would act up once every few days. I’ve received Young Miss Xuan’s grace in the past and was saved by her so it’s impossible for me to watch her suffer and leave on her own. The other reason...”","He paused for a moment and swept his gaze across the Black Tortoise Clan warriors behind Xuan Jiuling. The corners of his mouth curled into a mocking arc.","“Lord Divine General, aren’t you asking the obvious? The nobles have been hunting us down with the excuse that I have an affair with Young Miss Xuan. My cultivation is not even as good as Young Miss Xuan’s. If I were to separate from her, I would probably be caught in less than a day. At that time, I would die without knowing where I died. How could I take such a risk?”","“As for staying with Young Miss Xuan, it’s only because the poison in her basically acts up at night. I’m worried that something might happen. I sleep on the floor every day, I don’t dare to offend Young Miss Xuan!”","Xuan Jiuling frowned and pondered for a while.","He originally didn’t want to believe outsiders but Liu Buyan’s two reasons were really too reasonable. Even if it was him, he couldn’t find any room to refute.","But to have him believe in Xuan Qingling and Liu Buyan’s innocence, it also meant that his good friend Elder Qingguang had betrayed the clan...","Between an outsider and a good friend, who should he trust?","“Brat, do you think you can convince me with this kind of sophistry? What evidence do you have for saying these words? Moreover, even if you and Xuan Qingling didn’t cross the line, who can guarantee that you don’t have feelings for each other? You just said that Xuan Qingling saved your life...In that case, you two have known each other since a long time ago?","Xuan Qingling didn’t mention this to me just now! Don’t tell me that you’re hiding something from me?”","Liu Buyan pursed his lips,” This...Junior really can’t find any evidence. I can’t produce any evidence for this kind of thing. I can only guarantee it with my character...”","“Character guarantee?” Hearing this, Xuan Jiuling couldn’t help but laugh out loud. “If you were one of the few experts among the younger generation of the Ancient God Clan, I could still test your character. But you’re just a human. Judging from your talent, you’re just so-so. Why should I believe in your character?”","For a moment, Liu Buyan actually couldn’t say anything as his expression turned stiff.","When he was in the lower realm, he was also a top cultivator with outstanding talent. After arriving in the God Realm, he was looked down upon by others.","Even though the person who despised him was a dignified Divine General, he was still extremely ashamed and resentful.","At this moment, Huang Yueli suddenly spoke up: ” Lord Divine General, do you have any doubts about my Senior Brother’s character?”"]},{"number":4747,"title":"Chapter 4747: Senior Brother?!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4747: Senior Brother?!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli who had been observing the situation from the side suddenly opened her mouth, causing Xuan Jiuling to feel greatly surprised.","He was stunned.” Senior Brother? What Senior Brother? Young Miss Li, you actually have a Senior Brother? Why did you suddenly...”","Xuan Jiuling’s words were halfway through when he suddenly paused as he followed Huang Yueli’s line of sight towards Liu Buyan as though he understood something.","“You... Are you talking about him? That... That’s impossible, right? I must have guessed wrongly...”","However, Huang Yueli nodded her head and said with absolute certainty: ” Lord Divine General, you didn’t guess wrongly. The Senior Brother I’m talking about is Liu Buyan.”","“What is it? Is this Liu kid really your Senior Brother? How is this possible?” When Xuan Jiuling heard that, he turned pale with fright and almost broke the teacup beside him.” He...He’s...”","It wasn’t that Xuan Jiuling wanted to lose his composure. It was just that this matter was too outrageous in his eyes!","Who was Huang Yueli?","God Realm finally gained a god grade genius that had not appeared for tens of thousands of years, the Sacred Phoenix Race’s current Matriarch, not even twenty years old and already had astonishing talent, joining hands with Li Moying to kill a Sky Devil powerhouse, suspected to have already stepped into Dao Profound Realm!","Without a doubt, she would definitely become one of the few people at the peak of the entire God Realm in no time.","As for Liu Buyan? At best, he was a genius of the humans. From Xuan Qingling’s tone, he seemed to be very talented in medicine. However, medicine was different from cultivation. Compared to talent, the various medical codes and secret recipes passed down in the family were more important. Liu Buyan was a human and just based on this point, his achievements in this lifetime would at most be a Heaven Grade Spirit Medicine Master.","Admittedly, to the Human Race, with Heaven Grade innate talent, coupled with Heaven Grade spirit medicine technique, they could already walk unhindered in the Human Race. But no matter what, compared to the legendary level genius Huang Yueli, the gap was still too huge.","If Huang Yueli didn’t admit it personally, even if Xuan Jiuling was beaten to death, he wouldn’t believe that there was such a baffling matter.","Huang Yueli had long expected that he would have such a reaction as she smiled and explained calmly.","“It’s like this, Lord Divine General. I believe you should know that I’m a cultivator who ascended from the Lower Realm. When I was in the Lower Realm, I was in the same sect as Young Master Liu to learn medicine. However, my knowledge is shallow, and my medical attainments are limited. Compared to my Senior Brother Liu, I’m really too far behind.”","After Xuan Jiuling heard this, he finally understood. ” I see. Young Master Liu and Young Miss Li, you...” They ascended from the same Lower Realm. No wonder their relationship was extraordinary.","He secretly heaved a sigh of relief.","The relationship between Senior Brothers and Junior Sisters in the Lower Realms had already known each other since the beginning and their feelings were more intimate but at least it showed that Liu Buyan didn’t have any special background.","Earlier when Huang Yueli said that, it made him think that he had made a mistake. Liu Buyan was actually the heir of some big power so he had really offended him today.","“Cough cough, Young Miss Li, of course I believe in your Senior Brother’s character, but this matter is of great importance. I have to consider the pressure from the family. Why don’t we do this? Young Master Liu, come back with me. I promise that I won’t let anyone hurt him. As long as the truth is found out, I’ll let him go immediately. What do you think?”","Huang Yueli didn’t say anything.","Just when Xuan Jiuling thought that he had convinced her, a cold snort came from the other side.","“In that case, does Divine General Xuan really want to detain my Elder Brother?”"]},{"number":4748,"title":"Chapter 4748: Completely Confused","paragraphs":["Chapter 4748: Completely Confused","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“El..Eld..Elder...Elder Brother? What Elder Brother?”","When Xuan Jiuling heard this, his jaw almost fell to the ground.","Earlier when he was talking to Xuan Qingling and Liu Buyan, Huang Yueli had occasionally voiced out her opinion but Li Moying had not said a single word from the start, with an indifferent expression on his face. Xuan Jiuling naturally assumed that Liu Buyan and the rest had a good relationship with Huang Yueli and Li Moying had only intervened in this matter on account of Madam’s face so as long as he could convince Huang Yueli, the matter would be resolved.","However, he had never expected that Li Moying would open his mouth at this critical juncture.","Moreover, the words that came out of his mouth were so terrifying.","Li Moying’s right hand held the teacup as he gently spun it around. He slightly raised his eyes to glance at Xuan Jiuling as he said with a smile that was not a smile,” Lord Divine General, my Wife forgot to mention earlier. Other than being my Wife’s Senior Brother, Liu Buyan is also my sworn brother....”","” What?!”","Xuan Jiuling’s eyes widened in shock.","This piece of news was really too surprising and it was even more unbelievable than the matter of Huang Yueli saying that Liu Buyan was her Senior Brother!","Although they were very close to each other, there were still differences between them. Not every disciple had a good relationship.","However, becoming sworn brothers was another matter. If they did not have a life-and-death friendship, it was absolutely impossible to become sworn brothers.","With Li Moying’s identity, he would actually become sworn brothers with a human?","“This... This... Young Master Li, what are you talking about... Is that true?”","Li Moying frowned slightly,” Why? Could it be that Lord Divine General thinks that I’m the kind of person who talks nonsense?”","” Cough cough, of course I didn’t mean that.” Xuan Jiuling couldn’t take the blame and quickly shook his head to deny it.” It’s just that...” Cough cough, yes, this old man remembered. Just now, Young Miss Li already said that you all ascended from the same Lower Realm. Back then, you became sworn brothers in the Lower Realm, right? I didn’t expect it...”","“No, I don’t. Lord Divine General, you’ve misunderstood.” Li Moying spoke out once again, interrupting him.","Then, under Xuan Jiuling’s surprised gaze, he slowly said,” Although Elder Brother and I were already familiar with each other in the Lower Realm, we only became sworn brothers after we arrived in the God Realm. Moreover, I did this because I wanted to thank him for saving my life.”","Xuan Jiuling was completely dumbfounded and could only subconsciously follow Li Moying’s words,” Ah? What?! Saving your life?!”","Li Moying’s lips curled up lightly as he briefly recounted the incident where he was attacked by Sacred Phoenix Clan’s Elder and fell unconscious, and Cloudy Qilin Clan publicly recruited Spirit Medicine Masters who could cure him in the entire God Realm.","This matter had caused a huge commotion back then, so Xuan Jiuling naturally heard about it.","But he had never expected that Li Moying’s injuries had left so many famous doctors in the God Realm helpless and the White Fen Clan’s Patriarch had even personally gone to treat him but he had returned without any results. In the end, the one who saved Li Moying was actually Liu Buyan?","“This... This... There was actually such a thing? No wonder...He did not expect Young Master Liu’s medical skills to be so high! This ...This old man has really misjudged...”","Xuan Jiuling didn’t know what to say, his heart was filled with shock.","However, there was one person who was even more confused than Xuan Jiuling, and that was Liu Buyan himself."]},{"number":4749,"title":"Chapter 4749: Most Probably Still Asleep","paragraphs":["Chapter 4749: Most Probably Still Asleep","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hearing Li Moying’s words, Liu Buyan’s jaw almost dropped to the ground.","Although Li Moying wasn’t wrong and they had indeed become sworn brothers before, but Li Moying definitely didn’t become sworn brothers with him because of some life-saving grace. Back then, the one who saved Li Moying wasn’t him, but Huang Yueli!","Li Moying’s motive was to make Cloudy Qilin Clan accept Huang Yueli more easily but in the end, this plan ended in failure.","From then on, Li Moying had never once mentioned the matter of the two of them becoming sworn brothers, let alone calling him Big Brother.","Liu Buyan wasn’t bothered by this as after all, in Li Moying’s eyes, he wasn’t a brother anymore, but a love rival! This kind of petty man, being able to tolerate his love rival wandering around Huang Yueli’s side was already not bad, could he really treat him as a sworn brother?","However, at this moment today, Li Moying actually told Xuan Jiuling about the matter of becoming sworn brothers in order to save him!","Did the sun rise from the west?","Liu Buyan felt that he had most likely not woken up and was sleepwalking...","Huang Yueli had not expected that her husband would actually say this.","However, she was not surprised for too long. She immediately continued,” That’s right, Divine General Xuan. My senior brother’s talent in spirit medicine is the first I’ve seen in my life! My husband and I have been saved by him several times, so his matters are our matters. No matter what, we won’t let you take her away!”","This time, Xuan Jiuling was in a dilemma.","If Liu Buyan only had a friendship with Huang Yueli, he could still pull down his old face and discuss with Huang Yueli to see if he could make her give in a little on account of his seniority.","But now, Li Moying was also involved and they had such a life-and-death relationship, this matter...But it wasn’t that simple!","Even though he was a Six-star Divine General, he did not have the capital to negotiate with the two Divine level geniuses.","Xuan Jiuling thought about it and finally frowned.” I understand.” Since the two of you vouched for him, this old man will trust Young Master Liu this once. However, I still believe that my good friend would not do such a thing. If what Young Master Liu and Xuan Qingling said is true, there must be some misunderstanding or someone playing tricks...”","As he spoke, his gaze once again turned to the few Black Tortoise Race martial artists from earlier.","The captain’s legs went soft, and he almost knelt down again. He hurriedly shouted,” Lord Divine General, this subordinate is definitely not lying!”","Xuan Jiuling didn’t bother with him as he continued to speak to Huang Yueli: ” Since such a thing has happened, we have to investigate it thoroughly. I won’t restrict Young Master Liu’s personal freedom, but Young Master Liu is the party involved, so I need his cooperation during the investigation. Is that okay?”","Huang Yueli didn’t reply but looked at Liu Buyan beside her,” Senior Brother, what’s your plan?”","Hearing this, Xuan Jiuling choked again.","He subconsciously treated Liu Buyan as Huang Yueli’s subordinate and directly sought Huang Yueli’s opinion but who knew that Huang Yueli still prioritized Liu Buyan’s opinion!","It seemed that this Young Master Liu was really not simple...","Luckily Liu Buyan thought for a moment and agreed readily,” Cooperating with the investigation is no problem. It just so happens that I accompanied Miss Xuan to Xuehua City to seek medical treatment, and Divine Doctor Zhang is out traveling. We will stay here for a while and wait for Divine Doctor Zhang to return. During this period, if you have any questions, you can find me at this inn.”"]},{"number":4750,"title":"Chapter 4750: Worried","paragraphs":["Chapter 4750: Worried","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The moment Liu Buyan’s words came out, Xuan Jiuling didn’t have any reaction but Huang Yueli’s brows creased as she immediately spoke out: ” Senior Brother, you guys want to stay in Snowflake City?”","Liu Buyan nodded his head but after a while, he shook his head,” Uh, to be precise, I intend to stay in Snowflake City so I wonder what Young Miss Xuan plans to do?”","As he spoke, he turned to look at Xuan Qingling.","Xuan Qingling naturally understood that Liu Buyan was thinking for her.","To her, if she could stay by Xuan Jiuling’s side and let this Elder, who had always been known for his fairness and never participated in the family’s internal strife, investigate the truth behind the scenes, it would definitely be the most beneficial for her.","After all, for the sake of the family, Xuan Jiuling would ensure her safety no matter what. Even if she really eloped with someone, she would not be punished too severely.","But Liu Buyan was different. He was a human and he was carrying the crime of abducting a Black Tortoise Clan’s genius so staying under the surveillance of so many Black Tortoise Clan’s clansmen in Snowflake City wasn’t safe at all.","” I’ll stay in Snowflake City for medical treatment,” Xuan Qingling said.” However, Young Master Liu, you don’t have to stay here.” In the past, you had to stay and take care of me because you were worried that I would fall ill on the way, but now there’s no need. You can follow Sacred Phoenix... Young Miss Li and the others are going to train together, why waste time staying?”","“That’s right.” Huang Yueli immediately continued: ” Senior Brother, it’s better for you to come with us. My husband and I are planning to visit an old friend. He will be back in about ten days. He is also quite accomplished in medicine. Come with us.”","Liu Buyan was stunned,” But if I were to leave just like this, Lord Divine General’s side...”","“We can set a date to meet with Divine General Xuan. I believe that with my husband and I as your guarantee, would Divine General not be at ease?”","Huang Yueli said as she glanced at Xuan Jiuling.","She said that on purpose to test Xuan Jiuling’s attitude.","However, to her disappointment, Xuan Jiuling didn’t agree immediately. Instead, he looked troubled.” Young Miss Li, I know what you’re worried about, but the truth hasn’t been found out yet, and the two of you have already taken Young Master Liu away without even telling me where they’re going. This... I can’t explain this to the clan.”","Huang Yueli’s little face turned stiff and just as she was about to say something, Liu Buyan had already spoken first,” Junior Sister, alright, I appreciate your good intentions but I’d better stay. Since the Divine General Xuan has already promised not to harm me, he will definitely keep his promise. You don’t have to worry too much. My strength is weak. If I follow you to train, I’m afraid I’ll drag you down.”","When Huang Yueli heard this, her brows immediately knitted together.","But when she saw Liu Buyan’s gaze that was sent over to her, she was stunned for a moment as she suddenly understood.","It seemed that her Senior Brother was just an excuse. He was not afraid of implicating them, but... He was worried about Xuan Qingling!","Thinking of this point, Huang Yueli narrowed her eyes and changed the topic,” Since Senior Brother insists, then we can only respect your opinion. But I’m still worried...”","” How about this, Young Miss Li?” Xuan Jiuling hurriedly said.” I swear on my cultivation that no matter what the results of the investigation are, I will ensure Young Master Liu’s safety. Before you and Young Master Li return, I will not let anyone hurt even a single strand of hair on his head!”"]},{"number":4751,"title":"Chapter 4751: Rumors Run Amok!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4751: Rumors Run Amok!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“With your words, Lord Divine General, I can rest assured.” Huang Yueli smiled as she heaved a sigh of relief.","Xuan Jiuling was a trustworthy person and since he dared to say such words, he would definitely guarantee Liu Buyan’s safety. This way, there shouldn’t be any problem for her and Li Moying to leave for a few days.","If it wasn’t for the fact that the Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s side had dragged on for too long, Huang Yueli’s heart had a faint sense of unease. She still wasn’t at ease to leave at such a time, leaving Liu Buyan and the rest with the Black Tortoise Clan to stay in Snowflake City.","But now that Liu Buyan was so insistent, she couldn’t force him.","After the few of them had reached a consensus, Huang Yueli originally wanted to treat Xuan Jiuling to a meal but Xuan Jiuling was in a hurry to go back and investigate this matter so she couldn’t sit still and directly rejected it.","“This old man still has something urgent to do, so I have to go first. I appreciate Young Miss Li’s kindness, but I’ll treat you to a meal after you come back from visiting your friend.”","Huang Yueli nodded,” That’s good too.”","Xuan Jiuling cupped his hands towards her and Li Moying as he turned around and left in large strides.","Two hours ago, the Black Tortoise Clan’s warriors were still arrogant and arrogant, but now, they were like eggplants that had been hit by frost. Their faces were dark and pale, and they were weak. They lowered their heads and followed Xuan Jiuling away dejectedly.","Huang Yueli had no intention of staying here for long so when she saw Xuan Jiuling leave, she brought her husband and Senior Brother upstairs.","As soon as they left, the inn, which had been quiet for a long time, suddenly became lively.","“Oh my goodness, these big shots have finally left...When they were talking just now, I didn’t even dare to breathe loudly. It’s clearly none of my business, but I didn’t even dare to take my chopsticks. Now, the noodles I ordered in the morning are already soggy!”","“Who isn’t like that? Isn’t my porridge cold too? This is still my first time seeing a Dao Profound Realm powerhouse. Divine General Profound is really too powerful! No wonder he’s ranked at the top of the Heaven Rankings. He’s indeed worthy of his reputation!”","“Isn’t that young man and woman even more terrifying? I wonder what their background is that even the Divine General Xuan is so afraid of them...”","“They are either the top geniuses of the various Ancient God Clans or reclusive experts who have disguised their bone age...”","“If you ask me, it must be the latter. No matter which clan the genius was from, he was still considered a junior to the Divine General Xuan. With the Divine General Xuan’s qualifications and military merits, which junior would dare to speak to him in such a manner? Are you crazy?”","“Ha ha, that’s not right. Isn’t there a rumor that Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Young Lord eloped with that Sacred Phoenix Clan’s god grade genius? Perhaps, the young man and woman just now were them! It’s understandable that Divine General Xuan has such a restrained attitude.”","“You said it was a rumor! I don’t believe that a divine genius would elope. This kind of peerless genius can have a few dao companions. Why would he do such a thing? Besides, even if they wanted to elope, they wouldn’t come to a remote place like ours, right?”","“That’s true...”","The guests gossiped about Huang Yueli and the rest’s background but no matter how they guessed, they felt that it wasn’t reliable and in the end, they couldn’t come to a conclusion.","Upstairs, Huang Yueli walked to the door of the room and suddenly stopped Liu Buyan who was walking in front. She lowered her voice and said: ” Senior Brother, are you sure you want to stay here? Do you know...”","“I know.” Not waiting for Huang Yueli to finish speaking, Liu Buyan opened his mouth and interrupted her."]},{"number":4752,"title":"Chapter 4752: Revisiting Old Places","paragraphs":["Chapter 4752: Revisiting Old Places","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Liu Buyan was very clear what Huang Yueli wanted to say.","She just wanted to remind him that staying in Snowflake City was not good for him.","Even if he had helped Xuan Qingling, considered all aspects for her, and even risked staying in Snowflake City for her, it was impossible for her to break off the engagement and be with him.","After all, Xuan Qingling’s engagement was not only related to her, but also involved the interests of the two Ancient God Clans.","“Young Miss Xuan’s illness cannot be revealed to outsiders. Right now, only I know. I’m worried that something might happen to her once her illness acts up. With me around, at least there’s someone who can help her deal with it. Junior Sister, don’t worry, I’m just repaying Young Miss Xuan for saving me in the past. When I see Divine Doctor Zhang and cure Young Miss Xuan, I’ll leave on my own.”","Huang Yueli heard him say this and could only nod her head,” As long as you know what you are doing. Then my husband and I will leave tonight. We will come back as soon as possible.”","Liu Buyan was startled,” Leaving at night? Why are you in such a hurry?”","Huang Yueli acknowledged,” This matter is indeed rather urgent. Moreover, we don’t wish to be seen by others.”","Liu Buyan came to a sudden realization,” That’s true.”","Today, after the incident in the inn, Xuan Jiuling already knew Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s identities. Although he didn’t expose them on the spot, but how Xuan Jiuling treated the two of them, all the guests and those Black Tortoise Clan cultivators had seen it with their own eyes so it was hard to guarantee that there weren’t any astute people who had guessed their true identities.","If Huang Yueli and the rest were really just visiting a friend, then it would be fine but they had to go to Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s cave dwelling.","In the Twelve Continents of the God Realm, evil cultivators were not allowed to exist in the world. Once they were discovered, it would definitely cause a great uproar. Therefore, no matter how careful they were, it was not excessive.","Leaving overnight was the safest course of action.","After Huang Yueli and Li Moying bade farewell to Liu Buyan, that night, they took advantage of the darkness to leave Snowflake City.","During this period of time, because Huang Yueli had received King Xiang’s guidance in Devil Overlord Ruiying’s cave dwelling, her attainments in array techniques had increased by a huge margin and she took some time to draw a new concealment array pattern for Li Moying’s flying ship. Although it wasn’t able to make it completely invisible in broad daylight, but as long as she made use of the change in light, even Dao Profound Realm experts wouldn’t be able to discover the traces of the flying ship.","After two days and two nights of flight, the spaceship successfully landed in a mountain valley near Forest Shade Town without attracting anyone’s attention.","Huang Yueli kept the flying ship into the Sky Phoenix Ring’s space and followed her husband to Forest Shade Town to gather information.","This remote town was very quiet. There were not even many cultivators above the Dream Profound Realm. It was completely different from the last time they came.","When Huang Yueli saw this situation, she let out a long breath.","She was most worried that Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s cave abode would be discovered by others that belonged to the Ancient God Clan.","Looking at it now, even though the Evil Qi outside the cave dwelling had been mostly absorbed by her and Li Moying and many of the array formations in the periphery had lost their effectiveness, but the cave dwelling wasn’t discovered by anyone. On the contrary, because there wasn’t any strange phenomenon formed by the Evil Qi dispersing, even the cultivators who came here to explore and train had decreased.","The two of them had a meal and rested for a while before setting off for the cave abode at night.","However, as they got closer and closer to the cave dwelling, Huang Yueli’s expression turned more and more solemn."]},{"number":4753,"title":"Chapter 4753: Three Months","paragraphs":["Chapter 4753: Three Months","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying also felt that something wasn’t right as he frowned slightly.","“Li ‘er, isn’t this place a little too different from the last time we came here? Did you do something when you left the cave?”","Last time, they had come to train and didn’t know that the Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s cave abode was right in front of them.","Although there was a phenomenon caused by the condensation of a large amount of evil qi in the surroundings, and many trees and flowers were affected by the evil qi and looked a little strange, they were still full of vitality.","But now, the situation was completely opposite.","The closer he got to the cave abode, the sparser the surrounding vegetation became.","Now, they were less than five miles away from the cave abode. Everywhere they could see had become a land of death.","The soil under his feet was dark, and there was no sound when he stepped on it. Within a radius of several miles, he could not even find a single moss.","Huang Yueli pursed her lips and slowly shook her head,” What can I do? At that time, I only wanted to find you. After obtaining the approval of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow, I immediately left and couldn’t care about anything else. Besides, in my impression, when I left, this area was still very normal.”","Because a large amount of Evil Qi was absorbed by her and Li Moying, the forest was full of vitality and the number of human cultivators who came to train increased by a lot.","Who would have thought that in less than half a year, such a change would occur here?","“Is that so?” Li Moying’s eyes flashed as he seemed to be deep in thought,” You’ve mentioned before that Saint Iniquitous Shadow asked you to return here within three months. Do you think that he knew that such an unforeseen event would happen so he allowed you to promise three months?”","Huang Yueli’s face couldn’t help but reveal a bitter smile,” That’s my guess too. Now that we’re so late, it’s too late to make up for it. I’m really worried that something will happen to Saint Iniquitous Shadow.”","“No matter what, it’s better to be careful.”","Li Moying’s expression was solemn as he stretched out his hand to grab Huang Yueli’s wrist, pulling her towards his side to prevent her from acting rashly.","The two of them raised their guard and slowly approached the location in their memories.","Along the way, other than getting quieter and darker, nothing happened.","The teleportation array at the entrance of the cave abode was still the same as the last time. It stood quietly in place.","Li Moying squeezed Huang Yueli’s hand,” You stay here, I’ll go over and take a look first.”","Huang Yueli nodded her head.","Li Moying activated his body movement Profound Skill and silently dashed out, his body slightly floating in the air, almost not sticking to the ground.","He checked the side of the array and felt that there was nothing unusual. Finally, he carefully walked towards the centre of the teleportation array.","Li Moying’s movements were very light as he was floating in the air the entire time and didn’t touch the bottom of the teleportation array.","However, before he could clearly see the situation inside the array, he suddenly heard Huang Yueli’s cry of surprise from not far away.","“Moying, be careful! Don’t go over anymore, retreat, quickly retreat! Damn it!”","The instant Li Moying heard his wife’s voice, he suddenly leaped up, wanting to retreat.","However, it was already too late.","The bottom of the teleportation array suddenly cracked open, and a jet of black smoke burst out from the ground, soaring into the clouds.","Li Moying’s speed was extremely fast as he flew out.","However, at this moment, array patterns suddenly lit up one after another outside the teleportation array.","His body collided with the array pattern and was actually bounced back.","In the blink of an eye, his figure was engulfed by black smoke."]},{"number":4754,"title":"Chapter 4754: Profound Qi Sealed","paragraphs":["Chapter 4754: Profound Qi Sealed","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Seeing this scene, Huang Yueli’s expression changed as she immediately flew towards the teleportation array.","Fortunately, although she could not leave the teleportation array, it did not prevent her from entering.","Huang Yueli successfully rushed into the centre of the array and stretched out her arms, wanting to pull Li Moying out.","However, she grabbed nothing.","She had clearly seen Li Moying’s figure faintly discernible within the black smoke but when she stretched out her hand, she couldn’t grab anything, as though everything in front of her didn’t exist.","“How come...”","Huang Yueli’s heart suddenly tightened and before she could figure out what was going on, a second puff of black smoke spewed out from the bottom of her feet.","The moment she came into contact with the black smoke, her body felt as if it had been struck by lightning. Her entire body was numb and she could not move at all.","At the same time, his vision went black and his five senses disappeared.","Huang Yueli knew that things were going to be bad but at this moment, she had no way to put up any resistance. She could only be engulfed by the black smoke as her body kept falling downwards, falling downwards...","As her five senses were sealed, Huang Yueli didn’t know how long she had fallen for.","It might only be a few breaths, or it might be a few hours.","Finally, under a violent impact, she suddenly felt a sharp pain.","“Damn it! It hurts!” She did not know how many ribs she had broken...Fortunately, she didn’t fall face first!","Huang Yueli suddenly woke up and felt that her internal organs had shifted. If it wasn’t for the pure Ancient God Clan bloodline in her body and her physique comparable to the divine beast phoenix, she suspected that she would have fallen to her death.","She struggled to sit up from the ground and drew a circle in the air with her fingers, wanting to light a fireball.","However, the spell that could have been completed casually did not succeed at this moment.","Huang Yueli’s brows creased slightly as she stretched out her hand once again. This time, she used her full strength seriously but no matter how many times she tried, not even a single spark could be seen.","“What the hell is going on? Why isn’t there any elemental fluctuation here?”","Even Huang Yueli was feeling a little crazy.","With her innate talent in the fire attribute, as long as there was a little bit of fire attribute Profound Qi within a hundred miles, it would be attracted to her and used by her. And now, she could not even complete the most basic Profound Skill. It could only mean that this was a domain that was completely isolated from heaven and earth Profound Qi.","She had never encountered such a situation before.","Even in Ruiying’s cave, with the support of the Empyrean Devil Crystal, it was impossible for the Profound Qi in the cave to be completely expelled. She was still able to use the corresponding Profound Skills, but the power was reduced.","However, right now, she could not even sense a single Profound Qi fluctuation in this place.","What was going on?","Half a year ago, she had just come to this cave dwelling. At that time, this place definitely wasn’t as strange as it was now.","What had happened here during this period of time?","Huang Yueli was extremely vexed at this moment. If she had known earlier that she had not complied with the agreement and returned on time, which would lead to such a consequence, she would definitely be even more concerned.","But now, it was too late for regrets.","Huang Yueli could only bite the bullet as she inched forward bit by bit.","Although she really wanted to find Li Moying immediately, but now that the surroundings were completely silent and there was no Profound Qi, her spiritual awareness was equivalent to being sealed. She totally didn’t know what kind of danger existed in the surroundings so she didn’t dare to make a sound and could only carefully explore by herself."]},{"number":4755,"title":"Chapter 4755: Devil Creatures","paragraphs":["Chapter 4755: Devil Creatures","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli’s movements were extremely slow, moving slowly like a snail. At the same time, she pricked up her ears, trying her best to listen to the surrounding movements.","But even so, she still kicked something hard, and her toes hurt.","“Hiss...!”","Huang Yueli drew in a cold breath as her expression changed slightly.","In the darkness, she didn’t know what was around her. If she hit her leg now, wouldn’t her face be disfigured if she hit her head later?","However, she couldn’t think of any way to figure out her surroundings.","Just as she stopped to think, she suddenly felt a jolt in her heart. Her intuition told her that something was wrong.","There seemed to be a slight noise in the air behind her.","This movement was very light, but it still could not escape her sharp five senses. She instantly felt danger.","Huang Yueli’s expression suddenly changed as she realised that she must have kicked something which caused a commotion and thus exposed her position, allowing this thing hidden in the darkness to notice her.","Her reaction was extremely fast. Her body moved even faster than her brain. The moment she heard the sound, her right hand had already grabbed a dagger hidden in her boot and pulled it out.","The sharp blade suddenly slashed at a certain position behind her.","“Squeak...”","A sharp and terrifying shrill scream rang out.","A strong smell of blood gushed out and Huang Yueli’s hand was also stained with a moist touch.","At the same time, she clearly heard a series of rustling sounds in the darkness. Due to the excessive darkness interfering with her judgment, she could not even completely determine the direction of these sounds.","However, she knew very well that the thing hidden in the darkness must be very dangerous. She had to dodge it immediately!","Huang Yueli gritted her teeth and without the slightest hesitation, she suddenly kicked her legs and sprinted towards the direction where the sound was the lightest.","The sound of crashing from all directions immediately surged towards her.","Huang Yueli used all her strength as she ran while brandishing her dagger, chasing away those Devil Creatures that were closest to her.","The more she ran, the worse her mood became.","As she could not use Profound Qi in this unknown space, she could not even use her movement Profound Skills and could only rely on her own strength to run.","It was true that her physical fitness was not bad, but there was still a limit to her running speed. Moreover, without the endless supply of Profound Qi in the air, her physical strength was also consumed very quickly.","Although the dagger in her hand was a meticulously refined upper grade weapon, without the Profound Qi of Heaven and Earth, it was no different from the iron tools of the mortal world. Such a short dagger was not as useful as a kitchen knife in this situation.","Gradually, more and more monsters were chasing after her. The noise they made when they gathered was getting louder and louder. In this dark, cold, and quiet empty space, it was particularly terrifying.","Huang Yueli knew that running like this wasn’t a solution. When her stamina was exhausted, she would definitely be caught up by those Devil Creatures.","However, she couldn’t think of any other way for the time being, so she could only continue to run faster.","However, at this moment, she suddenly felt a grip on her wrist. She was grabbed by something. Then, a strong force came and she was dragged in another direction.","Huang Yueli’s expression changed as she tried hard to shake it off but she actually couldn’t get rid of it. She immediately used her other hand to pick up the dagger and stabbed towards the opposite side."]},{"number":4756,"title":"Chapter 4756: My wife is really impatient","paragraphs":["Chapter 4756: My wife is really impatient","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","However, the other party seemed to have expected her to do this and took a step back.","Huang Yueli’s dagger stabbed into thin air.","At the same time, he lost his balance and pounced in the direction of the other party’s strength, crashing into a warm and solid body.","The man’s deep and magnetic voice rang in her ear.” Little Fox, you’re too cruel. Do you want to murder your husband?”","Huang Yueli’s entire body shook as she turned her head in surprise,” Husband...”","“Shh...”","Li Moying gave a light snort, indicating for her to keep quiet,” Don’t speak, this place is extremely dangerous. Relax your body, don’t do anything, and don’t attack the demons behind you. Grab my hand and follow me.”","Huang Yueli frowned slightly.","There were so many Devil Beasts following behind her and she was about to be caught up to. It was too late for her to resist but Li Moying told her not to do anything...","If it wasn’t Li Moying in front of her, she would have suspected that he was her enemy and was thinking of ways to kill her.","But now, the person who said this was her husband...","Huang Yueli didn’t say anything as she nodded her head decisively as she clasped her hands with Li Moying’s.","This man was the person she trusted the most. No matter what, she would leave with him without hesitation.","Li Moying brought Huang Yueli through the darkness and made a few turns along the way.","Very soon, Huang Yueli realised that her husband was definitely not walking around randomly, but was moving forward with a purpose. At least the sound of the Devil Beasts flapping their wings which was very clear earlier were now slowly becoming muffled.","Huang Yueli’s head was spinning. Now that the surroundings were so dark and there wasn’t even a bit of Heaven and Earth Profound Qi, she couldn’t figure out how her husband was able to walk freely in the darkness.","After walking for less than fifteen minutes, the man in front of her suddenly stopped.","Huang Yueli was caught off guard and almost bumped into his back.","Luckily, Li Moying turned around in time and opened his arms, just in time to embrace her whole body into his embrace.","A familiar masculine scent surrounded her as Li Moying laughed softly,” My wife is really impatient. At this moment, she didn’t forget to throw herself into my arms...”","“You...! What nonsense are you talking about!”","Huang Yueli was still deep in thought about their current situation when she suddenly heard this teasing remark and her face instantly flushed red.","If it weren’t for the fact that they were still in danger, she would have kicked this man.","Listen, what kind of nonsense was this man still going on about at such an occasion?","“Why did you stop? Where are we now? Where did those Devil Beasts come from? The last time I left the cave, it wasn’t like this at all! Also, how did you get rid of those Devil Beasts? Even my divine sense has been sealed, isn’t yours as well?”","Huang Yueli didn’t have the mood to think about anything else as she dove straight to the main topic.","Li Moying gave a low laugh as he stretched out his hand to stroke her head.","” I have a rough idea. Actually, I have been to a similar place before. I was lucky to be able to escape.”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment before she frowned,” You’ve entered such a dangerous place before? When did this happen? Why didn’t I know?”","Li Moying replied,” That was before you ascended to the Divine Realm. There was once when I went out to train with the elders of the clan. However, we accidentally stepped into a Dark Realm without any Profound Qi and almost died there. The situation back then was very similar to today, but...”"]},{"number":4757,"title":"Chapter 4757: A pair of mandarin ducks sharing the same fate","paragraphs":["Chapter 4757: A pair of mandarin ducks sharing the same fate","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying paused for a moment as he furrowed his brows and his eyes revealed a trace of doubt.","Huang Yueli turned to look at him,” What’s wrong?”","Li Moying pondered for a moment before replying,” Back then, I had experienced countless dangers before I managed to escape successfully. The Elder who had entered the Devil Territory by mistake with me had even died inside. After I left, I read a lot of ancient books and found out the origin of this area. I found that this is actually the ruins of a battlefield where the Devil Clan and the Ancient God Clan fought tens of thousands of years ago.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli’s eyes widened in shock,” Battlefield ruins? However, we are now in Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s cave! This Cave Dwelling had existed for at least hundreds of thousands of years. It was unlikely to be a battlefield site. Besides, the Saint Iniquitous Shadow wouldn’t have built his cave on the battlefield ruins, right?”","A place where a fierce battle had taken place would have a very heavy Blood Qi. Even the Devil Clan would rarely live in such a place, let alone the Ancient God Clan.","Because although the Blood Qi was helpful to the Devil Clan’s cultivation, the risks were also obvious.","It was fine if they had enough strength, but if they were injured one day and their strength decreased, they would be invaded by the Blood Qi and go berserk. Generally speaking, except for a few extremely extreme Devils, most people were not willing to take such a meaningless risk.","Moreover, evil cultivators were different from the Devil Clan and the Saint Iniquitous Shadow wasn’t some crazy person. The last time she entered the cave dwelling, Huang Yueli didn’t feel any malevolent aura.","Li Moying nodded his head,” I also feel that this place doesn’t seem like a Land of Blood and it’s precisely because of this that I’m puzzled.”","Huang Yueli thought for a while and was totally clueless,” This is really strange. What could the Cave Dwelling of a heretic cultivator have in common with the battlefield ruins? Oh right, there’s another possibility!”","She suddenly thought of something.” Maybe there’s no connection between the two. Those similarities are just coincidences.”","Li Moying shook his head slightly,” The matter shouldn’t be so simple. At least I used the method to avoid the Devil Beasts that I had figured out in the battlefield ruins earlier and it was equally effective in this Devil Realm. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have been able to save you so smoothly.”","When she heard Li Moying mention the earlier incident, Huang Yueli’s curiosity rose immediately.","“Oh right, you reminded me, what did you do just now? Why didn’t those Devil Beasts chase after us?”","“It’s actually very simple. These Devils have long been accustomed to an environment without any aura fluctuations. Once you try to use the Profound Qi in your body, even if you can’t sense the Profound Qi of heaven and earth, it will form a certain fluctuation and the Devils will follow the fluctuation. Therefore, as long as you relax as much as possible and don’t try to mobilize the power in your body, you’ll be much safer.” Li Moying explained in a low voice.","Huang Yueli came to a sudden realization,” Indeed it’s like this. I had some guesses just now, but with so many Devil Beasts chasing after me, I couldn’t make up my mind to give up on resisting and stop all of a sudden...Fortunately, you arrived in time. Otherwise, I’m afraid I wouldn’t have been able to last until now.”","When Li Moying heard that, he suddenly laughed softly,” You believe whatever I say? I told you not to resist, and you really did not resist? What if my judgment is wrong?”","Huang Yueli giggled,” Then we can only be a pair of mandarin ducks sharing the same fate, dying for love here.”"]},{"number":4758,"title":"Chapter 4758: Defying Common Sense","paragraphs":["Chapter 4758: Defying Common Sense","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","She whispered into his ear cheekily in a seductive tone.","Li Moying’s breathing almost stopped and his heart skipped a beat as he subconsciously stretched out his hand to hold Huang Yueli’s waist, pulling her into his embrace.","Huang Yueli threw herself into his embrace but her reaction was swift as she raised her hand and coincidentally blocked Li Moying’s handsome face which was leaning closer.","“Husband, what kind of situation are we in now? We should quickly think of a way to leave this place.”","Huang Yueli’s voice carried a hint of laughter, like a kitten’s paw, tickling his heart.","However, the words that came out of her mouth was a direct rejection instead...","Even in such a pitch black environment, Li Moying could imagine that his little fox must have already revealed her sharp little canine teeth, smiling exceptionally slyly.","She was obviously the one who was deliberately provoking him, but she could still put on such an innocent posture.","And Li Moying fell for her trick.","His arm that was hooked around Huang Yueli’s waist tightened as he pinched her waist.","“Hmph, I’ll clean you up after we get out! Follow me!”","Li Moying let go of Huang Yueli’s waist and turned around to hold her hand. Following that, he held her hand and turned around to walk towards a certain direction.","Huang Yueli naturally wouldn’t doubt her husband’s judgement and immediately followed obediently.","But after quite a while, she realised that Li Moying had been walking forward without making a single sound, totally not making any other movements and the doubts in her heart rose once again.","“Husband, where are we going now? What exactly is your plan? Don’t tell me that if we keep walking like this, we can directly walk out?” Huang Yueli really couldn’t hold back as she tugged on Li Moying’s sleeve and pulled him towards her as she stood on her tiptoes and whispered into his ear.","It wasn’t that she didn’t trust Li Moying, but his current actions were really against common sense.","Usually, the abnormal surroundings were either affected by a formation or caused by some overly powerful treasure. For example, the Empyrean Devil Crystal they had found in Ruiying’s cave was like that.","However, no matter what the situation was, if he wanted to break out of this situation, he had to first figure out the reason for the phenomenon.","If there was a formation, he had to break it. If there was a treasure, he had to think of a way to take it away.","It was useless to just walk around. No matter how long they walked, they would only circle around in the same place.","Hearing that, Li Moying stopped in his tracks as he bent over slightly,” Li ‘er, do you feel that the environment here is a little different from before?”","“What’s the difference?”","Huang Yueli was slightly startled and immediately after, her eyes widened as a trace of astonishment appeared in her eyes.","Because she suddenly realized that she did not know when it started, but the surrounding air actually started to have a little bit of Heaven and Earth Profound Qi fluctuation!","Even though this fluctuation was very, very subtle, so subtle that she couldn’t even condense a spark, it was indeed real!","“There’s actually Heaven and Earth Profound Qi! This... What’s going on?” Huang Yueli’s spirit was roused as she hurriedly asked: ” You brought me in this direction because you knew that there would be Profound Qi here?”"]},{"number":4759,"title":"Chapter 4759: The Most Dangerous Place","paragraphs":["Chapter 4759: The Most Dangerous Place","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying nodded his head,” I’m just guessing but now it seems that my guess is correct.”","Huang Yueli’s head was still filled with confusion as she wanted to continue asking.","However, at this moment, the sound of wings flapping could be heard from behind them, exactly the same as the sound Huang Yueli heard when she was being chased by the Devil Beasts.","Huang Yueli’s entire body turned cold as she hurriedly shut her mouth and didn’t speak anymore.","They had almost forgotten that the Devil Territory they were trapped in did not have Profound Qi. Furthermore, there were a large number of strange devil beasts gathering there. They had no choice but to be careful.","Huang Yueli held Li Moying’s hand tightly and the two of them lightened their footsteps as they quietly walked through the darkness.","Along the way, Huang Yueli heard the sound of Devil Beasts patrolling around the vicinity several times.","But she kept Li Moying’s instructions in mind and no matter how close she felt the sound was or how dangerous it was, she didn’t mobilize a single bit of energy within her body. The entire process was just like an ordinary person from the Lower Realm, as she walked forward without looking sideways.","There was even one time when the Devil Beast directly bumped into her back, but she was still very calm and did not even turn her head.","The truth was just as Li Moying had speculated. As long as Huang Yueli didn’t take the initiative to attack these Devil Beasts, it would be as if they didn’t discover them and both parties would be at peace.","As she walked, Huang Yueli suddenly realised that the surrounding environment had started to change.","The concentration of Heaven and Earth Profound Qi had obviously increased, and it had already reached the level of the Lower Realm.","Furthermore, Huang Yueli could clearly feel a torrent of Profound Qi surging towards them from the front and then spreading towards the void behind them.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but take a deep breath.","She’s been to lots of cultivation places with rich Profound Qi, so she had long lost her sense for longing for Profound Qi.","This was the first time she felt that being able to sense the Profound Qi in the air was such a comfortable thing after arriving in the God Realm.","“This Profound Qi seems to be coming from that direction? Husband, your judgment is really accurate. Our direction is correct. It seems that the exit is right in front of us?” Huang Yueli said with a smile but not long after, her expression changed,” No! This is not the exit!”","Li Moying’s voice rang out at this moment,” Be careful! Ahead is the most dangerous place in the entire Devil Territory. If we’re not careful, we’ll die here today!”","Huang Yueli didn’t reply.","Because she had already noticed that something was wrong in front of her, she realized that it was too early for her to be happy.","What was surging in front of them was indeed a large amount of Heaven and Earth Profound Qi. However, this Profound Qi was completely different from what they usually came into contact with in the outside world.","It was too chaotic!","The breath that Huang Yueli had inhaled earlier, not only did it contain Profound Qi of various attributes, it was also mixed with a large amount of Devil Qi and there were even other undistinguishable energies.","The energy surged into her body and almost suffocated her.","Fortunately, the energy fluctuations here were not too strong. The energy she could absorb was limited. In addition, she was a cultivator of all attributes, not to mention, Evil Qi. Whether it was Profound Qi or Evil Qi, she could absorb them into her dantian. The remaining chaotic energy had a limited impact on her. She only needed to circulate her cultivation technique a little and it was all resolved.","However, even so, her expression still changed.","“What’s going on? Why is the energy fluctuation here so chaotic?”"]},{"number":4760,"title":"Chapter 4760: Can’t See Through","paragraphs":["Chapter 4760: Can’t See Through","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying’s reaction was extremely calm and didn’t seem surprised at all.","“It was the same when I accidentally entered the Devil Territory. My guess is that something in front of us is absorbing the energy in the surroundings. That’s why there’s no energy fluctuation in the surrounding area.”","When Huang Yueli heard that, she nodded her head,” That’s right, I think so too.”","On this point, Li Moying’s deduction was completely in line with hers.","Earlier on when they were walking over, Huang Yueli had already faintly felt a suction force in front of them.","Now that she was even closer, she could even feel that the Profound Qi in her body was also being pulled by that suction force. If it wasn’t for the fact that her cultivation base was stable and her Profound Qi was pure, she was afraid that the Profound Qi in her body would have already escaped uncontrollably.","“However...” Huang Yueli paused and frowned as she slowly said: “Why is the Qi so chaotic around here? Could it be that not only the Profound Qi of Heaven and Earth and the energy of various attributes are attracted here, but even Evil Qi and Devil Qi, as well as the other energy dissipating in the air, are also attracted?”","Li Moying nodded,” I’m afraid that’s the case.”","“Was it the same situation you encountered last time?” Huang Yueli turned her head and took a glance at her husband.","After Li Moying nodded his head once again, the doubt on her face deepened.","“What kind of treasure can attract both Profound Qi and Devil Qi? Why had he never heard of it before? Or had someone set up some powerful array? I’m afraid even if King Xiang reincarnated, he wouldn’t be able to do this, right?”","Huang Yueli thought about it and felt that it was impossible for such an array to exist.","Ever since she received the inheritance left behind by King Xiang in Devil Overlord Rui Si’s cave, her attainments in array techniques had advanced by leaps and bounds. She could see through ordinary array formations with a single glance.","Even if it was an array left behind by an ancient expert, it was not too difficult in her eyes.","However, her cultivation level was not high enough. Although she could find a way to break the formations of the ancient Profound Life Realm experts, she was not strong enough to do so.","Huang Yueli was very confident in her own judgment but the situation before her eyes, she really couldn’t see through it.","“Right!” Huang Yueli thought of something as she turned to look at the man beside her,” Since the last time you entered the Devil Territory was also like this, then how did you manage to escape? Don’t you know the reason for the formation of this Devil Territory?”","Li Moying’s expression suddenly turned pale as he pursed his lips and didn’t reply immediately. Instead, he frowned as though he was recalling something.","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes but didn’t urge him.","After a long while, Li Moying sighed,” Actually, I was able to escape from danger that time purely by luck. Also, Elder Wei, who was training with me that time, risked his life to protect me. Otherwise, you wouldn’t have been able to find me when you arrived at the God Realm. However, I do have some guesses about the Devil Territory.”","“What happened? You mean... That Elder Wei actually did it to save you...”","Li Moying nodded his head and paused for a moment before he slowly said,” I’ll start from the beginning. That day when we accidentally entered the Devil Territory, our initial reaction was the same as yours. After we were attacked by the Devil Beasts, we tried our best to escape but instead attracted the attention of even more Devil Beasts. We didn’t know how long we had been running for, but our stamina was completely exhausted. We fell to the ground and fainted. When I woke up...”"]},{"number":4761,"title":"Chapter 4761: Energy Void","paragraphs":["Chapter 4761: Energy Void","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","That day when Li Moying and Elder Wei were trapped in the Devil Territory, they were chased by a group of Devil Beasts and fainted due to exhaustion.","Initially, both of them thought that this was a disaster. However, after waking up, they realized that the situation was not so bad.","Because they had accidentally barged into the central area of the Devil Territory, there was actually a clear fluctuation of Heaven and Earth Profound Qi. Although other than Profound Qi, there were all kinds of miscellaneous auras shuttling back and forth, but their cultivation was quite good, and the slight fluctuations outside did not affect them much.","Moreover, they soon discovered that the Devils in the Infernal domain did not dare to approach the central area, as if they were very afraid of the chaotic energy in this area.","” At that time, we guessed that the only chance to leave this Devil Territory might be hidden in the center of the Devil Territory. Therefore, we decided to take the risk and enter the more chaotic area ahead.” Li Moying said slowly,” But not long after, we realised that we had underestimated the danger level of this area.”","With every step forward, the density of the surrounding Heaven and Earth Qi would increase by one level. Similarly, the fluctuation of Devil Qi, Evil Qi and other chaotic energies would also increase by one level.","These energies were already in conflict with each other, and now, they had condensed into an extremely dense concentration in a very small space. The energies collided with each other, and the sounds of explosions rose and fell.","When they advanced another two hundred meters, the surroundings were already gray. Because the concentration of various energies was too high, it had already formed a mist, making it impossible for people to see the situation in front of them clearly.","Under such circumstances, the mutual repulsion between the energies had reached its limit.","The two of them stood still and could feel the air around them as if it was filled with the sharpest knives, repeatedly scraping their bodies.","With the excellent bloodline of the direct descendants of the two Ancient God Clan, their physical strength was much stronger than ordinary martial artists. At this moment, they had already been cut until they were bleeding.","Huang Yueli was secretly speechless when she heard that but from Li Moying’s description, she understood something.","“From what you have said, it should not be a formation that is hiding in the center of the storm and continuously absorbing the surrounding energy. However, it does not seem like a natural treasure...Could it be a naturally formed Energy Void? If that was the case, as long as the Energy Void could be blocked, the Profound Qi of heaven and earth should be able to escape again, and the Devil Territory would return to its original state. How did you guys leave?”","Li Moying’s expression was cold as he remained silent for a moment before nodding his head lightly.","“Li ‘er, your guess is right. We had indeed blocked the Energy Void before we were able to escape but the process was not smooth. At that time, we tried our best to take out all the treasures we had to plug the gap. Elder Wei even took out a high-grade Spirit Armament that he had treasured for many years, but it could only slightly reduce the suction force of the hole. It was impossible to completely fill the Energy Void.”","When Huang Yueli heard that, her brows furrowed.","What Li Moying said, she had expected it.","After all, to be able to form such a huge Void in the?Devil Territory, the Energy Void must be very huge to be able to absorb so much Profound Qi. In front of this level of power, ordinary so-called treasures were not worth mentioning at all.","However, even a top-notch magic tool that could only be refined by a Profound Life Realm expert was unable to control the situation. This was rather shocking.","“Then how did you get away in the end?”","The moment Huang Yueli’s words left her mouth, she saw Li Moying’s expression sink slightly as she instantly understood."]},{"number":4762,"title":"Chapter 4762: Life-saving Grace","paragraphs":["Chapter 4762: Life-saving Grace","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Could it be...It’s Elder Wei...”","Huang Yueli suddenly recalled what Li Moying had said earlier that Elder Wei had died in the Devil Territory to protect him and instantly linked the two matters together.","Li Moying was silent for a moment as he nodded his head.","“At that time, in order to block the Energy Void, we took out all the treasures we had on us. Finally, the suction force of the hole was reduced to less than 10%. Although we can’t completely restore the Devil Territory to its original state, as long as there’s a little bit of Heaven and Earth Profound Qi, we can use our divine senses to investigate the surrounding situation and find a way to leave this area.”","“We seized this opportunity and immediately turned around to leave. We didn’t expect that halfway through, the treasures we filled in the Energy Void were completely devoured. The hole was once again broken through, and the huge suction force instantly formed a violent energy storm. Seeing that we were about to fail, Elder Wei suddenly turned around and pounced into the Energy Void...”","Li Moying stopped as he pursed his lips and didn’t continue.","But when he said that, Huang Yueli had already completely understood.","Dao Profound Realm martial artists themselves condensed a large amount of Profound Qi converted from heaven and earth profound qi, rivaling a top-notch natural treasure.","Elder Wei used his physical body to fill the last bit of the Energy Void, allowing the surrounding environment to stabilize, giving Li Moying the chance to leave.","“This... Elder Wei was really...This life-saving grace is difficult to repay...”","Li Moying nodded his head,” Elder Wei’s greatest regret when he was alive was that his favorite great-grandson’s innate talent was not enough, so he was afraid that his branch would decline in the future. Therefore, after I returned to Cloudy Qilin Continent, I recruited his great-grandson into my guards. You’ve also met him, Tian Er.”","“Ah, so it’s him...” Huang Yueli suddenly understood.","Thinking back, when Li Moying’s personal guards were indeed not that strong, she was still a little puzzled.","It seemed that Li Moying had intentionally guided him. After all, Li Moying would definitely become the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Patriarch in the future and as the Patriarch’s personal guard, his position in the clan in the future was self-evident.","Huang Yueli sighed for a while and quickly collected her thoughts.","At this moment of life and death, he couldn’t be bothered to think about miscellaneous things like repaying kindness.","“According to what you said, the best way to leave the Devil Territory should be to use treasures to fill the Energy Void? As long as we fill this hole, we can leave, right?” Huang Yueli stared at the misty energy center in front of her as she fell into deep thought.","Li Moying nodded but following that, he shook his head as his expression was a little conflicted.","Huang Yueli turned her head to look at him,” What’s wrong? Why did he shake his head? What’s wrong?”","Li Moying replied in a low voice,” What you said is roughly correct. But the Devil Territory that we entered today is slightly different from the one I entered previously.”","“What’s different?” Huang Yue said strangely.","Li Moying’s expression turned increasingly solemn,” This Devil Territory is several times bigger than the previous one and the intensity of the surrounding energy explosion has far exceeded what I had experienced previously. From this, it can be seen that the Energy Void ahead is definitely much bigger than the previous one. If I want to fill up this void, I’m afraid it will be even more difficult...”","When Huang Yueli heard this, she wasn’t as nervous as Li Moying had imagined but she even smiled.","“I was wondering what it was. Isn’t it just to fill the pit with more treasures? What we don’t lack the most is treasures!”"]},{"number":4763,"title":"Chapter 4763: I Call the shots in This Family!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4763: I Call the shots in This Family!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Huang Yueli said this, she was absolutely not being self-righteous.","In terms of the number of treasures they had on them and the quality of their treasures, other than those Profound Life Realm experts who had lived in seclusion for thousands of years, no one else could compare to them.","Ever since she had arrived in the God Realm, Huang Yueli had gained a lot from each of her experiential learning.","The last time she came to Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s Cave Dwelling, she had already swiped away all the treasures.","As a Profound Life Realm expert, Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s collection over the years was definitely an astounding figure. There were hundreds of high-grade artifacts and even several life-bound Spirit Armaments. They were probably left behind by the experts of the same generation who had been defeated by Saint Iniquitous Shadow.","Other than that, Huang Yueli and Li Moying had also obtained quite a number of collections from the Phoenix Clan in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge, as well as several Spirit Artifacts.","For these few Spirit Armaments, Wang Cai’s brother, Zhao Lin, had chased them away with a dark face.","Each and every Spirit Artifact had been refined by a Profound Life Realm expert using his own Profound Qi and blood essence to nourish it for many years. Most Profound Life Realm experts could only refine one in their entire lives. It could be said that even the lowest grade ritual implement contained half of the Profound Life Realm’s power, and the energy contained was extremely terrifying.","Huang Yueli didn’t believe that the ten Spirit Artifacts she had in her hands were still insufficient to fill this so-called Energy Void.","Of course, with her money-grubber character, to throw such a precious treasure here, her heart felt like it was dripping blood. But compared to her and Li Moying’s lives, these were after all just worldly possessions.","Huang Yueli was full of confidence but Li Moying wasn’t as optimistic as her.","He had already experienced the same situation once and knew better than his wife how dangerous the Energy Void in front of him was.","However, he didn’t refute Huang Yueli’s words. He only thought for a moment before he opened his mouth to say: ” Why don’t we try first before making a decision. The broken Soaring Light Sword I obtained in the treasure vault of the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge last time can be used as a test.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli immediately recalled that long sword. It was left behind by an expert from the Cloudy Qilin Clan from the ancient times. It was said that this expert was an invincible existence among Life Profound Stage practitioners so his life bound magical treasure was naturally famous for a time.","However, when this long sword had wandered into the hands of the Phoenix clan for many years, it had already broken into two halves from the middle, and its power was not as strong as before.","Even so, when Li Moying summoned out this long sword, Zhao Lin’s expression turned black on the spot, almost pouncing over to snatch it back.","Of course, this Soaring Light Sword in his hands only sounded grand but if he really wanted to unleash its original power, he would have to refine it again. Even Huang Yueli couldn’t see any hope of refining it again. Not only was the technique insufficient, the required materials were also hard to find.","Li Moying’s suggestion of using Soaring Light Sword to fill this pit was rather reasonable.","But Huang Yueli shook her head without hesitation.","“No, I’ve already said that after I’ve mastered my spirit weapon technique, I’ll definitely refine the Soaring Light Sword for you again. Are you saying this because you don’t believe that I can become the number one spirit weapon master in the God Realm?” Huang Yueli turned around and glared at him.","Li Moying naturally understood what she meant as he gave a slight sigh,” Li ‘er, that’s not what I meant. I don’t know how long it will take to repair the Soaring Light Sword and by then, you can refine better spirit weapons so I don’t need to...”","“No, I have the final say in this family!” Huang Yueli rejected immediately."]},{"number":4764,"title":"Chapter 4764: The Two Prodigals","paragraphs":["Chapter 4764: The Two Prodigals","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","As Huang Yueli said that, she turned her head and glared fiercely at the man beside her.","Li Moying originally wanted to say something but after hearing Huang Yueli’s ‘Domineering Head-of-the family’ tone, his eyes revealed a trace of a smile as he coughed lightly and shut his mouth.","He didn’t wish for Huang Yueli to waste the Spirit Armament that she wanted to use so he suggested to use his Soaring Light Sword to fill the hole first.","But the spirit weapons that the two of them temporarily couldn’t use, as well as the other crystal jade treasures, were all kept in this little money-grubber Huang Yueli’s Sky Phoenix Ring space. Without his little fox’s approval, what he said wouldn’t count.","Huang Yueli pondered for a moment and with a flick of her wrist, she took out a pair of wrist guards that were glowing with a faint golden light.","Her jade-like fingers gently pinched the edge of the wrist guard and slowly released the Profound Qi in her body. The refined and clear fire attribute energy wrapped the entire wrist guard in the middle and gently lifted it up.","“Go!” Huang Yueli chided softly.","The wrist guard streaked across the air like a ray of light, flying towards the center of the energy gap in front of him.","Li Moying saw it and didn’t say anything but he couldn’t help but raise his brows slightly.","He had some impression of this pair of wrist guards that Huang Yueli took out. This was also a life bound Spirit Armament left behind by a Life Profound Realm expert from the ancient times. But this expert was far from being as famous as the owner of the Soaring Light Sword and the quality of the Spirit Armament was two grades lower.","However, no matter what, this was all a rarely seen mystic artifact in the God Realm. Even peak Dao Profound Realm powerhouses would find it hard to possess, a treasure that could even risk their lives to fight for.","The wrist guard was engraved with complicated array patterns, which could significantly increase the speed and explosive power of the wearer. For martial artists who were good at speed, it was simply a divine weapon.","If he brought it to the auction house of the twelve continents of the God Realm, it would definitely cause all the major powers to fight for it.","However, such a priceless treasure had been thrown out by Huang Yueli without even blinking, filling up the Energy Void.","If the elders of the various Ancient God Clans saw this, they might be angered to death and scold the two of them for being prodigals.","In the surrounding air, all sorts of different types of energy were repelling and clashing against each other, constantly causing explosions and fluctuations. However, under Huang Yueli’s precise control, this pair of wrist guards flew steadily towards the Energy Void.","When it was less than 100 meters away from the center of the hole, it seemed to have encountered a huge resistance and slowed down.","The wrist guard vibrated a few times in the air before finally stopping on the spot.","Li Moying turned his head to look at Huang Yueli and saw her serious expression, the corners of her lips were slightly pursed up and there were a few drops of sweat on her forehead. He knew that she had already used all her strength to push in that pair of wrist guards but the resistance from the Void was too great, which caught her off guard.","Li Moying didn’t hesitate as he stepped behind her and stretched out his hand to press on her back.","A powerful and vigorous energy immediately surged into Huang Yueli’s meridians.","In the distance, the pair of wrist guards wrapped in red light also rushed forward.","After breaking through the last obstacle, the wrist guard suddenly turned into a golden light like a wild horse that had broken free. In an instant, it was sucked into the Energy Void.","“Alright, success...”","Before Huang Yueli could finish her words, Li Moying who was behind her grabbed her waist and pulled her behind him."]},{"number":4765,"title":"Chapter 4765: In Deep Trouble","paragraphs":["Chapter 4765: In Deep Trouble","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","At this critical moment, a golden light spewed out from the Energy Void.","The surrounding energy, which was already extremely mixed, was hit by the impact and instantly exploded, forming a huge impact.","Even a Dao Profound Realm practitioner like Li Moying couldn’t withstand this kind of pressure as he retreated continuously. Finally, he flipped over and fell onto the ground, protecting Huang Yueli under his body.","After a long while, the torrent of energy finally stopped.","Huang Yueli pushed Li Moying’s shoulders as she was slightly worried,” Husband, you...” Are you alright?”","Li Moying shook his head slightly,” I’m fine, I’m wearing a Spirit Artifact Armor.”","This little impact was not enough to break through his defense. At most, there were a few small wounds.","He had chosen to be in a completely defensive position only because he wanted to protect the girl in his arms as much as possible.","“However, you were too careless. You didn’t wait for me to finish and directly attacked.” Li Moying lowered his head to look at Huang Yueli as he frowned,” A treasure filling in the Energy Void would definitely cause a huge fluctuation so we should hide further away.”","Huang Yueli felt a little guilty,” Cough cough, Husband, I just...It was just a moment of carelessness. I knew it would cause a backlash, but I didn’t expect it to be so intense. Was it like this last time?”","Hearing this, Li Moying’s brows creased even tighter as he shook his head,” No, the energy backlash that we encountered previously was only ten percent of this time. Otherwise, I was only at the initial Heart Profound Realm cultivation at that time so I wouldn’t be able to withstand it.”","When Huang Yueli heard that, her expression turned solemn as she turned her head towards the direction of the Energy Void.","At this moment, the central area had returned to its original state. The golden light had disappeared and was once again enveloped in a gray fog. From time to time, sparks caused by explosions flashed through the fog.","“I think... Something’s wrong.” Huang Yueli was deep in thought.","Li Moying looked at her,” What did you discover?”","Huang Yueli didn’t reply immediately but crawled up from the ground and walked out from behind Li Moying, gradually approaching the central area.","Li Moying watched from the side for a while and seeing her walking further and further away subconsciously, he quickly went forward to pull her back,” Li ‘er, we can’t go any further, it’s too dangerous ahead.”","Huang Yueli didn’t refute as she stopped in her tracks.","” Husband, don’t you feel that it’s a little strange? I’ve already filled in the Spirit Armament just now. Logically speaking, if the energy gap is filled, the surrounding energy storm should have decreased accordingly. However, I can feel that the surrounding environment hasn’t changed much. It’s not much different from before...This...”","Hearing this, Li Moying went into a blank for a moment and immediately stopped in his tracks as he released his spiritual perception to sense the changes in the surrounding airflow.","However, after a few breaths, cold sweat broke out on his forehead.","“Damn it! Li ‘er, you’re right. Looks like we’re in deep trouble this time!”","The two of them looked at each other and saw the deep worry in each other’s eyes.","The Profound Qi of Heaven and Earth that gathered around the Energy Void did not change significantly. This only meant one thing, and that was the energy that they had put in to fill the hole was just a drop in the ocean!","Even such a rare and powerful Spirit Armament was unable to cause too much of an impact on this hole...","Then how were they going to get out today?"]},{"number":4766,"title":"Chapter 4766: Where’s Saint Iniquitous Shadow?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4766: Where’s Saint Iniquitous Shadow?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying’s brows furrowed deeply.","When he had fallen into the Devil Territory, he had been very calm because he had already experienced the same thing once.","This time, although the situation was slightly different, they were now stronger than before. It should not be difficult for them to leave.","However, he never expected that the Energy Void he encountered this time would be so big...","Now, after swallowing the pair of magical wristbands, the Energy Void had only shrunk by less than ten percent. A conservative estimate was that to fill this hole, they would need at least twenty Spirit Artifacts, which was already beyond the number of their collection.","Huang Yueli was also very clear about the seriousness of the matter. She stood at the same spot and pondered for a while before suddenly opening her mouth:” Husband, if we throw all our Spirit Artifacts into the hollow, we should be able to shrink the hollow by half. This way, wouldn’t it be able to shrink the boundary of the Devil Territory? How about we force our way out?”","When Li Moying heard that, he only shook his head,” No way, as long as the Energy Void exists, the boundary of the Devil Territory would be isolated from the outside world. No matter how we go, we would never be able to leave this region so as long as we can’t fill up the hole, then no matter how much we shrink, it would be meaningless. If not for that, Elder Wei would not have taken the risk to charge into the hole back then.”","Huang Yueli thought for a moment and it seemed to be the case as her mood instantly fell to rock bottom.","At this moment, she deeply regretted not listening to Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s advice and coming here after such a long delay.","Now that he thought about it, Saint Iniquitous Shadow must have known that something would happen here, which was why he had warned them.","She began to wonder how Saint Iniquitous Shadow was doing.","Although what she saw in the cave was probably just the remnant of Saint Iniquitous Shadow, the remnant was the consciousness that was retained by the remnant soul. As long as the remnant soul was not destroyed, it was not completely destroyed.","However, if the afterimage disappeared, it meant that this senior expert who had indirectly saved them several times had completely disappeared.","Li ‘er, what are you thinking about?”","The man’s deep voice rang out beside her ear, pulling Huang Yueli back from her chaotic thoughts.","Huang Yueli hurriedly shook her head,” I’m fine, it’s just...He thought of Saint Iniquitous Shadow. Half a year ago, this was still his Cave Dwelling. The mountains were clear and the water was clear, the energy was stable, and he had raised so many spirit beasts. Now, such a large Energy Void had formed... There must be something here that we didn’t expect...”","Something vaguely appeared in her mind, but when she wanted to grab these scattered spots of light, she grabbed nothing.","Although she knew that there must be a connection between these two matters, she could not find the most crucial point at the moment.","Moreover, the more anxious she was to figure it out, the more frustrated she became.","When Li Moying saw this, he walked over and pulled her into his embrace,” Alright, if you can’t think of it then don’t think about it for now. Anyway, we can’t rush it now so let’s find a relatively safe place to cultivate for a few days first.”","When Huang Yueli heard this, her eyes lit up,” Yes, you’re right. This place is the best place for cultivation.”","Near the center, both Profound Qi and Evil Qi were abundant. Although the purity of the energy was not high and there were various explosions from time to time, it was the best training for cultivators of their level.","Cultivating here, the speed of absorbing Heaven and Earth Profound Qi would be much slower, but the Profound Qi in the body would definitely be much purer."]},{"number":4767,"title":"Chapter 4767: Edge of Advancement","paragraphs":["Chapter 4767: Edge of Advancement","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Although she couldn’t think of a way to get out at the moment, but thinking of being able to cultivate here, Huang Yueli relaxed a lot and her mood wasn’t as urgent anymore.","The two of them quickly reached an agreement and decided to find a place to cultivate.","However, they did not retreat from the central area. Instead, they continued to advance more than a hundred meters in the direction of the Energy Void.","The closer he got to the center, the more intense the energy fluctuations were, and the more frequent the explosions caused by the energy of different attributes were. However, the greater the pressure around him, the greater the help he had for his cultivation.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s experience was very rich so they naturally understood this logic.","Other than the better cultivation effects, the central area was actually safer than the outer area.","At the very least, the Devil Beasts that were hidden in the void did not seem to dare to enter the area with energy fluctuations. Although they did not know how strong these Devil Beasts were, they knew nothing about these Devil Beasts. It was better to avoid them if possible.","After finding a good spot, the two of them did not waste any time and quickly began to cultivate.","When Huang Yueli was cultivating, she had always been very focused. Even though a few breaths ago she was still thinking about how to leave the Devil Territory, but after she started circulating her cultivation method, she quickly immersed herself in it, temporarily forgetting the troubles they were facing.","All of his attention was focused on the Profound Qi flowing in his meridians.","At this moment, they were less than three hundred meters away from the center of the Energy Void. The energy fluctuations were unusually intense.","Even if she did not deliberately absorb the Profound Qi of Heaven and Earth, the energy would still flow into her body.","Huang Yueli put in 120% of her focus as she carefully absorbed the Profound Qi and Evil Qi into her meridians, slowly guiding these energies to circulate continuously in her meridians. After a few small cycles, they were gradually absorbed into her dantian.","As for the Devil Qi and other unidentifiable energies, she did not dare to take the risk and blocked them all out of her meridians.","This was definitely not an easy thing to do. The two different energies, one inside and one outside, were still colliding non-stop.","Huang Yueli felt that her meridians were about to be torn apart by the two energies but she still relied on her strong willpower to grit her teeth and persevere.","Because she was multitasking, the pressure that Huang Yueli had to bear was huge. As time passed, the perspiration on her forehead started trickling down and her face gradually turned red.","Every time the Profound Qi in his meridians circulated for a large cycle, she would have to endure more than ten times the pressure.","Huang Yueli could clearly feel that with this repeated squeezing, the impurities in her Profound Qi were almost completely expelled and at the same time, it was rapidly condensing, becoming purer and purer...","The cultivation speed here was almost ten times faster than the outside world!","Realizing this point, Huang Yueli was wild with joy. The trace of uneasiness she had earlier had completely disappeared.","Who would want to leave this place as soon as possible if their cultivation speed could be increased by ten times?","Since her husband was accompanying her, she felt that she could cultivate here for several years!","Huang Yueli put down her last trace of worry and immersed herself in her cultivation as the speed of her Profound Qi condensing increased.","Not knowing how much time had passed, Huang Yueli once again felt that familiar impulse.","Countless condensed energy surged from every meridian of hers towards her Dantian like a tide.","She...She was once again standing on the edge of advancement!"]},{"number":4768,"title":"Chapter 4768: Second Chance","paragraphs":["Chapter 4768: Second Chance","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Sensing that she was about to advance again, Huang Yueli’s heart was filled with joy.","She had been stuck at the peak of the Heart Profound Realm for quite some time.","Even though she never slacked off on cultivation and the Profound Qi in her Dantian was long saturated to the point where it virtually overflowed, from Heart Profound Realm peak to Dao Profound Realm was a huge grade leap. It was not the same as the advancement in the past.","To the majority of peak Heart Profound Realm cultivators, this was a bottleneck that was hard to cross. The cultivators who were stuck here and unable to ascend to the height of Dao Profound Realm for their entire lives were uncountable. In the end, those who could successfully advance might not even come out one in ten.","Huang Yueli’s cultivation had always been smooth sailing but she had also encountered a little trouble here.","However, as a divine genius, she was not worried that she would stop here. However, the feeling of being stuck here was really unpleasant.","Especially some time ago when she and Li Moying had joined hands to kill Heavenly Devil Auspicious River who had almost reached the Devil Overlord Realm after going berserk. That near-death battle had stimulated the potential in their bodies.","Li Moying broke through to Dao Profound Realm on the spot.","At that time, Huang Yueli had also felt the impulse to advance but she didn’t know what the reason was but in the end, her advancement actually failed.","This made her a little anxious.","After all, they were currently alone out training and there would be many inconveniences if their abilities were too different so she didn’t want to become a stumbling block that would drag her husband down.","However, no matter how anxious she was about cultivation, it was useless. Other than diligence, it also depended on whether there was a chance.","This time, Huang Yueli once again felt the urge to advance and it was truly a pleasant surprise.","Although she was currently in this mysterious and unpredictable Devil Territory and advancing here was a little dangerous, but such a good opportunity could only be encountered by chance and coupled with Li Moying’s protection, Huang Yueli only hesitated for a few breaths before deciding to go all out and seize the opportunity to advance here.","After making up her mind, Huang Yueli quickly adjusted her condition and started circulating her cultivation method again, gathering all the Profound Qi in her body to attack her dantian.","Li Moying who was sitting beside her noticed the obvious change in the air and his slightly shut eyes suddenly opened as his eyes revealed a trace of joy.","Because Li ‘er had not advanced for a long time, she was feeling frustrated and as her husband, he was naturally aware of it.","Now that he saw that she had the chance to break through again, he immediately gave up on cultivating and changed his seat to sit behind Huang Yueli as he started to protect her.","At this moment, Huang Yueli didn’t notice the actions of the person beside her.","At this moment, she had no time to pay attention to anything else as all her attention was focused on the changes in her Profound Qi.","Under her powerful control, the Profound Qi in her body quickly gathered into her Dantian, forming waves that kept on breaking through the bottleneck.","This time, the Profound Qi in her body was even more abundant than the last time when she charged to Dao Profound Realm. Her attention was also more focused than the last time.","But Dao Profound Realm’s threshold wasn’t so easy to break through and after trying a few times without success, Huang Yueli knew that this path was impassable.","Therefore, she simply let go and began to absorb all the energy in the surrounding air.","Whether it was the Profound Qi of Heaven and Earth, the evil Qi, or even those unidentifiable energies, they were all absorbed into his body.","As she absorbed more and more energy, the surrounding energy also gathered in her direction at an astonishing speed. It even formed a grey energy vortex above her head."]},{"number":4769,"title":"Chapter 4769: Full of Doubts","paragraphs":["Chapter 4769: Full of Doubts","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli’s eyes were tightly shut as beads of sweat kept dripping down from her forehead.","With so much mixed energy being absorbed into her body at the same time, the explosion caused by the mutual rejection of these energies almost burst her meridians.","Huang Yueli used all her strength to barely maintain a trace of balance.","However, she knew very well that this dangerous balance could not be maintained for long. If it was delayed for too long, she would not be able to withstand the impact.","So Huang Yueli didn’t dare to be negligent. After gathering the energy, she immediately circulated her cultivation method and launched an attack towards her dantian.","The powerful energy surged towards her dantian like a flood.","Boom!","Huang Yueli’s entire body trembled and even her mind felt a little dizzy from such a huge impact.","This kind of impact had even surpassed the heavenly lightning that Li Moying had triggered from the sky when he advanced.","Huang Yueli initially thought that there would be no problem with her advancement but who knew that when she regained her senses and calmed down, she realised that... She was still stuck at the peak of the Heart Profound Realm!","She was stunned for a moment before she gritted her teeth. She could not be bothered to think about the reason for this accident. Instead, she gathered the energy in her meridians and tried to advance again!","“Boom! Boom! Boom!”","The impact came again and again, shaking continuously.","Huang Yueli’s ears buzzed as her dantian expanded, feeling so much pain that it felt like it was about to explode on the spot.","However, no matter how hard she tried, she was unable to break through.","Furthermore, every time after failing to charge at Dao Profound Realm, the Profound Qi that she condensed with great difficulty would retreat back into her meridians and scatter.","When she condensed it again, although it only took a few breaths, her Profound Qi had unknowingly decreased a little.","At the start, Huang Yueli didn’t notice such a situation but after experiencing tens of impacts, she suddenly realised that the energy that was used to impact her dantian was actually less than twenty percent of the initial amount.","This discovery surprised her greatly, but then she felt dejected.","When he was at the peak of his Profound Qi state, he was still unable to advance successfully. Now that the strength in his body had decreased so much, wanting to advance was simply an impossible task.","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli’s imposing manner suddenly relaxed as her body tilted and fell towards the side.","Luckily, Li Moying had been staring at her from the side and the moment she moved, Li Moying quickly stretched out his arm and caught her limp and weak body, pulling her into his embrace.","“Li ‘er, you... How did it go?”","Looking at Huang Yueli’s pale face and her painful look, Li Moying’s heart skipped a beat as he hurriedly stretched out his hand to feel her pulse.","Fortunately, Huang Yueli’s pulse was still normal but her meridians were filled with all sorts of mixed energies and she was unable to control them.","It was extremely dangerous for this energy to remain in her meridians.","Li Moying’s brows were tightly knitted as he sat behind Huang Yueli, pressing down on her back as he circulated a few large cycles of energy before she was able to absorb the energy.","Huang Yueli’s complexion had obviously improved a little but she still looked extremely weak as she leaned against Li Moying’s embrace, not even opening her eyes.","Li Moying knew in his heart that failing to advance was extremely exhausting for practitioners so what Huang Yueli needed the most now was to recuperate and rest.","So even though he had many doubts about Huang Yueli’s failure to advance, but he didn’t say it out loud and just gently changed his position so that Huang Yueli could sleep on his body for a while."]},{"number":4770,"title":"Chapter 4770: Not Comforting You","paragraphs":["Chapter 4770: Not Comforting You","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","However, Huang Yueli only rested for a short while before she opened her eyes again.","Even though she was still exhausted, she still managed to sit up with her amazing willpower.","Huang Yueli took out a jade bottle from the Sky Phoenix Ring’s space and pulled out the stopper as she poured out a large handful of pills. Raising her head, she stuffed them all into her mouth.","Then, she began to meditate and regulate her breathing. She circulated her cultivation technique to repair the meridians that were torn during the advancement process.","Originally, if she advanced successfully, under the scouring of heaven and earth Profound Qi, her body would also be brand-new along with the substantial increase in cultivation. This was also one of the reasons why she dared to take the risk to charge to Dao Profound Realm.","But now, her advancement had failed, so she could only slowly heal her internal injuries.","Li Moying narrowed his eyes as his line of sight swept across Huang Yueli’s fair and exquisite side profile, as he wanted to say something but hesitated.","Huang Yueli seemed to have sensed his gaze as she suddenly opened her eyes,” Husband, I’m fine. With you protecting me, I only suffered some internal injuries. You don’t have to worry too much.”","If she had advanced here alone, then when she was exhausted earlier, all sorts of energies were wreaking havoc in her meridians and it would definitely cause her to suffer a disastrous loss. But earlier Li Moying had helped her out in time and guided those energies out so there wouldn’t be too many problems following that.","Li Moying had already checked Huang Yueli’s condition earlier and knew that she wasn’t lying to him as he nodded his head slightly.","“I know, I just don’t understand. Just now... What was wrong? If I remember correctly, this should be the second time you failed to advance, right?”","To ordinary cultivators, advancing to Dao Profound Realm, even failing a hundred times was normal.","But to Huang Yueli, this was totally unexpected.","His Li ‘er’s innate talent was higher than his and he was able to advance smoothly so there was no reason for Huang Yueli to keep failing?","Moreover, Li Moying was observing from the side earlier and for a moment, he thought that Huang Yueli had successfully broken through but the result was like this...","Huang Yueli nodded her head as her face was filled with unconcealable doubt.","“That’s indeed the case. However, I don’t know what’s wrong either...Could it be that I’ve encountered a huge bottleneck? I didn’t expect that I encountered a bottleneck on the threshold of Dao Profound Realm. Could it be that there’s a problem with my cultivation method?”","Li Moying pondered for a moment and suddenly opened his mouth,” Li ‘er, I’m afraid this has nothing to do with your innate talent and cultivation, but...”","Before he could finish his words, Huang Yueli laughed and interrupted him,” It’s alright, Husband, you don’t have to comfort me. Even if I fail to advance, it’s not a big deal. I can’t stop because of this setback. Who hadn’t encountered a few bottlenecks before? There will be a way to do it after you go to various places to gain experience.”","Huang Yueli’s words weren’t to console herself. As a true peerless genius, she had absolute confidence in her own innate talent and knew that it was impossible for her to never be able to step into Dao Profound Realm.","Moreover, she knew very well that for a cultivator, what was more important than cultivation itself was the state of mind. A cultivator who was swayed by a small matter could not become a true expert no matter how talented he was. She would not make such a mistake.","However, when Li Moying heard her finish, he shook his head,” You’ve misunderstood, Li ‘er, I’m not consoling you, I’ve just... I’ve just thought of something.”"]},{"number":4771,"title":"Chapter 4771: Husband is deeply gratified","paragraphs":["Chapter 4771: Husband is deeply gratified","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli turned her head and asked curiously: ” What did you think of?”","Li Moying seemed hesitant and after a long while, he said,” The last time when your self-destruction failed, I had already guessed that you ate something wrong or there was a problem during your cultivation. It seems that every time you condense Profound Qi, you are unable to succeed. It’s like there’s something absorbing the energy in your body.”","Huang Yueli was stunned,” Absorb the energy in my body? How was this possible? No, wait a moment...”","She suddenly thought of something and a trace of astonishment appeared on her face.","Li Moying replied,” There are many reasons for the failure of advancement and we are unable to ascertain it now. But if your self-detonation fails, the biggest possibility is that the Profound Qi in your body will leak out and you are unable to reach the required state of abundance for self-detonation so you are unable to explode your dantian. You should feel this more than I do, right?”","Huang Yueli’s brows creased up and her expression turned even more solemn,” You’re right, I did have such a feeling back then...But how is that possible?”","She tilted her head and began to recall her experiences during this period of time. The more she thought about it, the more confused she felt.","“We ate almost every meal together. You also took the pills I took. Moreover, we were together when we cultivated, and... I’ve even dual cultivated many times. If there’s a problem with my diet and cultivation, then you... Why don’t you have any problems?”","When Li Moying advanced and broke through, it was exceptionally smooth and she didn’t even help much.","This question was also something that Li Moying couldn’t understand no matter how he thought about it.","He frowned and thought for a while, but still shook his head.” I’m not a doctor, so I can’t be sure what’s going on. I wanted you to see Divine Doctor Zhang first because I was worried that your cultivation would be affected.”","Initially, he thought that by coming to Forest Shade Town to meet Saint Iniquitous Shadow, he wouldn’t encounter too much trouble so Li Moying agreed to come to the cave dwelling first.","Who would have thought that with such an accident, Huang Yueli had encountered a second chance to advance and even failed again due to the problem in her meridians...","Thinking of this, Li Moying couldn’t help but feel a little vexed,” If I had known earlier, I wouldn’t have accompanied you here!”","Huang Yueli was initially a little worried but when she heard Li Moying’s tone, she heaved a sigh of relief and burst out laughing.","“Isn’t it just a failure to advance? It’s not a big deal. Do you have to be so exaggerated? Other than you, which cultivator hasn’t failed to advance? Alright, don’t worry. We’ll return to Snowflake City immediately after we leave. This time, I will listen to you and wait patiently for Divine Doctor Zhang to appear.”","Li Moying didn’t express his stance immediately but instead cast a questioning gaze towards Huang Yueli.","His own little fox knew that Huang Yueli’s character was lively and she disliked staying in one place the most. Other than armament refining and advancement, it was very difficult for her to stay in the same place for more than seven days.","Huang Yueli looked at his eyes and immediately understood. She couldn’t help but give a snort: ” What’s with that look? I mean what I say, alright? Recently, I saw a few new armament drawings in ancient books, and I was planning to find time to try refining them.”","Li Moying then smiled,” It’s rare for you to be so obedient, I’m deeply gratified.”","“Husband! What do you mean?” The little fox instantly exploded.” I’ve always been obedient and virtuous, alright?!”"]},{"number":4772,"title":"Chapter 4772: Look Over There","paragraphs":["Chapter 4772: Look Over There","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Realizing that he had said something wrong, Li Moying rubbed his nose as he was filled with a desire to live,” It’s my husband’s fault. Li ‘er is such a virtuous wife, it’s hard to find her even if you carry a lantern.”","Huang Yueli looked at him suspiciously,” Why do I feel that what you said isn’t the truth?”","“Truth, of course it’s the truth! More real than pearls!” Young Master Li, who was cold and ruthless in front of outsiders, wished he could turn into a little puppy and desperately express his loyalty.","Huang Yueli then gave a humph as she sat back down angrily,” Alright, I’m going to start cultivating to recover. You should also make good use of your time to cultivate and see if you can advance in rank here. Perhaps after our strength has increased, we might have a way to get out.”","But even though she said that, Huang Yueli didn’t hold much hope in her heart.","That Elder Wei whom Li Moying had mentioned earlier, to be able to be chosen by Cloudy Qilin Clan to be the god grade genius’ Young Lord’s Protector, he must at least be a Dao Profound Realm Middle Stage powerhouse so he didn’t seem to have any special ability to be able to rescue Li Moying and him safely.","In short, if he wanted to escape successfully, he would have to think of another way.","Huang Yueli could vaguely feel that the answer was right in front of her but it was like there was a layer of fog separating them and she couldn’t figure it out.","Helplessly, she could only give up for the time being and calm down to meditate and recover.","Earlier when she failed to advance, although under Li Moying’s protection, there wasn’t any danger, but the internal injuries that her meridians suffered were still rather serious.","Even if she could think of a way to leave the Devil Territory, she would probably have to take a huge risk. She was covered in internal injuries, and her strength was greatly reduced. At that time, things might go wrong because of this.","Therefore, the most important thing right now was to quickly recover his strength.","Li Moying nodded slightly and sat down opposite Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli closed her eyes and started to circulate the Nine Phoenix Transformations cultivation method again as she started to cultivate.","The medicinal pills that she had consumed earlier were all taken from the Sacred Phoenix Clan’s warehouse before they eloped. They were all top grade medicinal pills and the medicinal effects were extremely obvious. Not long after she had consumed them, she could feel a faint heat in her meridians and it was obvious that her Profound Qi had been replenished.","Now, with the help of the cultivation technique, the recovery speed was even faster.","After Huang Yueli entered her cultivation state, she was extremely focused and almost wouldn’t be disturbed by the outside world as she was completely immersed in cultivation.","Unknowingly, a few days and nights passed.","“Li ‘er, Li’ er! Wake up! Don’t cultivate for now!”","Suddenly, she felt her body being pushed by someone. A familiar voice rang in her ears, pulling her back to the real world.","Huang Yueli interrupted her cultivation and when she opened her eyes, she saw her husband’s handsome face.","However, the usually gentle and smiling face in front of her was now covered with a faint layer of dark clouds. His black eyebrows were slightly furrowed, and a fierce look flashed across his eyes.","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes as she was still a little confused,” Husband, what happened?”","Li Moying pointed to the right behind her as his voice was low and deep,” Look over there.”","Huang Yueli turned her head towards the central area and with a single glance, she held her breath.","The Energy Void that was previously shrouded in grey fog was now like a black volcanic crater. Thick and deep black gas was constantly ejected from the center of the hole, quickly fusing into the grey fog and spreading outwards."]},{"number":4773,"title":"Chapter 4773: Terrifying","paragraphs":["Chapter 4773: Terrifying","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The black gas shot out of the grey fog and quickly fused with the bottomless Devil Territory at the edge.","When Huang Yueli saw this, she couldn’t help but frown.","She did not know if it was her illusion, but she felt that as the black fog spread, the area of the grey fog shrank correspondingly, and the Devil Territory seemed to have become a little bigger than before.","Without waiting for her to raise any questions, Li Moying’s voice had already sounded out.","” Since two hours ago, the Energy Void has stopped absorbing the energy from the outside world. Instead, it began to spew out this black gas. Wherever the black gas touched, all the energy, whether it was Heaven and Earth Profound Qi or Devil Qi, would be fused together and turned into nothingness...The area of the forbidden zone without any energy has already expanded a lot compared to two hours ago.”","He originally didn’t want to wake Huang Yueli up and interrupt her cultivation but looking at the current trend, it wouldn’t be long before the energy forbidden zone would expand to where they were now.","If he continued to stay here, he would no longer be able to cultivate in peace. On the contrary, it would be somewhat dangerous.","Huang Yueli turned her head around and swept her gaze across the dark region as she became even more confused,” Looks like it’s not my misconception. The region covered by the grey fog has really become smaller...However, how could this be? Shouldn’t the Energy Void continue to absorb energy from the outside world?”","Li Moying’s face was filled with doubts,” This area is really too strange and everything that happened can’t be explained with common sense. We can only be careful.”","Even for Li Moying who was extremely confident in his own abilities, his eyes were filled with unease.","Everything that was happening around the Energy Void was beyond what he had experienced last time.","There were so many sudden changes, but they still hadn’t thought of any way to leave this place...","If he was the only one trapped here, it would be fine. In order to pursue the peak of cultivation, he would be prepared no matter the price.","But now Huang Yueli was also with him.","He had to protect Li ‘er well.","In her chaotic thoughts, a low exclamation suddenly sounded in her ear,” Husband, look over there. That’s...” What is that?”","Li Moying’s heart skipped a beat as he hurriedly raised his head and saw Huang Yueli’s stunned expression as she stretched out her hand and pointed towards the void in the darkness.","The void itself did not have any energy fluctuations. It was pure darkness without any light. They could not see what was inside.","However, since they were now in the center, the Profound Qi of Heaven and Earth that was leaking out from the Energy Void had merged with the void at the edge of the grey fog, allowing them to vaguely see the situation within a range of dozens of meters.","At this moment, a large number of Devil Beasts with huge black wings had suddenly appeared in this area.","These Devil Beasts were all very short, but they had very large heads that were out of proportion. Two blood-red eyes protruded forward, and their upper bodies appeared in the grey fog. Their lower bodies were hidden in absolute darkness, making them look particularly terrifying.","There were many of these Devil Beasts. They flapped their wings and were densely packed together. Just a glance was enough to suffocate people.","“Oh my gosh, so the Devil Beasts chasing us in the dark look like this!?”","Thinking back to when she was escaping earlier, she had been bumped into by these Devil Beasts and Huang Yueli suddenly felt a little nauseous."]},{"number":4774,"title":"Chapter 4774: Don’t touch them!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4774: Don’t touch them!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","However, there was no time to think about whether it was disgusting or not.","Huang Yueli quickly discovered another fatal problem.","As the black fog continued to emerge from the Energy Void, the area of the void gradually expanded, and these Devil Beasts also approached step by step, gathering in the direction of the center.","Huang Yueli saw this and suddenly had a flash of inspiration,” Could it be that these Devil Beasts want to get close to the Energy Void and absorb this black fog at a close distance?”","Li Moying nodded his head,” That’s most likely the case, we...be careful!”","Halfway through his words, his expression suddenly changed as he stretched out his hand to grab Huang Yueli’s waist and pulled her back forcefully.","At the same time when he attacked, Huang Yueli also felt a cold wind approaching from behind and following her husband’s action, she twisted her waist and dodged to the side.","She turned around and saw a ferocious Devil Beast rushing into the grey fog at some point in time, pouncing straight at where she was just now.","Li Moying’s brows creased slightly as he seemed hesitant.","Huang Yueli hurriedly grabbed his hand and shook her head at him,” Don’t touch them! Have you forgotten? These Devils can sense the changes in the surrounding energy. If we kill one, the remaining ones will definitely pounce on us. We’re in big trouble! It’s better to just dodge. Don’t attack unless it’s absolutely necessary.”","Li Moying nodded in agreement.","The two of them immediately turned around and walked another 20 to 30 meters in the direction of the Energy Void.","Fortunately, they were right.","These Devil Beasts could not adapt to the violent energy in the grey fog. Although a few of them risked their lives to rush in, before they could get close to the two of them, they suddenly raised their heads and wailed. It was as if their flesh and blood were instantly sucked dry, and they instantly withered.","In just a few breaths, it turned into a pile of black ashes. Under the impact of different energies, it quickly fused with the grey fog.","Huang Yueli looked on from the side and suddenly felt a little nauseous.","The reason why the energy storm in the center was grey was because it had fused with a large number of Devil Beast corpses, right?","Then the air they had inhaled during this period of time was...","Ugh... She couldn’t continue thinking about it.","Huang Yueli shook her head hard to get rid of the distracting thoughts as she continued to observe the surrounding situation.","After the black fog spewed out of the Energy Void a few times, it stopped. It did not absorb the energy from the periphery anymore, and the central area formed a temporary equilibrium.","The Devil Beasts would be instantly killed as soon as they entered the grey fog. Although they kept pouncing forward, they were unable to get any closer.","Huang Yueli watched for a while and after confirming that they were safe, she felt slightly relieved.","The two of them sat down again and found some food from the space to replenish their strength. Then, they meditated and adjusted their breathing while thinking about the next step of the plan.","The Sky Phoenix Ring had stored quite a lot of food and pills. If they were simply trapped in the Profound Realm, their lives would not be in danger no matter how long they stayed.","But Huang Yueli felt that things wouldn’t be so simple.","Her intuition told her that if she couldn’t think of a way to leave this place in a short period of time, she and Li Moying might really be in danger this time!","Her intuition was right.","The balance in the central area was maintained for a few days and nights. Suddenly, at an unexpected moment, the black fog in the Energy Void erupted again!"]},{"number":4775,"title":"Chapter 4775: Wave After Wave","paragraphs":["Chapter 4775: Wave After Wave","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The moment she felt the energy balance in the surroundings was broken, Huang Yueli’s first reaction was to jump up.","“Husband, the situation is not good. Let’s leave quickly!”","She grabbed Li Moying’s hand as she turned around and ran towards the direction of the Energy Void.","As expected, before she could take a few steps, the black fog had already spread out from the center, and the area covered by the grey fog shrank again!","The Devil Beasts on the periphery seized these few opportunities and rushed towards the grey fog as if they had been injected with chicken blood.","In the past few days and nights, the Devil Beasts surrounding the central area had never retreated.","Moreover, there were constantly Devil Beasts charging in fearlessly, but in the end, they were quickly turned to ashes because they could not adapt to the environment in the grey fog.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were able to stay inside unscathed.","But now, these Devi Beasts took advantage of the moment when the black fog and the grey fog fused to suddenly rush in the direction of the Energy Void.","Most of the Devil Beasts were sucked dry the moment they came into contact with the grey fog, but a small number of Devil Beasts successfully rushed into the center under the cover of the black fog.","Although Huang Yueli’s reaction was fast enough, pulling her husband along and running away at the first instance, but the closer they got to the Energy Void, the more intense the surrounding impact and explosions were so even she and Li Moying didn’t dare to recklessly venture deeper.","Therefore, while they were carefully maintaining their distance, a large number of Devil Beasts had already pounced on them from behind.","Huang Yueli’s expression changed,” Damn it! Have these Devil Beasts gone crazy? Why did they have to rush over and die? What is in this Energy Void that is worth it?”","However, it was too late to say anything now.","Li Moying’s brows creased slightly and without saying a word, he flipped his wrist and unsheathed his long sword.","He turned diagonally behind him, and as he did so, the gold-edged sleeves of his black robe swung outwards.","A silver light flashed under his sleeve.","Immediately after, a series of shrill screams suddenly sounded behind the two of them. At the same time, countless blood splattered from the Devil Beast’s body.","Huang Yueli subconsciously dodged backwards, not wanting to be stained with the blood of these Devil Beasts.","However, she soon realized that she was overthinking.","After the Devil Beast was sliced into two by Li Moying’s sword, it was quickly devoured by the grey fog. From its body to its blood, everything was evaporated in an instant, not leaving a single trace behind.","However, although Li Moying’s actions were decisive, it didn’t improve their situation.","If he was facing the army of humans or Devils, he would have scared most of the enemy soldiers by killing so many people in an instant.","However, those Devil Beasts were different. They seemed to have no consciousness and did not stop at all. They continued to charge forward recklessly.","Moreover, as the black fog continued to increase, more and more Devil Beasts could rush into the central area.","The long sword in Li Moying’s hand kept swinging out, its speed was so fast that it couldn’t be discerned by the naked eye. The cold light emitted by the sword aura connected together, like a silver barrier, fusing together with the fresh blood of the devil.","Unfortunately, the number of Devil Beasts seemed to be inexhaustible. No matter how many he killed, more would pounce on him.","Although Huang Yueli and Li Moying tried their best to resist, but they were still forced to retreat step by step by the Devil Beasts that kept surging up, getting closer and closer to the Energy Void.","“No, husband, if we continue to retreat, we will be sucked into the Energy Void!” Huang Yueli gritted her teeth."]},{"number":4776,"title":"Chapter 4776: Second Spirit Artifact","paragraphs":["Chapter 4776: Second Spirit Artifact","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying was naturally very clear of the seriousness of the matter as he swiftly brandished his sword a few times and the sword light skyrocketed. In between breaths, the large number of Devil Beasts behind him disappeared.","Only then did the two of them have a chance to catch their breath.","Li Moying said in a low voice,” We have to retreat now. There are too many Devil Beasts! If not for the existence of this grey fog, we wouldn’t have been able to hold on until now.”","Hearing the two words ‘grey fog’, Huang Yueli suddenly had a flash of inspiration as her eyes lit up.","“Husband, you’re right. Why are you so smart? Grey fog! Oh right, why didn’t I think of that just now! These Devil Beasts are most afraid of the grey fog!”","” Li ‘er?!” Li Moying couldn’t keep up with her train of thought as he turned around in astonishment.","But Huang Yueli had already leaped up and turned around, dashing towards the direction of the Energy Void.","Although it was said to be sprinting, but in fact, Huang Yueli’s current running speed wasn’t much faster than an ordinary person’s as the surrounding chaotic energy had created too much pressure.","Huang Yueli sprinted forward with all her might and when she was less than a hundred meters away from the Energy Void, her footsteps suddenly halted as her right wrist flipped gently.","In the next moment, a scimitar appeared in her hand.","The scimitar was shaped like a crescent moon, but its entire body was covered in a rich and gorgeous green colour. The position of the blade had not been sharpened, so it was still very blunt. However, the sharp killing intent emitted from the blade was clear and sharp, as if it had substance.","Huang Yueli held the curved blade in her hand and even in such a gloomy environment, the brilliant green light still penetrated through the grey fog, illuminating the surrounding area.","Li Moying’s pupils contracted as he instantly recognised that this was one of the ancient Spirit Artifacts that Huang Yueli had kept.","This Zephyr Jade Scimitar was of a higher quality than the wrist guard which she had thrown into the Energy Void previously. Even in Huang Yueli’s collection, it was already a rare top grade treasure.","Li Moying had already understood what Huang Yueli wanted to do and wanted to persuade her to reconsider.","However, Huang Yueli had already made up her mind and didn’t give him the chance to speak as she pushed her right hand forward forcefully...","Under the control of her pure Yin Energy, the Zephyr Jade Scimitar steadily flew forward, resisting the huge resistance of the energy storm and flying towards the Energy Void bit by bit.","Li Moying took a step forward but the Devil Beast behind him immediately took the opportunity to pounce over.","He could only stop and turn around to intercept them.","Just as his sword light flashed, the Zephyr Jade Scimitar had already fallen into the Energy Void. In an instant, it was swallowed by a black fog.","After a brief moment of silence, a loud explosion suddenly sounded, and a green mist suddenly spewed out from the Energy Void.","The momentum of the mist was very strong. It instantly passed through the grey fog and spread into the dark Devil Territory.","At the same time, waves after waves of shrill and sharp screams rang out from all directions, causing Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s eardrums to hurt.","All the Devil Beasts that were hit by the green mist turned into dried corpses in a very short time, and then quickly weathered into dust.","The eruption of energy lasted for a while before it finally stopped.","However, most of the surrounding Devil Beasts had been consumed in the process. Only a few scattered Devil Beasts were still unwilling to leave, roaring and surrounding the central area."]},{"number":4777,"title":"Chapter 4777: Disobedient Wife","paragraphs":["Chapter 4777: Disobedient Wife","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","After the green mist gradually dispersed, it gradually fused with the grey fog, leaving no traces behind.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying closed their eyes and retreated a few steps under the immense pressure from the energy spurts. When everything had regained its calm, they opened their eyes.","Seeing the Devils that had retreated outside the central area, the two of them heaved a sigh of relief at the same time.","He was finally safe.","However, the two of them were also very clear that this calm was only temporary.","Last time, they had already thrown a pair of magical weapon-level wrist guards into the Energy Void, but it only maintained a few days of peace. Although the Zephyr Jade Scimitar that they threw in this time was of a higher grade, it was impossible to suppress the explosion of the Energy Void indefinitely.","“This damn place is really too strange!” Huang Yueli raised her head and looked towards the center as her brows furrowed tightly,” It seems that without any external interference, this Energy Void would absorb all sorts of energy from the surroundings every once in a while, before spewing out black smoke. “At this rate, it won’t be long before the remaining energy is completely replaced by the black fog. Then, this entire area will become a land of nothingness.”","If it really came to this, the two of them would have no way of leaving.","Now, they could still rely on the Profound Qi in the grey fog to investigate the surrounding situation and fight with the occasional Devil Beast that rushed in. If even this Profound Qi disappeared, they would not even be able to use their Profound Skills and could only rely on their physical strength to fight.","Wouldn’t it be like two little chicks being thrown into a pack of wolves if they were surrounded by Devil Beasts?","Although they were still able to rely on the Spirit Artifacts accumulated in the space to deal with the eruption of the Energy Void, but the Spirit Artifacts in Huang Yueli’s hands were also very limited.","When she was in the Twelve Continents of the God Realm, she felt that with these Spirit Armaments in her hands, her wealth could rival that of a country. She felt great. However, after being trapped here, she really wanted to slap her smug self a few months ago to death.","Bah, wasn’t it just a dozen or so Spirit Armaments?","What was the use of having more Spirit Armaments than many Profound Life Realm experts? They wouldn’t even be able to last three months here!","If he had known earlier, he should have found some reason to stay in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge and not leave. He should have emptied the treasure vault of the Phoenix clan!","Unfortunately, it was too late to say anything now.","Huang Yueli suppressed the feeling of her heart dripping blood as she continued to ponder over the current situation,” I keep feeling that the key to leaving this place is definitely on this Energy Void. Why don’t we think of a way to get closer and take a look?”","Li Moying lowered his gaze and hesitated for a while before replying,” Sure. But you have to be careful and stand together with me. When I ask you to retreat, you are not allowed to refuse to leave. This Energy Void was very dangerous. If he got too close, his life would be in danger. Back then, Elder Wei...”","“Alright, alright, I got it! Husband, you used to be very cold. Why are you so long-winded now?!” Huang Yueli coughed twice and interrupted his words.","When Li Moying heard this, he couldn’t help but frown.","He was very familiar with his little fox’s tone. It was obvious that she did not want to listen to him, so she deliberately caused trouble.","He had the intention to continue educating his disobedient wife but the moment Huang Yueli finished speaking, she couldn’t wait to run towards the direction of the Energy Void.","Li Moying was worried that something would happen to her so he could only follow up quickly and grabbed Huang Yueli’s wrist from behind."]},{"number":4778,"title":"Chapter 4778: Instinctive Fear","paragraphs":["Chapter 4778: Instinctive Fear","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli didn’t stop but she also didn’t shake off Li Moying’s hand.","The two of them quickly moved forward, but when they were still fifty meters away from the Energy Void, their pace clearly slowed down.","At this moment, the energy concentration in the surroundings had already reached an appalling level.","Even if the two of them stood still and did not circulate any cultivation method, not even mobilizing the slightest bit of Profound Qi in their bodies, the surrounding energy was still crazily surging into their bodies. If they had not been using all their strength to control it, the surging energy would have instantly burst their meridians.","Li ‘er, come over a little and stand behind me.” Li Moying gritted his teeth as his figure flashed and stood in front of Huang Yueli.","With him leading the way in front, blocking most of the impact from the front, the pressure on Huang Yueli’s body instantly lessened by a lot.","Huang Yueli frowned slightly as she raised her head to look at Li Moying’s back view.","His tall figure was still as straight as an unsheathed sword, with an indomitable spirit. It was as if no matter how much pressure he encountered, he would not be destroyed and could shield her from any storm.","But Huang Yueli was very clear in her heart that Li Moying was actually forcing himself to withstand such a chaotic energy attack for her, but he just didn’t want her to see it.","Huang Yueli’s eyes flashed but she didn’t say anything as she followed closely behind Li Moying, hiding in the safe zone that he had specially created for her with his flesh and blood, not leaving a single step behind.","Her mind was extremely glad as she knew that her current mission was to quickly figure out the situation around the Energy Void so there was no meaning in forcefully sharing Li Moying’s burden.","She wanted Li Moying to be released from the huge pressure as soon as possible, so the first thing she had to do was to focus her energy and make full use of the time to complete the mission.","Huang Yueli grabbed Li Moying’s clothes tightly as she released her divine perception to investigate the surrounding situation.","Due to the high concentration of various energies around the Energy Void, not only did they block out almost everything in the grey fog, but even divine sense found it difficult to break through the barrier formed by the interaction of these energies and reach the target at the center.","Huang Yueli used up all her willpower to let her divine sense seep in through the crack bit by bit.","The scene she saw stunned her.","The inside of the Energy Void was not a spiral vortex like she had imagined. Instead, it was a huge sphere.","The exterior of the sphere was covered in all kinds of energy, and its colors kept changing. From time to time, it would emit sizzling explosions.","And in the gap between the energy flow, the situation inside the sphere was exposed to Huang Yueli.","Only then did Huang Yueli discover that this entire ball wasn’t an energy ball made up of all sorts of energy. On the contrary, those energies were merely wrapped around a very thin layer of skin. The interior of the ball was actually completely made up of a black substance, exactly the same as the black fog that had been spewed out from the previous two Energy Voids.","However, the black fog was a type of gas, and the black substance inside the sphere had already condensed into a solid.","The entire black sphere emitted a terrifying aura.","Huang Yueli tried to use her spiritual perception to get closer but before she could touch the ball, she already felt a bone-deep fear.","Logically speaking, with her experience and talent, she believed that nothing could really scare her.","However, this black sphere was different.","The moment his divine sense touched it, the fear that rose from the depths of his heart could not be controlled at all. It was as if it was an innate instinct."]},{"number":4779,"title":"Chapter 4779: Black Sphere","paragraphs":["Chapter 4779: Black Sphere","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli’s body trembled slightly as she relied on her strong willpower to control herself and didn’t retreat immediately.","She endured the immense pressure and continued to carefully observe the black sphere.","However, this sphere was like a solid black ice cube, stable and deep. She waited for a while, but there was no change.","Just as Huang Yueli was about to retract her spiritual awareness, suddenly, a golden light burst out from the surface of the sphere, attracting her attention.","This golden light was formed by the chaotic energy on the surface of the sphere colliding and exploding. It looked like the explosion in the grey fog.","But Huang Yueli’s keen senses detected a little unusual sign.","After the golden light from the explosion disappeared, the surrounding energy did not return to its original state like in the grey fog. Instead, it fused with each other and turned into a black crystal. It gradually fused with the black sphere in the center and became a part of the sphere.","The energy also disappeared.","“This is...”","Huang Yueli vaguely understood something as her heart suddenly jumped.","However, she still suppressed the shock in her heart and tried her best to remain calm. She continued to observe for a while.","As expected, the energy distribution on the surface of the sphere was denser, so the probability of an explosion was higher.","When some elemental energies collided, they would form black crystals after the explosion. At the same time, the energy that caused the collision would also disappear.","The disappearing energy formed an energy gap, and new energy would be replenished from the surrounding grey fog, forming an endless suction force.","It seemed that this was the reason why the energy in the Devil Territory was constantly being absorbed and gathered.","However, what exactly was this black sphere?","Why did the energy suddenly disappear after the collision and become a part of the sphere? Could it be...","Huang Yueli had some bold guesses in her heart but she felt that her imagination was a little too big. If her guesses were true, this...This had already exceeded the records of any ancient book...","In order to verify her thoughts, Huang Yueli suppressed her fear as she controlled her spiritual perception to probe towards the centre of the sphere once again.","The black spherical crystal was like the deepest pool of water. It was dark, cold, and empty, as if it was in the endless night...","Huang Yueli’s vision turned black and before she could react, she suddenly felt a tight grip on her wrist.","Li Moying’s anxious voice rang out beside her ear,” Li ‘er? Li ‘er? What’s wrong with you?”","Huang Yueli then regained her senses and realised that Li Moying had already turned around, his back facing the Energy Void as he protected her in his embrace.","And she was leaning on Li Moying’s shoulder, her head was dizzy and although she had opened her eyes, she still felt dazed.","“This... Husband, what happened to me?” Huang Yueli opened her mouth.","Li Moying frowned,” I should be the one asking you this right? You didn’t say anything just now and fainted all of a sudden. You almost scared me to death! What was going on? Was there something wrong with the Energy Void? What did you find?”","Huang Yueli was slightly startled as the memories from earlier surged into her mind once again.","She secretly shivered, calmed herself down, and quickly described the situation she had just detected with her divine sense.","The more Li Moying listened, the more he felt that something was amiss."]},{"number":4780,"title":"Chapter 4780: Ancient Records","paragraphs":["Chapter 4780: Ancient Records","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","” You’re saying that after the energies of different attributes fuse, they will turn into a black crystal?” Li Moying’s face sank as his mind kept spinning,” In that case, the black fog that was spewing out from the Energy Void earlier should be a part of the black sphere?”","Huang Yueli replied in a low voice,” I think so too.”","Li Moying’s expression turned even more solemn as his voice turned low,” Li ‘er, do you know what this means?”","Huang Yueli nodded lightly,” I already have a guess.”","She recalled the results of her spiritual awareness investigation and slowly connected the clues she had obtained.","“.. There were signs that the black sphere in the center of the Energy Void was actually the same thing as the black fog. The area covered by the black fog would become a void without any energy fluctuations. In this kind of nothingness, the most commonly seen Gods, Humans, and even Devils in the God Realm are almost unable to survive. However, they will give birth to the kind of Devil Beasts we saw earlier.”","“The most shocking thing is that this black sphere does not exist naturally in the world. Instead...”","When Huang Yueli reached this point, she suddenly stopped for a moment, as though she didn’t dare to believe the conclusion that she had deduced. After a while, she used an uncertain tone to say: ” But...” Different types of energy fused together to cancel each other out?”","Li Moying pursed his lips,” If the result of your investigation is not wrong, then...” This is indeed the only possible outcome.”","“But...” Huang Yueli frowned.","Although she had deduced the result herself, she still felt dizzy and her mind was filled with disbelief.","“However, whether it’s Heaven and Earth Profound Qi, Evil Qi, or Devil Qi, they’re all completely different energies. The Devil Clan, Ancient God Clan, and Evil Practitioners have completely different cultivation methods. Why are these energies that should be repelling each other able to fuse with each other? Even... In fact, after the fusion...They all disappeared? This was too illogical!","In the past, when we fought with the Devils, Profound Qi and Devil Qi intertwined with each other. There has never been a situation where life and life merged and offset each other?”","Li Moying didn’t reply immediately but hugged Huang Yueli as they walked towards the edge for a distance.","After leaving the core area closest to the Energy Void, the pressure they were under was much less.","Li Moying then sorted out his thoughts as he slowly said,” Hearing you mention this matter, I suddenly recalled an ancient book that I had read before.”","“Ancient records?” Huang Yueli was startled,” What ancient book? What did it say?”","Li Moying replied,” That’s a long story. Although it was called an ancient book, there were only a few pages. Whether it was the name or the author of the book, it was impossible to verify. These few remnant pages are kept in Cloudy Qilin Clan’s library and are one of the oldest collections. It’s said that they have at least a million years of history.”","“When I first arrived in the God Realm, I was extremely curious about all sorts of ancient records. Naturally, I wanted to study such an ancient remnant page. However, at that time, the Patriarch told me that these few pages were nonsense and not some cultivation secret manual. He told me not to care about them. Later on, I read the remnant page and realized that the patriarch was right. The content on it was without rhyme or reason and was not helpful for cultivation, so I put it aside.”"]},{"number":4781,"title":"Chapter 4781: Birth","paragraphs":["Chapter 4781: Birth","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“But now that I think about it...The things written on that page seem to be related to our current situation.” Li Moying was deep in thought.","The more Huang Yueli listened, the more anxious she became as she urged:” Aiya, what time is it already? Don’t say so much useless things! What exactly is written on the page?”","Li Moying was amused as he lowered his head and looked at the little fox’s flushed face as she shook her head slightly,” Why are you so anxious?”","Even though he said that, he still listened to Huang Yueli’s request and went straight to the point.","“Alright, there are only a few lines on that page, but it has nothing to do with cultivation. It feels like a poem from ancient times. Due to the age being too long ago, some of the words were indecipherable, so I could only roughly understand them. This poem roughly described the process of the formation of the God Realm and the 3,000 Lower Realms during the chaotic period of the universe. The entire poem is very erratic and difficult to understand.”","“The birth of the God Realm?” Huang Yueli lowered her eyes as she muttered to herself.","Li Moying nodded his head,” Mm, as far as I can understand, the gist of it is that this universe was originally a dark and silent void land. Other than the Devil Beasts wandering in the darkness, there are no other living beings that can exist. However, billions of years ago, there was a big explosion in the universe. Different energies were split from the void.”","” Among them, there’s the Profound Qi of Heaven and Earth that the Ancient God Clans use for cultivation, and the Devil Qi that the Devils need. Other than that, there are many other energies that we can’t distinguish and have never come into contact with.”","“And this explosion not only led to the birth of different energies, but also the various substances in the void collided and fused with each other, gradually forming the God Realm and the 3,000 Lower Realms that we are now in.”","“The reason why the God Realm became the God Realm and ruled the Lower Realm was because the location of the God Realm was originally the center of the universe during the Void Era. The explosion happened here. Therefore, the God Realm gathered the most various energies.”","” The effect of this energy has allowed all kinds of new races to be born and survive. The strongest ones among them are the God Clan and the Devil Clan.”","Huang Yueli was dumbstruck as her eyes widened,” There’s actually such a thing recorded in the ancient records! Who left this record? This is too... This is too unbelievable! However...”","She paused for a moment and recalled the black sphere she saw in the central area. The astonishment on her face gradually turned into a deep one.","“However, from the situation in this Devil Territory, this record might really make sense. If the God Realm was really born from nothingness, and the Profound Qi of Heaven and Earth was also separated from nothingness, then the Profound Qi of Heaven and Earth would fuse with other energies and disappear, recombining into the black fog of nothingness. This could also be explained.”","“As for our usual contact with the Devil Clan, we are unable to fuse with the other party’s Devil Qi. It should be because this energy needs to reach a certain ratio before it can be successfully fused...”","Other than Heaven and Earth Profound Qi and Devil Qi, there were actually a large number of other energies in the world. For example, the evil Qi that she and Li Moying had inherited from Saint Iniquitous Shadow was one of them.","The Ancient God Clan actually knew very little about these energies.","They would even turn evil cultivators, who were different from ordinary cultivators, into heretics and kill them all."]},{"number":4782,"title":"Chapter 4782: Returning to the Beginning","paragraphs":["Chapter 4782: Returning to the Beginning","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Because of this, the content recorded on these pages was completely nonsense to the cultivators of the God Clan. It was the imagination of the ignorant and incompetent people in the ancient times.","If it wasn’t for the fact that these remnant pages were really old and had great collection value, perhaps they would have long been torn apart and thrown away by Cloudy Qilin Clan’s cultivators.","Even Li Moying’s first reaction when he saw these records was that it was baffling.","But what Huang Yueli used her spiritual perception to probe earlier, proved that these records were very likely to be true!","Huang Yueli was still muttering to herself,” Now that I think about it, the Devil Qi and Profound Qi in our bodies can coexist and the Devil Qi and Devil Qi can transform into each other. This in itself shows that there is a connection between them. That’s right, the last time in Devil Overlord Ruiying’s cave dwelling, His Highness King Xiang taught me the basic array patterns. Wasn’t it possible to use both Profound Qi and Devil Qi to activate it? At first, I thought it was against common sense. Now that I think about it, if the two have a common source, then it makes sense.”","Li Moying nodded but the doubt in his expression didn’t lessen,”From the looks of it, I’m afraid that’s the case. However, other than us who have experienced all of this personally, no one else would believe such a thing. No, that’s not right. Even if they experienced it themselves, many people are unwilling to believe it.”","“Why?” Huang Yueli subconsciously asked.","But before Li Moying could reply, she reacted first.","“That’s true. The Shen clan had always regarded the Profound Qi of Heaven and Earth as the source of the energy of Heaven and Earth. They believed that they, who could use the Profound Qi of Heaven and Earth to cultivate, were the race that truly represented the Heavenly Dao. They were above the other races. If the facts proved that all energy was born from nothingness, and the Profound Qi of Heaven and Earth was not any different from the energy of Devil Qi and Evil Qi, then...Many people can’t accept it.”","Li Moying nodded his head,” That’s right. Therefore, if we can get out of here alive, we must keep our mouths shut and not casually reveal anything about this place. Otherwise, we’ll be in big trouble.”","In fact, Huang Yueli’s words were rather reserved.","If they knew the truth, many people would probably go crazy on the spot.","This was not a question of whether he could accept it.","Once such a truth was announced to the public, they would definitely be attacked by all the god clans. They would regard everything they said as heresy and even join forces to deal with them. They would kill them all to seal their mouths.","At this time, perhaps even the identity of a god grade genius was no longer useful.","In order to maintain the justice and rationality of their race’s rule over the God Realm, all the god clans would unite.","Even a peak Profound Life Realm expert would not be able to deal with them, let alone a Divine grade genius.","Huang Yueli was very clear about the seriousness of the matter as she nodded her head cautiously,” I understand, I naturally won’t tell anyone. However... Husband, aren’t you being too optimistic? If you want to consider such a problem, you should at least wait for us to leave this place first, right?”","From the looks of it, the most likely outcome was that they were trapped here or even swallowed by the void in the end.","If he really died here, there would be no need to keep it a secret.","When Li Moying heard this, his brows creased slightly as he fell silent.","This time, the problem was back to square one.","The birth of Profound Qi in Heaven and Earth, the formation of the God Realm, the ultimate secret of the universe, these shocking discoveries could not save them from the predicament they were in now."]},{"number":4783,"title":"Chapter 4783: Battle of Nine Suns Valley","paragraphs":["Chapter 4783: Battle of Nine Suns Valley","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The two of them sat down again and began to think about this extremely serious life proposition.","Huang Yueli’s brows creased slightly. As she pondered, she said:” Now we can at least guess what exactly happened in Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s cave dwelling.”","Li Moying raised his brows,” Why? What did you think of?”","Huang Yueli asked: ” I remember you said a few days ago that you and Elder Wei were trapped in a similar void land. That void land used to be the battlefield ruins of the battle between the Gods Race and the Devil Clan in ancient times?”","Li Moying nodded his head as he replied,” That’s right. That’s indeed a battlefield ruin. Furthermore, the battle that happened there was quite famous. Up till now, it’s recorded in many ancient books.”","“Oh? Is that so?” Huang Yueli’s eyes instantly lit up as she subconsciously stretched out her hand to pull Li Moying’s sleeve,” What kind of battle is it exactly, tell me in detail.”","The little fox took the initiative to stretch out her claws and Li Moying flipped his wrist and conveniently held her small hand in his palm, even using his index finger to scratch her soft palm.","However, Huang Yueli was not in the mood to care about this. She didn’t even notice her husband’s little actions. She just kept asking:” Hurry up and tell me!”","Li Moying smiled as he replied,” You should have heard of it before. It was the famous Nine Suns Valley battle four hundred thousand years ago. At that time, the Nine Suns Valley was still a part of the Heaven Fox Continent. It was a very important fortress of the God Clan. It also produced a kind of purple crystal Frost Sky Stone. I heard that it was an excellent medicinal material for refining pills.”","“Frost Heaven Stone...I seem to have heard Senior Brother mention it before.” Huang Yueli was deep in thought,","Li Moying continued,” The Frost Sky Stone was extremely popular in the God Realm back then and among the ancient pill recipes that have been passed down till now, there is still this ingredient. However, now that the Frost Heaven Stone mine has been completely destroyed, it is no longer possible to refine these pills.”","“And what caused all of this to happen was the battle at Nine Suns Valley. For some unknown reason, the Devil Clan had also developed an interest in the Frost Heaven Stone. Four hundred thousand years ago, they gathered several lords ‘subordinates to launch a sneak attack on the Nine Suns Valley. The battle was extremely tragic, and at least a dozen Profound Life Realm experts had fallen. In the end, neither the God Clan nor the Devil Clan could occupy the Frost Heaven Stone lode. The lode was completely destroyed by the aftermath of the battle between the peerless experts. Moreover, the entire Nine Suns Valley had become a land of death. No one who entered would be able to survive. As a last resort, the Empyrean Fox Clan gave up that piece of land and moved to a further place to live.”","When Huang Yueli heard this, she blinked her eyes and suddenly understood.","” The so-called Nine Suns Valley becoming a land of death is actually because during the Great Divine-Infernal War, under the impact of the various powerhouses ‘strength, certain conditions were met, causing the accumulated Heaven and Earth Profound Qi and Devil Qi energy to fuse together, forming an Energy Void, thus forming a land of nothingness.”","Li Moying nodded his head,” From the situation we have now, it should be pretty close. However, this probably had nothing to do with this Devil Territory. After all, when we came here a few months ago, this place was still Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s Cave Dwelling. During this period of time, there shouldn’t be a war between gods and devils on the scale of Nine Suns Valley.”","Huang Yueli pursed her lips as she continued to ponder,” The main point isn’t the great war between gods and devils, but...The formation of an Energy Void required a certain amount of stimulation! The Nine Suns Valley relies on the explosive power of a battle between a Profound Life Realm expert and a Devil Overlord. What about here?”"]},{"number":4784,"title":"Chapter 4784: The Secret of the Cave Abode","paragraphs":["Chapter 4784: The Secret of the Cave Abode","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","This question, Huang Yueli couldn’t answer so naturally Li Moying couldn’t either.","The two of them thought for a while, but they could only remain silent.","After a long while, Li Moying shook his head,” Forget it, such a question, with our current knowledge, I’m afraid it’s hard to answer.”","The scenes they saw in the Devil Territory were phenomena that no one in the entire God Realm had seen before. There was too little information and experience that they could refer to. It was very difficult to come to a conclusion just by imagining.","However, Huang Yueli didn’t give up just because of this. She stared at the direction of the Energy Void and was slightly lost in thought. After an hour, she suddenly stood up.","“Right, I thought of something!”","Li Moying’s gaze landed on her,” Li ‘er?”","Huang Yueli lifted her chin as her eyes flashed with excitement,” Husband, I’ve thought of it. Actually we should consider this problem from another angle.”","“What do you mean?” Li Moying was startled as he was slightly puzzled.","Huang Yueli stretched out her hand and pointed at the faintly discernible black ball hidden in the grey fog as she explained: ” Let’s put it this way. Before we came here, didn’t we go to Forest Shade Town and inquire about the situation in the dense forest from the local residents? At that time, everyone said that there had been no strange phenomenon in the forest recently, right?”","Li Moying nodded,” Not bad.”","Both of them were cultivators who often went through training and were very cautious in their actions.","This time, he missed the meeting time with Saint Iniquitous Shadow. He was worried that something unexpected would happen, so he specially asked around in town before setting off with a peace of mind.","He did not expect that even with such caution, an accident would still happen.","Huang Yueli said: ” We are now assuming that the conditions to form the Energy Void are very harsh. There must be a battle of the same level as the Nine Suns Valley Divine Devil War to create such an outcome. And now, there was no abnormal phenomenon near Forest Shade Town... In other words, this Devil Territory probably didn’t form after we left!”","Hearing this, Li Moying’s entire body trembled as his expression changed slightly as he raised his head to look at Huang Yueli,” Don’t tell me you mean...”","Huang Yueli nodded her head: ” I’m guessing that before Saint Iniquitous Shadow built the cave dwelling, there was already an Energy Void here. Moreover, Saint Iniquitous Shadow might have chosen to build his cave here because of the special environment here...”","Li Moying had already regained his senses and instantly became agitated as he sat up straight, saying,” In that case, it makes sense that Saint Iniquitous Shadow instructed you to reach this place within three months. It was likely that Saint Iniquitous Shadow had used a special technique to make use of the environment around the Energy Void to open up that Cave Dwelling. Now, the time limit is up. His arrangements back then could no longer suppress the Energy Void. He had a premonition, so he told you to come back as soon as possible.”","“I think so too!”","Huang Yueli nodded repeatedly.","After changing their train of thought, the two of them seemed to have opened up their conception and governor meridians. The layers of doubts that they felt could not be resolved earlier were now blown away in an instant.","The two of them quickly pieced together the cause and effect of the entire incident.","“No wonder Saint Iniquitous Shadow could gather so much Evil Qi in the cave. The concentration of Evil Qi in the world is very low, which is abnormal in itself. He must have used this Energy Void! However, I don’t know what method he used...”","“In my opinion, it’s most likely a mechanism technique. However, even the Devil Territory could be used...This is simply a miracle of the heavens and earth!”"]},{"number":4785,"title":"Chapter 4785: Don’t Move!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4785: Don’t Move!","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","” In that case, Saint Iniquitous Shadow is also a Spirit Armament Master?” Huang Yueli was deep in thought.","In the God Realm, there were many different branches of Spirit Armament Masters.","In essence, refining all kinds of armor and weapons and creating large-scale mechanisms were two completely different fields. Very few people could master them at the same time.","Huang Yueli was a rare anomaly.","From the books and spiritual weapons they had found in Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s Cave Dwelling, it seemed that Saint Iniquitous Shadow himself wasn’t proficient in forging weapons. He was probably specialized in mechanisms.","Li Moying muttered,” That might not be the case. The person who built this cave may not be Saint Iniquitous Shadow himself, but he must be an amazing trap master.”","Huang Yueli nodded her head and pondered for a moment before continuing:” So in this case, the cave dwelling itself has a mechanism to seal the Energy Void. But now that this mechanism is damaged, it resulted in the current situation? If we want to get out, we just have to fix the mechanism?”","When Li Moying heard that, he subconsciously nodded his head but very quickly, he shook his head.","Huang Yueli didn’t expect him to have such a reaction as she asked curiously:” Why? Do you think I’m wrong?”","Li Moying’s brows creased slightly as he looked towards the central area,” Actually, I feel that the mechanism is most likely not damaged and the reason for it to fail is most likely because its energy has been exhausted.”","“Energy exhausted?” Huang Yueli was startled.","Li Moying nodded his head,”Mn.” The failure of the mechanism should have happened in an instant. It was difficult to predict in advance. However, from Saint Iniquitous Shadow’s instructions for you to return within three months, he had already predicted the time when the mechanism would collapse. This must be because the energy is about to be exhausted, and as a spirit body that needs this energy to exist, he has already sensed it.”","Huang Yueli thought about it carefully and finally, she had to admit that her husband was right.","As a Spirit Armament Master, she knew better than anyone else that any mechanism needed a certain amount of energy source in order to operate continuously. There were no exceptions.","Although the mechanism in front of him could make use of the energy in the black sphere, in order to drive these black crystals to continuously separate into various types of energy, it would definitely require special materials as a guide.","Once these materials were used up, the mechanism would collapse.","Huang Yueli propped her chin up with both hands as she thought carefully,” So if we’re lucky, we don’t even need to repair the mechanism. We just need to provide sufficient driving materials for the mechanism and we will be able to restore this Devil Territory and leave this place...”","Li Moying agreed with this conclusion,” That’s right but we must first confirm this point.”","Huang Yueli immediately replied:” Then what are we waiting for? We have to hurry up and take action while there are fewer Devil Beasts around. Otherwise, we’ll be in big trouble when they start spewing black fog again.”","After some discussion, the two of them approached the Energy Void again according to the previous method.","This time around, because of his experience, Li Moying withstood an even stronger energy storm impact which allowed Huang Yueli to get closer to the Energy Void.","Huang Yueli grabbed onto Li Moying’s sleeves and with her eyes half closed, she released her spiritual perception to carefully sense the surrounding situation.","“Stop, don’t move here!”","She suddenly said as she opened her eyes."]},{"number":4786,"title":"Chapter 4786: Deal","paragraphs":["Chapter 4786: Deal","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying lowered his gaze and looked at her, not saying a word.","Huang Yueli paused for a moment before replying in a low voice:” Around that black sphere, there are indeed some crystal fragments. But the energy within these crystals have been completely absorbed. So the last time I came here, I didn’t notice it.”","“So...These crystals are used to provide energy for the surrounding mechanisms and suppress the Energy Void below?” Li Moying nodded his head as he pondered,” Then is this mechanism in perfect condition?”","“This...” Huang Yueli’s brows creased slightly as she appeared to be in a difficult position.","Li Moying asked,” Is it because the distance is too far to judge? Do you need to get closer?”","“No, there’s no need! That’s not the problem!” When Huang Yueli heard that, she hurriedly stretched out her hand to grab him, stopping Li Moying from continuing deeper.","Don’t think that she couldn’t tell that there were faint traces of blood on Li Moying’s clothes.","The violent fluctuations and explosions around the Energy Void had long caused serious damage to his body. However, this man was afraid that she would worry. When he encountered such things, he would never tell the truth. He would only force himself to meet her requirements. No matter how many times he said it, it was useless.","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli sighed helplessly.","Li Moying raised his brows,” Why are you sighing? Could it be that there’s trouble again?”","Huang Yueli glared at him,” What are you talking about? There’s no such thing! I have already roughly figured out the structure of this mechanism, but I still have to carefully check the integrity of the entire mechanism. “Therefore, we have to re-enter the Devil Territory and investigate where the edge of the Devil Territory is...In order to save time, we’ll split up. You go...”","“No, we can’t separate.”","Not waiting for her to finish her sentence, Li Moying’s brows furrowed as he immediately interrupted her.","“We can’t separate in this situation. If anything happens, we won’t be able to save each other in time. Moreover, no one knows what unknown secrets there are in the void. I definitely can’t let you go to the Devil Territory alone to investigate.”","“But...”","Huang Yueli really wanted to say that she already had a plan and there wouldn’t be any problems.","But when she met Li Moying’s deep black eyes, her heart trembled slightly as she swallowed back the words she wanted to say.","“Then...Alright, I’ll listen to you. Anyway, we still have a few Spirit Armaments. We don’t need this much time, just... Let’s go together.”","Li Moying then revealed a smile,” So obedient.”","Huang Yueli realised that even in this life and death situation, seeing the smile on this handsome face, her heart was still beating faster.","Wuuuu... Why is there such a good-looking man! She had such good taste!","Huang Yueli sighed inwardly as she shook her head vigorously to get rid of all distracting thoughts as she held Li Moying’s hand and slowly walked into the darkness.","As soon as they entered the void, the two of them subconsciously lightened their movements. Every step they took was extremely cautious and did not make a single sound.","As Huang Yueli had just thrown a Spirit Artifact into the Energy Void not too long ago, so the Devil Beasts in the periphery of the grey fog had basically been cleared clean.","The two of them were already experienced, so they walked carefully. They walked for more than a thousand meters without attracting the attention of any Devils.","However, not long after, Huang Yueli’s wrist tightened and she was suddenly pulled back by the man behind her."]},{"number":4787,"title":"Chapter 4787: Return","paragraphs":["Chapter 4787: Return","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli fell into a familiar embrace and was slightly startled:” Husband?”","Li Moying inched closer to her ear as he lowered his voice,” Li ‘er, have you realized.....” Is there something wrong?”","“Something is wrong?” Huang Yueli frowned.","Li Moying nodded his head,” We’ve walked for a long time but it doesn’t seem like we’ve walked too far away. Instead, it seems like we’ve been circling around the same area.”","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened in surprise,” How did you know that we were going in circles?”","In this void, they could not use their divine senses to investigate the situation from afar. They could only rely on the most basic five senses, just like ordinary people. Moreover, because the surroundings were too dark, even their vision was deprived.","Under such circumstances, the two of them could only slowly explore their way forward. It was difficult for them to determine their exact location.","Li Moying said softly,” Did you hear the sound coming from the right rear? There was a group of Devil Beasts gathering there. When I passed by here last time, I counted them. There were a total of twenty-seven of them, and two of them should be mutated Devil Beasts. Their strength was much higher than the others. Now, we’re back in the vicinity of these Devil Beasts.”","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment before she exclaimed:” Husband, you’re too amazing.”","Without relying on divine sense, he could clearly distinguish such a subtle flapping sound of wings just by relying on his own hearing.","“In that case, this Devil Territory should not be large. The reason why we are unable to leave should be because the entire void has formed a sealed loop...”","Huang Yueli pondered as she took a few steps forward. Suddenly, she stepped on something and a crisp cracking sound was heard.","In this Devil Territory that was shrouded in endless darkness and silence, this voice sounded especially clear.","Both of them were stunned.","Huang Yueli’s eyes suddenly lit up,” Found it!”","She bent down, her slender fingers groping the ground for a while before picking up a fragment.” This fragment should be...” Ah!”","Before she could finish her sentence, she felt a tight grip on her waist.","Li Moying grabbed her waist and dodged to the side.","Just as the two of them moved, a strong wind mixed with the thick smell of blood swept past where they were just now. Immediately after, there was a violent flapping of wings.","Huang Yueli suddenly came to a realization as she realised that the sound of stepping on the broken pieces had attracted the twenty over Devil Beasts nearby and she couldn’t help but exclaim in her heart that she was lucky.","Li Moying didn’t say anything as he pulled Huang Yueli’s hand and ran.","Huang Yueli realised that something was amiss and hurriedly tugged at his sleeves as she called out softly:” Husband, don’t run towards the centre. We won’t go back first. Let’s continue walking towards the outside!”","When Li Moying heard this, he frowned slightly,” Are you sure? We’ve already lured the Devil Beasts. If we don’t go back, more and more Devil Beasts will gather.”","Huang Yueli said: ” Then let’s speed up. I think I already know how to get out, but I have to confirm it again.”","Li Moying raised his brows but didn’t ask any unnecessary questions.","Since his Li ‘er had already said so, she definitely had a well-thought-out plan.","The two of them immediately turned around and returned to the direction they were heading in.","Because the entire Devil Territory was a closed loop, no matter how far one went, they could not leave. They could only circle around the outer edge of the loop.","However, Huang Yueli didn’t mind.","She brought Li Moying along as she sprinted, and every once in a while, she would stop for a moment and bend down to pick up a piece of debris from the ground."]},{"number":4788,"title":"Chapter 4788: Seeing Blood","paragraphs":["Chapter 4788: Seeing Blood","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Although the two of them were very fast, in the void, the Devil Beasts moved faster than them.","Furthermore, Huang Yueli had to stop to pick up the fragments from time to time, which further slowed down the progress.","After an hour, not only did the two of them fail to shake off the Devil Beasts chasing them, but they also attracted more Devil Beasts.","A large group of Devil Beasts was chasing after them. The sound of their wings flapping was shocking, and there was a faint smell of blood in the air.","“Li ‘er, let’s leave quickly! The Devil Beasts are catching up.” Li Moying bent down to support the young lady who was half squatting on the ground.","Huang Yueli’s tone was hurried as she said,” Wait a little longer, immediately...” It’ll be done soon. This is already the last mechanism. If my calculations are correct, it should be...”","She pinched her fingers and calculated quickly.","Li Moying’s brows creased slightly as his hand gripped tightly onto the sword hilt which was still in its scabbard as he swung it outwards.","“Squeak! Squeak...”","A sharp cry rang out.","Even though he was just relying on his body’s brute force, Li Moying’s attack still managed to smash the circle of Devil Beasts which were almost stuck onto their bodies down from mid-air.","However, this could only temporarily knock out the Devil Beasts, not kill them.","After the Devil Beasts woke up, they would soon pounce on them again. In addition, the Devil Beasts that were constantly alarmed by the noise gathered around them. It did not take long for the number of Devil Beasts surrounding them to soar again.","Just as Li Moying was hesitating if he should forcefully drag his little fox away, a surprised voice suddenly rang out from beside him,” I understand! My guess was right. We...We can get out!”","When Li Moying heard that, his heart was filled with joy.","However, before he could say anything, he felt a strong gust of wind from his right back, pouncing towards Huang Yueli.","All of this happened too suddenly and too close. Li Moying was unable to mobilize the Profound Qi in his body and his speed was much slower than usual. Seeing that he couldn’t save her in time, he didn’t hesitate and immediately pounced onto Huang Yueli, hugging her tightly in his embrace.","With a muffled sound, a thick blood aura instantly spread out.","The man behind her suddenly sank down and placed most of his weight on her back.","Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment before she realised what had happened and her expression instantly changed.","“Husband, you...How did you...”","Li Moying shook his head and before he could say anything, the Devil Beast pounced towards them once again.","Huang Yueli gritted her teeth and with a flip of her right hand, a magical weapon level long sword appeared in her palm.","Earlier Li Moying was worried that the bloody smell would attract more Devil Beasts so he had been avoiding drawing his sword and seeing blood but now that Li Moying was injured, Huang Yueli no longer had any scruples as she unhesitatingly shook off the scabbard.","The sword light flashed and a row of Devil Beasts fell to the ground.","Huang Yueli used all her strength to support Li Moying who was leaning against her back as she gritted her teeth,” Husband, you...” How are you? What was going on? Where are you hurt?”","Li Moying shook his head slightly,” Cough cough, let’s not talk about this first, quickly...Let’s go! Go back to the center!”","Even without him saying anything, Huang Yueli didn’t dare to continue staying here.","Just as the two of them were conversing, Huang Yueli had already dragged him along as they sprinted forward.","Li Moying’s level of practitioner, under the attack of a mere Devil Beast, he was actually seriously injured in an instant. This was absolutely something that the two of them had not expected."]},{"number":4789,"title":"Chapter 4789: Too Brave","paragraphs":["Chapter 4789: Too Brave","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli knew that there was definitely something strange about these Devil Beasts but she didn’t have the time to think about it as she could only carry Li Moying on her back and sprinted all the way back to the grey fog.","However, it was not easy to get rid of these Devil Beasts.","Previously when Li Moying was fighting with the Devil Beasts, he had already caused a large number of casualties and the smell of the Devil Beasts ‘blood had attracted the surrounding Devil Beasts to gather.","And now, Li Moying himself was seriously injured.","Even though the scene was too dark and his wounds couldn’t be seen, but just from the wet touch on Huang Yueli’s hand when she carried him on her back, it already showed how serious his injuries were.","The blood of a god was obviously more attractive to Devil Beasts than the blood of their own kind.","The Devil Beasts that were originally surrounding and gnawing on their own kind all changed their targets at the first moment and surged towards the two of them.","Huang Yueli’s expression was cold as her heart was anxious.","If it was outside the Devil Territory, she could still fight with her own strength, but now... Not only was she an ordinary person, but she also had to take care of her husband’s safety...","At the same time, she had to ensure that she was not injured.","From Li Moying’s current situation, these Devil Beasts ‘lethality was too great. Perhaps a small wound would be fatal to the Gods Race.","If she was injured and fell here, the two of them would really be finished.","But even though the situation was so difficult, Huang Yueli didn’t have any thoughts of giving up.","Her mind raced, but her hands did not stop moving.","Her slender and fair fingers gripped the hilt of her sword tightly, and she swung her sword again and again.","The Devil’s mournful and sharp cry before it died echoed in the vast void.","The sound was like countless files rubbing against a rough wall. It was strange and terrifying, enough to arouse the negative emotions in everyone’s heart.","Huang Yueli frowned.","Her spiritual sense was powerful, so she wasn’t affected too much. However, a bigger problem was still to come.","Although the sword in her hand was a genuine divine weapon, it was still too heavy for an ordinary person without Profound Qi. Not long after, she felt her arm getting more and more sore and even started to tremble slightly as if she was poisoned.","His fingers went limp, and the sword almost fell to the ground.","However, Huang Yueli still reacted in time as she held onto the sword hilt once again.","“Damn it! These Devil Beasts...Could it be that these Devil Beasts could not be killed? What the hell was this place? These peerless experts from ancient times were too bold. They insisted on building their Cave Dwelling in such a place. This was...","Aren’t you afraid of the backlash?”","Huang Yueli silently cursed in her heart but she knew that complaining was useless so she could only grit her teeth as she used all her strength to hold onto the long sword in her hand tightly. Surrounded by the crazed Devil Beasts, she did her best to carve out a path of blood.","Li Moying initially still had some strength and he even stretched out his hand from time to time to clean up a few Devil Beasts that sneaked up on him from behind.","However, as time passed, his body became stiffer and stiffer, and he could barely move.","Huang Yueli felt the weight on her back becoming heavier bit by bit as her heart was burning with anxiety,” Moying, Moying! You... How are you? Are you alright? Don’t scare...don’t scare me...”","“I... I’m fine, it’s just... He just couldn’t move. Don’t distract yourself from locking me up, focus on fighting the enemy! We can only rely on you now.”","Although Li Moying’s voice was obviously very weak, it sounded extremely calm."]},{"number":4790,"title":"Chapter 4790: Li ‘er, you are.....","paragraphs":["Chapter 4790: Li ‘er, you are.....","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","This voice made Huang Yueli’s anxious and uneasy mood become calmer.","His consciousness was still so clear. At least, he could still hold on for the time being.","Huang Yueli hurriedly threw away that pessimistic distracting thought as she roused her spirits and threw herself into the battle.","More and more Devil Beasts surrounded her. Every time she swung her sword, more and more energy was consumed. Her arms became extremely heavy, and sweat kept falling from her forehead.","However, she did not slow down. Instead, she gritted her teeth and continued to move forward step by step under the huge pressure.","As time passed, she did not know when it started, but she suddenly felt her movements become lighter.","It was as if he had broken through some shackles after he was exhausted to the limit.","The soreness in his arm suddenly disappeared, and the speed at which he attacked increased greatly, even faster and faster.","The sword streaked across the air and even began to emit a clear sound of breaking through the air. Due to its speed, sparks appeared in the darkness.","” Li ‘er, you are...”","Li Moying was the first to sense that something was wrong as he frowned.","“Could it be that you secretly ate some medicinal pill that stimulated your potential?”","“What?” Huang Yueli was stunned,” I didn’t?”","She was stunned for a moment before she realized that something was wrong.” I just...” However, I didn’t eat any medicinal pills...”","She did have some pills on her that were meant to stimulate her potential. She had considered taking a few of them just now. Although these pills were harmful to the body and might even cause a drop in cultivation, it was still much better than both of them dying here.","However, the problem was that all the berserk pills relied on compressing the Profound Qi in the body to take effect. In this void, it was useless to eat it so she did not waste any effort.","Who knew that there would be a situation where his combat strength would increase?","Huang Yueli was distracted for a few breaths and was almost caught by the Devil Beast pouncing over from the right.","With a flick of her wrist, she swung her sword at an astonishing speed. With a flash of cold light, the Devil Beast died on the spot before it could even scream.","This speed wasn’t any slower than Li Moying who had been practicing the sword for many years.","However, Huang Yueli had no time to think about the reason.","The sudden increase in their abilities was a huge piece of good news for her and Li Moying.","She knew that this was the only turning point for the two of them and they had to seize it firmly. Therefore, after the sword attack, she slashed a few more times and quickly cleared the surrounding Devil Beasts.","Then, he took a deep breath and started running.","After an inexplicable breakthrough, not only did Huang Yueli’s attack speed increase by a few times, even her running speed had also increased by a lot.","With the combination of these two factors, the two of them finally returned to the grey fog smoothly.","Feeling the familiar energy gushing towards her, Huang Yueli let out a long breath and sat down on the ground, using her hand to wipe the sweat off her forehead.","She had started cultivating since she was three years old in her previous life. From the moment she had memories, she had never experienced the feeling of an ordinary person without Profound Qi.","This time, she had learned something new.","Huang Yueli turned around to take a look.","After the two of them entered the grey fog, there were still many Devil Beasts that followed them in relentlessly.","Unfortunately, the moment their bodies came into contact with the grey fog, they began to decay. They were quickly sucked dry and turned into ashes. None of them could approach them.","They were finally safe.","Huang Yueli heaved a sigh of relief as she hurriedly put Li Moying down from her back and turned around to check on his injuries.","“Husband, husband? How are you?”","As his back was injured, Li Moying lay face down on the ground.","Huang Yueli called out to him a few times but he didn’t move at all and didn’t give any response."]},{"number":4791,"title":"Chapter 4791: Strange Poison","paragraphs":["Chapter 4791: Strange Poison","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Just a quarter of an hour ago, Li Moying was still talking to her, asking her if she had taken the berserk pill.","Huang Yueli knew that something was wrong as her brows creased as she stretched out her hand without any hesitation, pulling apart Li Moying’s long black robe.","A sturdy and strong back was revealed in front of him.","Huang Yueli took a glance and couldn’t help but draw in a breath of cold air.","On her usually jade-like cold and fair skin, there was now a ferocious scar.","The wound was not particularly deep, but because it was a wound made by the Devil Beast’s sharp claws, the edge was torn quite badly.","Of course, this kind of wound to an ordinary person was already rather serious but to a practitioner like Li Moying, it could only be considered as a superficial wound. Although it was very painful at that time, but as long as he applied some healing ointment, he would be able to recover in two days.","What really made Huang Yueli’s face turn pale was that the blood flowing out of this wound wasn’t bright red, but was suffused with an obvious black colour.","Moreover, perhaps it had been delayed for too long, even the edge of the wound had gradually turned black.","The skin near the wound on his back even combined with the black blood and condensed into a crystal shape.","This crystal looked a little familiar...","Huang Yueli’s brows furrowed as she pondered for a moment before suddenly recalling something as her heart jolted.","“This seems to be similar to the black spherical crystal in the Energy Void...”","However, at this moment, there was no time for her to think about it.","Huang Yueli very quickly retrieved a few porcelain bottles from the Sky Phoenix Ring’s space and poured out a few pills from each bottle, stuffing them into Li Moying’s mouth.","As Li Moying’s entire body was already stiff, it was hard for him to swallow so Huang Yueli forcefully blocked his lips and forced him to swallow the pill.","Then, she took out a bottle of white powder.","When she opened the bottle cap, she obviously hesitated for a moment but in the end she gritted her teeth and tilted the bottle over, sprinkling the medicinal powder evenly on Li Moying’s wound.","Li Moying laid on the ground, still motionless.","This made Huang Yueli’s brows furrow even tighter.","This kind of medicinal powder had excellent healing effects and a strong detoxification effect. The only drawback was that it was too irritating. In order to achieve the effect of fighting poison with poison, the medicinal powder could not only reduce the pain of the injured, but it would also increase the pain of the wound by several times.","Huang Yueli hesitated because of this.","However, reality proved that she was thinking too much.","Even under the stimulation of such pain, Li Moying didn’t show any signs of waking up. He didn’t even twitch instinctively when he was unconscious...","“Damn it, what’s going on?” Huang Yueli stared at Li Moying’s pale face as her expression turned gloomy.","Now at least they could confirm that Li Moying had fainted in such a short period of time, it should be because of some unknown poison on the devil’s body.","So even if it was just a flesh wound, it was sufficient to take down a Dao Profound Realm powerhouse like Li Moying.","Moreover, this poison was a strange poison that had never been heard of before.","She had taken this bottle of medicinal powder from the treasure vault of the Phoenix clan. It was said that even if it was a lethal poison that could kill the throat at the sight of blood, as long as it was sprinkled within ten breaths after being injured, it could be saved.","But now, this entire bottle of medicinal powder was sprinkled on Li Moying’s wound but it could only slow down the speed of the black crystal forming on his skin."]},{"number":4792,"title":"Chapter 4792: Adventure","paragraphs":["Chapter 4792: Adventure","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli took out a few top grade pills and fed them to Li Moying one by one.","Unfortunately, the effect was still minimal.","Li Moying’s complexion gradually recovered from the deathly pale but there were no signs of him waking up.","The wound on his back was still bleeding at a slow rate. Every drop of blood that was exposed to the air would instantly condense into black crystals.","Huang Yueli had exhausted all the methods she could use but she still couldn’t find any effective methods.","This kind of strange poison that was born from nothingness did not exist in the twelve continents of the God Realm at all. Of course, there would not be any medicine that could cure it.","Huang Yueli knew that this couldn’t go on as her brows furrowed tightly. After pondering for a moment, she quickly made a decision.","“No, looks like we must leave this place immediately...”","If she wasn’t mistaken, the black crystal on Li Moying’s back was the same as the crystal in the Energy Void. It was formed by the fusion of various energies in the Devil Territory’s special environment.","As long as they could leave the Devil Territory and leave the special environment here, these black crystals would not be able to exist in the Twelve Continents where Profound Qi was abundant.","However, how to get out was a big problem.","“Looks like I can only take the risk.” Huang Yueli turned her head and quietly looked in the direction of the Energy Void as the expression on her face grew increasingly solemn.","Earlier when she and Li Moying were scouting around the boundary of the Devil Territory, she had already roughly analyzed the mechanism’s working principle and as for how to get out, she already had a rough plan.","However, this plan itself was very risky. No one could predict what kind of accidents it would cause.","She wanted to think about it carefully before taking action, but now, there was clearly not much time left for her.","If this dragged on, if Li Moying really died here, she would never be able to forgive herself...","Huang Yueli lowered her head and kissed Li Moying’s pale lips.","If it was any other time, her husband would have already taken the initiative to kiss her and impolitely kabedon her.","But now, she could only feel his cold body temperature, as if he was kissing a piece of thousand-year-old ice.","Huang Yueli’s heart tightened as she gritted her teeth and helped Li Moying put on his clothes again.","After thinking for a while, he took out a set of top-grade armor from his space and covered his body.","After that, she carried Li Moying on her back and used her belt to secure him firmly behind her back. Turning around, she walked towards the centre step by step.","The previous few times when she was near the Energy Void, Li Moying was there to open the furnace for her while Huang Yueli was only in charge of scouting the surroundings so the entire process was considered easy.","But now, it was her turn to bear the brunt of the impact, directly facing the energy impact that came from right in front of her. Huang Yueli finally felt how much pressure Li Moying had to endure the previous two times.","As she got closer and closer to the Energy Void, all kinds of energy surged towards her from all directions and tore at her in different directions. In this violent energy storm, she almost could not stand still, as if she could be torn into pieces at any time.","It was only a few hundred meters, but it seemed endless.","Huang Yueli inched forward step by step and not long after, her exposed skin had already been lacerated by the strong wind, causing countless wounds as fresh blood seeped out continuously. In the blink of an eye, it was blown away by the strong wind into the air, not even leaving behind a single trace."]},{"number":4793,"title":"Chapter 4793: Devil Qi","paragraphs":["Chapter 4793: Devil Qi","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","At this moment, Huang Yueli was extremely glad that she had put on a top grade armour for Li Moying. If not, Li Moying would not be able to use his Profound Qi to protect his body in his unconscious state and he would probably have died from the astral winds penetrating his body.","Huang Yueli gritted her teeth as she slowly advanced forward. However, when she was about thirty meters away from the centre, she couldn’t get any closer.","As long as she moved forward a little more, the energy storm would rush towards her. The intense pressure made it difficult for her to even breathe.","Huang Yueli bent down and lowered her body as she was forced to stop.","Thirty meters...","This distance was a little further than she had calculated at the beginning. She had thought that she would be at least 20 meters away from the center.","But now, with Li Moying behind her, she didn’t dare to risk her life.","Huang Yueli bit her lips, appearing somewhat hesitant.","But in the end, she still made up her mind.” I don’t care anymore. I can only take the risk!”","Huang Yueli’s right hand flipped and in just a blink of an eye, a palm sized, exquisite wooden box appeared in her palm.","There were exquisite array patterns drawn on the outside of the box. However, they were completely different from the array patterns commonly seen in the God Realm now.","If Li Moying was awake now, upon seeing this scene, he would definitely be facing a great enemy.","However, he was still unconscious so naturally he was unable to stop Huang Yueli from doing anything.","Huang Yueli’s expression was solemn as she narrowed her eyes slightly. Raising her arm, she used the cloak on her body to block the surrounding strong winds that were constantly attacking her. At the same time, her left hand’s five fingers quickly swept across the array markings, constantly changing the hand seals.","A few breaths later, a soft sound came from the box, and the lid slowly lifted up.","The moment the lid was opened, a black mist instantly surged out of the box, and a dense Devil Qi crazily spread out.","Due to the sudden surge of Devil Qi, the powerful impact acted on Huang Yueli’s hands and instantly caused countless cuts.","The intense pain made Huang Yueli lose all other senses as her hands kept trembling, almost smashing the box onto the ground.","However, no matter how uncomfortable she was, Huang Yueli still remembered her final goal in her heart. She used all her willpower and endured the pain of being cut into pieces as she held the box firmly in her palm. Under the immense pressure, she opened the lid completely.","A short quarter of an hour passed but to Huang Yueli, it felt as long as a few years.","Finally, the thick Devil Qi spread out a little, allowing her to vaguely see what was inside the box.","“So this is the legendary Devilic treasure, the Empyrean Devil Crystal! I didn’t expect it to be like this...”","Huang Yueli’s gaze fell onto the box as she couldn’t help but feel extremely emotional.","This piece of Empyrean Devil Crystal was obtained by her and Li Moying in Devil Overlord Ruiying’s cave dwelling.","At that time, they had only opened the box a crack and closed the lid without even seeing what was inside. This was because the Devil Qi contained in the box was too shocking. It was enough to turn the entire mountain range into a holy land of the Devil Clan. Once it was opened, no one knew what the consequences would be.","This wasn’t a power the two God Clans could control, so for safety reasons, they had originally wanted to seal the Empyrean Devil Crystal forever.","Who knew that it would actually be of use here today."]},{"number":4794,"title":"Chapter 4794: Can’t even shake it off","paragraphs":["Chapter 4794: Can’t even shake it off","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Ever since she discovered that the Energy Void was formed from the fusion of different types of energy, Huang Yueli had thought of this piece of Empyrean Devil Crystal.","Since all kinds of Spirit Armaments could fill up a part of the Energy Void, then this Devil secret treasure would definitely have a corresponding effect.","Moreover, the energy within the Empyrean Devil Crystal was abnormally abundant. It far exceeded the energy contained within ten Spirit Armaments, and it should be enough to completely break the energy balance within the black crystal.","As long as the balance was broken, the black crystal would shatter, and the various energies contained within would completely disintegrate and spread out. This Devil Territory would no longer exist.","The only thing that worried Huang Yueli was that with such a huge burst of energy, the traps that Saint Iniquitous Shadow had created might not be able to withstand such a huge impact and would be directly destroyed.","Then, this energy would be directly released outside the Cave Dwelling, and it would definitely cause a huge impact on the surrounding environment.","The nearby towns, including Forest Shade Town, could all be destroyed. There might even be casualties.","Precisely because of this concern, Huang Yueli had been hesitating.","But now that Li Moying was seriously injured and was about to fall here forever, she couldn’t care about it anymore.","Not to mention the possibility of destroying a few towns, even if the world was overturned, it would not be able to stop her from saving her husband!","Huang Yueli narrowed her eyes as her expression gradually became firm.","At this moment, she could clearly see that there was a palm-sized stone in the middle of the box.","Because the Empyrean Devil Crystal was constantly emitting black Devil Qi, Huang Yueli had subconsciously guessed that it should be black but the reality was totally different from her imagination. This piece of Empyrean Devil Crystal was completely transparent and colorless.","If it wasn’t for the Devil Qi surrounding her, she probably wouldn’t have been able to see that there was something in the middle.","Huang Yueli held her breath as she injected a surge of Devil Qi into her palm and waved it towards the Empyrean Devil Crystal.","She had used more than eighty percent of her strength. Logically speaking, even a rock weighing several thousand jin should have been turned to dust by her, but the Empyrean Devil Crystal still lay quietly in the middle of the box. It didn’t even move, let alone fly out.","Huang Yueli frowned as she increased her strength, directly gathering all the Evil Qi in her body together, as she struck out without holding back...","This time, the box finally shook slightly.","However, the stone inside was still lying flat.","Huang Yueli didn’t expect that at this point, there would actually be something unexpected happening and she instantly became anxious,” Even a piece of broken rock is going against me! Could it be that this stone is stuck to the bottom of the box?”","She wanted to throw the entire box out with the Empyrean Devil Crystal, but she found that she couldn’t even throw the box out. It was as if the Empyrean Devil Crystal was attached to her, and she couldn’t shake it off no matter how hard she tried.","Huang Yueli tried a few times but to no avail and she wanted to curse.","Was there a mistake?","She had only heard that powerful spiritual artifacts like life-bound Spirit Artifacts would recognize an owner. After submitting to an owner, they would accidentally drop it and find it again.","However, she had never heard of a treasure recognizing its owner!","More importantly, this Sky Devil Sacred Crystal was a treasure of the Devil Clan. If it wanted to recognize a master, it shouldn’t have found a Ancient God Clan like her!","This was too damn poisonous!"]},{"number":4795,"title":"Chapter 4795: The Only Chance","paragraphs":["Chapter 4795: The Only Chance","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","However, no matter how anxious Huang Yueli was, she couldn’t throw out the Empyrean Devil Crystal.","What was worse was that as they were too close to the Energy Void, the surrounding energy storm was too intense. Even though Li Moying was wrapped in a thick layer of top grade profound armor, but because he was unable to circulate his cultivation method to defend, he was still inevitably injured.","On Li Moying’s pale lips, a trickle of fresh blood flowed down, appearing exceptionally glaring.","Huang Yueli stretched out her hand to touch his face and it felt cold to the touch.","His body temperature was dropping rapidly, which was definitely a very dangerous signal.","Huang Yueli’s brows were tightly knitted together as she fell into a difficult decision.","Their only hope of escaping was to use Empyrean Devil Crystals to fill the Energy Void. They would need heaven-defying luck to survive the violent impact of the black crystal’s collapse.","However, this Sky Devil Sacred Crystal seemed to stick to her hand.","This also meant that she could only approach the Energy Void personally and directly stuff the Empyrean Devil Crystal inside.","This was easy to say, but it was as difficult as ascending to the heavens.","Every ten meters they got close to the Energy Void, the impact of the various energies around them doubled. They were still nearly thirty meters away from the center, but they had already reached the limit of the power they could resist.","If he continued to approach, or even walked to the side of the black crystal...","They would have to withstand an energy impact that was nearly ten times stronger than what they were experiencing now. This was almost certain that it would tear the two of them into pieces.","When the time came, everyone would be dead. What was the point of destroying the Devil Territory?","But if the two of them continued to stay here, Li Moying seemed like he wouldn’t even be able to hold on for 24 hours...","Huang Yueli’s eyes were deep as she stared at the Energy Void which was completely enveloped by the grey mist and pondered for a while.","Finally, she stretched out her hand to her back, preparing to untie the straps on Li Moying’s body and put him down, leaving him on the spot.","Thinking about it, the only chance for Li Moying to survive was to leave him here while she destroyed the black crystal alone.","Although this way, there was still a ninety percent chance that Li Moying wouldn’t be able to withstand the violent explosion that would happen later, but at least there was still a slight chance....","However, Huang Yueli had just untied a knot when she felt a chill on her shoulder.","Shocked, she gasped and quickly turned around.","Only then did she realise that Li Moying’s hand had unknowingly been placed on her shoulders. Furthermore, five slender and strong fingers were firmly gripping her slender shoulders, and no matter how hard she tried, she couldn’t break them off.","Huang Yueli almost thought that Li Moying had woken up.","But when she turned her head to look at the man lying on her back, she realised that Li Moying’s eyes were still tightly shut, not moving at all, even his breathing seemed to have stopped.","” Moying, Moying?!” Huang Yueli frowned as she called out his name in a low voice,” Are you awake? If you’re awake, move a little. Don’t scare me!”","Li Moying lowered his head as his body turned extremely stiff and his face turned pale.","When Huang Yueli saw this, she went to pull his fingers, wanting to put him down from behind.","But even though Li Moying was already like a lifeless ice sculpture, the strength of those few fingers was still shockingly strong and she couldn’t break it no matter what. If she used any more strength, it would break."]},{"number":4796,"title":"Chapter 4796 Paying a Price","paragraphs":["Chapter 4796 Paying a Price","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","For a moment, Huang Yueli didn’t know what to say.","Even though Li Moying was in a coma and had almost lost consciousness, he could actually feel her intention to abandon him.","Was this the result of two people sharing primordial spirits? Wasn’t the degree of telepathy a little too exaggerated?","However, no matter what she thought, she had no other choice.","Huang Yueli pulled Li Moying a few more times and after confirming that she couldn’t pull him away, she suddenly gritted her teeth,” Alright then, since you insist on being together with me, then...Then let’s go together! If he died just like that...At the very least, we can be a pair of mandarin ducks with the same fate.”","For cultivators like them who pursued the peak of cultivation, the probability of dying in the middle of their training was 99%. Only a small number of them could live their lives safely.","So Huang Yueli didn’t have much fear towards death.","On the contrary, the man she loved was by her side, and they would be together regardless of life or death...Thinking about it, it was worth it.","Huang Yueli’s character was decisive and since she had already made up her mind, she didn’t think too much about it and directly took out three sets of Profound Armors from her space.","These armors were obtained when he was training in Phoenix Tranquility Gorge and Devil Overlord Ruiying’s cave. They were all life-bound Spirit Armaments left behind by ancient experts.","These armors couldn’t be compared to the set that Li Moying was wearing and belonged to the second-grade Spirit Armament. Initially, Huang Yueli was planning to keep it and find an opportunity to sell it for money.","However, at this moment of life and death, these things were useless.","Huang Yueli decisively took it out and wore it layer by layer. Following that, she tapped her feet and with the help of the rich Heaven and Earth Profound Qi in the air, she leaped up and pounced towards the centre of the Energy Void.","She had just taken a step when all kinds of energy in the surroundings surged towards her crazily. The powerful impact hit her chest, causing her to almost spurt blood on the spot and fly backward.","Fortunately, she was wearing a Spirit Armament armor, which allowed her to barely withstand the attack. She only paused for a moment before she stabilized her body and rushed forward again.","However, she did pay a price.","Even though she had the armor to block it, several meridians in her chest were broken in an instant. Even her dantian felt a sharp pain, as if it would explode at any moment.","The outermost layer of armor that she was wearing let out a soft sound, and several cracks appeared on it.","Under the continuous impact of the surrounding strong winds, these cracks quickly spread out, and the entire armor instantly disintegrated!","In the blink of an eye, one of the priceless top-grade armors was destroyed.","But Huang Yueli didn’t even blink her eyes as she continued to use all her strength to charge forward.","“Chi la la...”","The sound of cloth being torn apart rang out continuously as the second and third layer of armor on Huang Yueli’s body were completely shattered within a few breaths.","At this moment, Huang Yueli was less than five meters away from the centre of the Energy Void.","She gritted her teeth and tightly gripped the box with the Empyrean Devil Crystal. She stretched out her arm as hard as she could while mobilizing all the strength in her body to resist the enormous force of impact and pounce at the black crystal.","Without the protection of the armor, the strong wind pierced through her chest like sharp blades.","Blood spurted out from her chest and fell on the black crystal."]},{"number":4797,"title":"Chapter 4797 Drained","paragraphs":["Chapter 4797 Drained","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","At the same time, the black crystal suddenly produced a powerful suction force.","Originally, Huang Yueli was resisting the huge resistance, wanting to send the Empyrean Devil Crystal into the Energy Void.","But now, the Empyrean Devil Crystal in her right hand was being pulled by the suction force and charged toward the black crystal at an astonishing speed.","“Clang...!”","A deafening crash was heard.","The Empyrean Devil Crystal moved faster and faster until it finally collided with the black crystal.","Because Huang Yueli had lost too much blood, her vision was already somewhat blurry and she could only vaguely see the Empyrean Devil Crystal and the black crystal clashing together in the swirling grey fog and following that, they shattered.","The entire world seemed to be shaken by such an impact, and the ground began to shake crazily.","The already intense energy storm in the surroundings instantly increased by several levels.","Huang Yueli was already exhausted and facing such a violent energy, she had no ability to resist and was directly flipped onto the ground.","The black and white crystals turned into countless fragments and were blown into the surrounding air by the strong wind.","Huang Yueli tried her best to open her eyes but she could only see the black and white crystal shards that filled the sky. In the energy storm mixed with lightning, they kept flickering, as though it was a night sky filled with stars, sparkling and dazzling.","However, these ” stars ” only looked beautiful.","Every single one of them was extremely dangerous. Just touching a little of them would be fatal.","Under the sweeping of the energy gales, these crystal fragments were blown in all directions. The sharp edges were like blades, enough to cut everything in their way into pieces.","Huang Yueli was already completely drained of her strength and the layers of Profound Armour on her body had completely cracked apart, which was equivalent to having no defence at all.","Therefore, she could only watch helplessly as these fragments pierced into her body.","Because these fragments were too small and shattered, she actually did not feel any pain. She only felt that something had entered her body and was constantly swimming in her meridians, but she was completely unable to control it!","These fragments traveled through her meridians for a week before entering her dantian and rushing straight to her head.","Huang Yueli felt dizzy as stars started to appear in front of her eyes.","In the end, he could not hold on any longer and fell to the ground.","Until the moment before she fainted, Huang Yueli was still extremely confused about the current situation.","She had imagined many things that might happen after the Empyrean Devil Crystal was absorbed by the Energy Void, but she never thought that the Empyrean Devil Crystal would directly shatter after colliding with the black crystal!","What was going on now? Had the Energy Void been filled?","However, it didn’t seem to have anything to do with them.","Under the combined effect of so many fragments, her and Li Moying’s ending was already destined, that was to be sliced into pieces by the crystal fragments, turning into minced meat...","Although she had gone through many years of experience and was already prepared to die in a foreign land, but she had not expected that she and Li Moying would die so miserably!","The only thing worth celebrating was...Now that they had fainted, they did not have to face their tragic deaths directly...","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli’s lips curled into a smile as she fainted completely.","Not long after, a violent lightning strike came from the sky."]},{"number":4798,"title":"Chapter 4798 Awakening","paragraphs":["Chapter 4798 Awakening","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Li ‘er? Li ‘er?”","In the darkness, a voice seemed to ring in his ears.","However, she was too tired and sleepy.","All the strength in her body seemed to have been drained.","Couldn’t he just let her sleep for a while?","Huang Yueli felt as though her body was floating in mid-air, wrapped in a ball of cotton, extremely comfortable.","She subconsciously closed her eyes tightly and pretended not to hear anyone calling her, determined to continue sleeping.","However, the person who called her was obviously anxious, and his voice became louder and louder.","“Li ‘er?! Li ‘er, can you hear my voice? Wake up, wake up, open your eyes and look at me! Don’t scare me...”","The man’s low voice gradually carried a hint of sobs.","Even though she was in a daze and could not remember where she had heard this voice before, when she heard the other party gasp, her heart suddenly ached.","She didn’t know why, but she wanted to get up immediately and hug this man to comfort him so that he wouldn’t be sad.","Otherwise, she would be even sadder...","“Li ‘er...”","The deep voice rang in her ears again, and the gentle ending made her ears go numb.","Huang Yueli’s heart skipped a beat as she suddenly opened her eyes.","A familiar handsome face appeared in front of him.","Huang Yueli was stunned for quite a while before she managed to regain her consciousness as she recognised that the man in front of her was her dear husband, Li Moying.","“You...”","She opened her mouth and wanted to speak, but a burning pain came from her throat and she couldn’t make a sound.","When Li Moying saw her open her eyes, his handsome face immediately revealed a surprised and delighted expression as he pounced over to hug her.","“Li ‘er, you... You’re finally awake! That’s great, that’s really great! You were unconscious for too long this time. You almost scared me to death...”","What Li Moying didn’t say was that if it wasn’t for the fact that Huang Yueli’s body was still warm to the touch, he would have thought that she had met with an accident and planned to accompany her.....","Although Huang Yueli had woken up, but her mind was still in a mess as she felt a wave of dizziness and from time to time, stars would appear in front of her.","After a while, he finally recovered a little.","She looked at Li Moying with a doubtful gaze.","If she didn’t remember wrongly, before she fainted, they were trapped in an ancient Devil Territory and Li Moying was seriously injured by the Devil Beast hidden in the void and fainted. In order to save Li Moying, she tried to use the Empyrean Devil Crystal to fill the Energy Void but...","She recalled the scene before she fainted. The black and white fragments that covered the entire space, the tiny crystals that kept shooting into her body like blades, and the pressure formed by the suffocating powerful energy...","It was like the end of the world.","No matter how he looked at it, it didn’t seem like a normal reaction of an Energy Void being filled.","It seemed like the plan had failed?","However, if they failed, what would happen to them now?","Why wasn’t she cut into pieces? Why did she wake up? Didn’t Li Moying lose consciousness long ago? Now, he was actually standing in front of her?","Huang Yueli subconsciously lowered her head to take a look and realised that there wasn’t a single scar on her body.","Her small hands were fair and tender, like a piece of art carved from jade.","The wounds caused by the countless crystal shards in the Devil Territory seemed to be all in her imagination."]},{"number":4799,"title":"Chapter 4799 Where Are We?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4799 Where Are We?","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli was dumbfounded as she looked at herself and then at Li Moying.","In her memory, Li Moying was also struck by countless crystal fragments during the process of the explosion.","But now, not only was there no wound on his body, she didn’t know if it was her imagination but she felt that Li Moying’s skin seemed to be better than before.","That cold jade-like fair skin seemed to be faintly glowing in this dark environment.","It even gave her a feeling that the man in front of her was not real, but condensed from the Profound Qi of heaven and earth.","“Husband, you...Are you alive?”","Huang Yueli hesitated for a moment before she stretched out her small hand and poked Li Moying’s face.","Li Moying was stunned for a moment before revealing a bitter smile,” Li ‘er, you.... What are you thinking about? Of course I’m alive. You’re alive too. We’re all alive and well! Otherwise, what did you see? You don’t think you’re dreaming, do you?”","Huang Yueli really nodded her head,” I just feel like I’m dreaming...When the Energy Void shattered, there was such a serious explosion. Under such a powerful energy impact, how could we survive? No matter how I think about it, it’s impossible...”","The more Huang Yueli thought about it, the more she felt that something wasn’t right.","Could it be that what she was seeing now was an illusion before she died?","When he heard Huang Yueli’s words, Li Moying was slightly startled and immediately frowned as he asked,” You said...” What explosion? Didn’t you use the Empyrean Devil Crystal to fill the hole in the energy and turn the Devil Territory into what it is now?”","“Wha...”","Huang Yueli subconsciously opened her mouth but she quickly reacted.","That’s right, when Li Moying was accompanying her to investigate the situation in the Devil Territory, he was ambushed by a Devil Beast hidden in the void and was injured, after that he had fallen unconscious.","When she approached the black crystal with her back against him and when the explosion happened, he was unconscious and did not know what had happened.","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli’s brows furrowed even tighter.","“Actually, after you fainted, a lot of things happened. I was worried that your life would be in danger if you continued to be unconscious. I had no choice but to take the risk...”","Huang Yueli briefly explained the situation at that time.","Although she had omitted many details, but just from those simple words, Li Moying could feel how soul-stirring the situation was.","He fell into deep thought after hearing this.’In that case, the Empyrean Devil Crystal contains too much devilish Qi. Not only did it successfully fill up the Energy Void, but the remaining devilish Qi also overflowed, causing the entire Devil Territory to collapse. All kinds of energy separated from the black crystal, triggering a violent energy storm...And then it became like this?”","“Now...How is it?”","Only at this moment did Huang Yueli recall that she still didn’t know where she was as she hurriedly turned around to look around.","After taking a few glances, she realized that the two of them were in a very strange environment. It was different from any place she had been to before.","The two of them seemed to be in a boundless wilderness, and the surroundings were abnormally quiet. The ground she was lying on was desolate yellow, and the sky above her was deep dark blue.","There were no stars in the sky, but it was filled with streams of light.","These streams of light were of different colors and filled the entire sky in a disorderly manner. The light shone on the ground."]},{"number":4800,"title":"Chapter 4800 A Myriad of Energies","paragraphs":["Chapter 4800 A Myriad of Energies","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli raised her head and looked up at the sky.","The flowing lights in the sky kept changing colors, and the halos they emitted shone on their bodies, giving them a warm feeling.","Huang Yueli quietly sensed for a while and revealed a surprised expression,” What exactly is this place? Why was there so much energy? Could it be...”","When she first woke up, she was too shocked to notice her surroundings.","It was only now that she realized that the surrounding air was filled with dense Devil Qi. It was even several times denser than what they had felt in the Devil Territory.","Moreover, there were other energies flowing within the Devil Qi.","She could even clearly feel a large amount of Heaven and Earth Profound Qi slowly entering her body with her breathing, repairing the damage in her meridians.","In addition, she also sensed the existence of Evil Qi, and the concentration was not low.","Such a situation really surprised Huang Yueli.","She had been in the God Realm for nearly three years, but she had never encountered a place where so many types of energy could coexist at the same time.","Even in the Devil Territory, although the grey fog was filled with energy of different attributes, these energies repelled each other and formed an intense energy storm that was enough to tear anyone who entered into pieces.","However, in the space they were in now, all the energy coexisted in harmony.","They interacted with each other, but they were also independent of each other. They did not interfere with each other.","Noticing Huang Yueli’s astonishment, Li Moying opened his mouth to speak:” You also realised that something is wrong here? I woke up a while earlier than you, so I’ve already checked the surroundings. This place seemed to be isolated from the world. It was an independent small realm, and it was filled with all kinds of energy. I couldn’t understand it before, but after hearing what happened when I was unconscious, I seem to understand a little.”","Huang Yueli finally recovered from her astonishment as she nodded her head,” You’ve thought of the same thing as me. I think this should be the small realm formed after the Empyrean Devil Crystal shattered the black crystal. I really didn’t expect that we would have such a fortuitous encounter.”","She stared into the sky with awe as she was soaked in emotions."]}]);
